貌、环境及生态非均衡转换 10. 2019-2022，上海市科委科研计划项目，儿童青少年脑智发育追踪研究 11. 2020-2021，教育部产学研项目，基于TAPD敏捷研发平台的软件工程创新课程体系建设 12. 2019-2020，上海市教委项目，上海数字教材自适应学习技术研究 13. 2019-2020，教育部产学研项目，华东师范大学人工智能教学实践平台建设项目 14. 2018-2021，横向合作华师大-七牛智能学习联合实验室(医疗影像数据的目标检测、图像分割、基因突变预测与医疗文本的命名实体识别) 15. 2015-2017：科技部科技支撑项目，贸易型第三方跨境电商服务支撑技术研究 ### 学术成果 【相关论文】 (1) Xinya Huang,Wenxin Hu*,Zhanhao Cui,Zheng Xiao,Xingjiao Wu,From Textbooks to Data: Generating High-Quality Domain-Specific QA Data with Large Language Models, ICIC 2025,CCF-C (2) Zhanhao Cui, Wenxin Hu*, Ye Wang, Xinya Huang, Wen Wu, Book2QA: A Framework for Integrating LLMs to Generate High-quality QA Data from Textbooks, IJCNN 2025, CCF-C (3) Ye Wang, Huazheng Pan, Tao Zhang, Wen Wu, Wenxin Hu* ,A Positive-Unlabeled Metric Learning Framework for Document-Level Relation Extraction with Incomplete Labeling, The 38th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2024),CCF-A (7) Hao Xu, Jing Yang, Jiahao Wang ,Wenxin Hu* ,BUILD A 50+ HOURS CHINESE MANDARIN CORPUS FOR CHILDREN’S SPEECH RECOGNITION, 2024 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing, ICASSP 2024,CCF-B (8) Shuwen Yang,Tianyu Huai,Wenxin Hu*,Liang He* ,Enhancing Out-of-Distribution Generalization in VQA through Gini Impurity-guided Adaptive Margin Loss, 2024 IEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo(ICME 2024),CCF-B (9) Junyi Le, Wenxin Hu*, Kun Yu ，A Two-stage Abdominal Lymph Node Detection Algorithm Based on Multi-scale 2.5D Input，The 29th IEEE International Conference on Parallel and Distributed Systems The 29th IEEE International Conference on Parallel and Distributed Systems (ICPADS 2023),CCF-C (10) Ye Wang, Xinxin Liu, Wenxin Hu*, Tao Zhang , A Unified Positive Unlabeled Learning Framework for Document Level Relation Extraction with Different Levels of Labeling, Proceedings of the 2022 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP 2022),CCF-B (11) Leyao Chen, Wei Zheng, and Wenxin Hu*, MTN-Net: A Multi-Task Network for Detection and Segmentation of Thyroid Nodules in Ultrasound Image, KNOWLEDGE SCIENCE, ENGINEERING AND MANAGEMENT (KSEM 2022) 2022,CCF-C (12) Weiping He, Wenxin Hu*, KunYu, Prediction of lymph node metastasis in CT based on multi-scale attention fully convolutional network, Conference Proceedings - IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man and Cybernetics (IEEE SMC 2022),CCF-C (13) Shaoze Chen; Su Wang; Wenxin Hu* ; Attention Guided Filter for Jointly Extracting Entities and Classifying Relation, The 33th International Conference on Software Engineering and Knowledge Engineering (SEKE 2021), 2022,CCF-C (14) Xukun Zhang; Wenxin Hu* ; Pyramid Focusing Network for mutation prediction and classification in CT images, APBC 2021,National Cheng Kung University, Tainan, Taiwan,2021，CCF-C (15) Wenxin Hu ; Accelerated Computation of Free Energy Profile at Ab Initio Quantum Mechanica l/Molecular Mechanics Accuracy via a Semiempirical Reference Potential. 3. Gaussian Smoothing on Density-of-States, Journal of Chemical Theory and Computation (JCTC), 2020, 16(11): 6814-6822 ,SCI 1区 (16) Xingjiao Wu; Yinbin Zheng; Hao Ye; Wenxin Hu* ; Counting Crowds with Varying Densities via Adaptive Scenario Discovery Framework, Neurocomputing, 2020, 397(45): 127-138,SCIE 2区 ### 荣誉及奖励 |\n\n| |\n\n| |\n\n| 10 访问 |\n\n| ### 相关教师 |	\N
