information and bi-directional cross-attention learning method for predicting drug–target interaction, BMC bioinformatics, vol. 24, no. 1, p. 323, 2023. L. Dou, Z. Zhang, Y. Qian, and Q. Zhang*, BCM-DTI: A fragment-oriented method for drug–target interaction prediction using deep learning, Computational Biology and Chemistry, vol. 104, p. 107844, 2023. Y. Qian, X. Li, J. Wu, A. Zhou, Z. Xu, and Q. Zhang*, Picture-word order compound protein interaction: Predicting compound-protein interaction using structural images of compounds, Journal of Computational Chemistry, vol. 43, no. 4, pp. 255-264, 2022. (封面论文). Y. Qian, J. Wu, and Q. Zhang*, CAT-CPI: Combining CNN and transformer to learn compound image features for predicting compound-protein interactions, Frontiers in Molecular Biosciences, Original Research vol. 9, 2022. Y. Qian, X. Li, Q. Zhang*, and J. Zhang*, SPP-CPI: Predicting Compound–Protein Interactions Based on Neural Networks, IEEE/ACM Transactions on Computational Biology and Bioinformatics, vol. 19, pp. 40-47, 2022. Z. Xu, Q. Zhang, J. Shi, and W. Zhu*, Underestimated Noncovalent Interactions in Protein Data Bank, Journal of chemical information and modeling, vol. 59, no. 8, pp:3389-3399, 2019. Qian Zhang, Zhijian Xu*, Jiye Shi, and Weiliang Zhu*, Underestimated Halogen Bonds Forming with Protein Backbone in Protein Data Bank, Journal of Chemical Information and Modeling, vol.57, no. 7, pp.1529-1534, 2017. (Top期刊) Qian Zhang, Zhijian Xu*, and Weiliang Zhu*, The Underestimated Halogen Bonds Forming with Protein Side Chains in Drug Discovery and Design, Journal of Chemical Information and Modeling, vol.57, no.1, pp.22-26, 2017. (Top期刊) ### 荣誉及奖励 教学 主讲的《计算机视觉》获2023-2024学年第一学期“最受学生欢迎研究生课程”, 华东师范大学 计算机科学与技术学院，2024.01 主讲的《计算机视觉》获2024-2025学年第一学期“最受学生欢迎研究生课程”, 华东师范大学 计算机科学与技术学院，2025.03 |\n\n| |\n\n| |\n\n| 10 访问 |\n\n| ### 相关教师 |	\N
