af1dc24d-0565-4c31-8d5d-f24297a0f1e8	b12df492-1016-4290-8c7a-56f94da0e118	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenrong.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenrong.html	7834aeeb067d316e767572dc74f2aa36	2026-10-22 06:16:43.979827+00	200	static	utf-8	647a05c6d2b48f8b7675b9d657321af8	# 陈榕-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n陈榕\n\n教授\n\n邮箱：rongchen@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：上海市东川路800号软件楼\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/rong_chen](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/rong_chen)\n\n个人简介\n\n陈榕，上海交通大学教授、ACM杰出会员。主要研究领域为操作系统、分布式系统等基础系统软件。在操作系统领域CCF A类会议和期刊发表论文40余篇（包括16篇OSDI/SOSP、15篇EuroSys/ATC论文），研究成果获得EuroSys（2次）、APSys和ICPP等国际会议最佳论文奖。担任本领域最重要期刊《ACM Transactions on Computer Systems》编委，受邀二十余次担任OSDI、SOSP等系统领域会议程序委员会委员。先后主持多项国家重点研发计划、自然科学基金等项目/课题，以及十余项企业合作项目。曾获2023年国家技术发明二等奖、2019年上海市技术发明一等奖、2018年教育部技术发明一等奖，以及2020年华为奥林帕斯先锋奖等。\n\n教授课程\n\n- Introduction to Computer Systems: 2025–2012\n\n- Operating Systems: 2018, 2017, 2015, 2013\n\n- Distributed Systems: 2016, 2015, 2014\n\n- Advanced Distributed Systems: 2025–2017, 2013, 2012\n\n- Computer System Design & Implementation: 2019, 2018, 2017\n\n论文发表\n\n- [EuroSys] KunServe: Parameter-centric Memory Management for Efficient Memory Throttling Handling in LLM Serving. Rongxin Cheng, Yuxin Lai, Xingda Wei, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 21th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Edinburgh, UK, April 2026.\n\n- [SOSP] PhoenixOS: Concurrent OS-level GPU Checkpoint and Restore with Validated Speculation. Xingda Wei, Zhuobin Huang, Tianle Sun, Yingyi Hao, Rong Chen*, Mingcong Han, Jinyu Gu, and Haibo Chen. The 31st Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, Seoul, Republic of Korea, October 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] XSched: Preemptive Scheduling for Diverse XPUs. Weihang Shen, Mingcong Han, Jialong Liu, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] BlitzScale: Fast and Live Large Model Autoscaling with O(1) Host Caching. Dingyan Zhang, Haotian Wang, Yang Liu, Xingda Wei, Yizhou Shan, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Colocating ML Inference and Training with Fast GPU Memory Handover. Jiali Wang, Yankui Wang, Mingcong Han, and Rong Chen*. 2025 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] KVCache Cache in the Wild: Characterizing and Optimizing KVCache Cache at a Large Cloud Provider. Jiahao Wang, Jinbo Han, Xingda Wei, Sijie Shen, Dingyan Zhang, Chenguang Fang, Rong Chen, Wenyuan Yu, and Haibo Chen. 2025 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] Fast and Scalable In-network Lock Management Using Lock Fission. Hanze Zhang, Ke Cheng, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2024.\n\n- [EuroSys] Serialization/Deserialization-free State Transfer in Serverless Workflows. Fangming Lu, Xingda Wei, Zhuobin Huang, Rong Chen, Mingyu Wu, and Haibo Chen. The 19th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Athens, Greece, April 2024. Best Paper Award\n\n- [SOSP] UGACHE: A Unified GPU Cache for Embedding-based Deep Learning Systems. Xiaoniu Song, Yiwen Zhang, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 29th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, Koblenz, Germany, October 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] No Provisioned Concurrency: Fast RDMA-codesigned Remote Fork for Serverless Computing. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Tianxia Wang, Jinyu Gu, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Characterizing Off-path SmartNIC for Accelerating Distributed Systems. Xingda Wei, Rongxin Cheng, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Automated Verification of Idempotence for Stateful Serverless Applications. Haoran Ding, Zhaoguo Wang, Zhuohao Shen, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Bridging the Gap between Relational OLTP and Graph-based OLAP. Sijie Shen, Zihang Yao, Lin Shi, Lei Wang, Longbin Lai, Qian Tao, Li Su, Rong Chen*, Wenyuan Yu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, and Jingren Zhou. 2023 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Microsecond-scale Preemption for Concurrent GPU-accelerated DNN Inferences. Mingcong Han, Hanze Zhang, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 16th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Carlsbad, CA, US, July 2022.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] KRCORE: A Microsecond-scale RDMA Control Plane for Elastic Computing. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. 2022 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Carlsbad, CA, US. July 2022.\n\n- [EuroSys] GNNLab: A Factored System for Sample-based GNN Training over GPUs. Jianbang Yang, Dahai Tang, Xiaoniu Song, Lei Wang, Qiang Yin, Rong Chen*, Wenyuan Yu, and Jingren Zhou. The 17th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Rennes, France, April 2022. Best Artifact Award (Honorable Mention)\n\n- [OSDI] Retrofitting High Availability Mechanism to Tame Hybrid Transaction/Analytical Processing. Sijie Shen, Rong Chen*, Haibo Chen, and Binyu Zang. The 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2021.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Characterizing and Optimizing Remote Persistent Memory with RDMA and NVM. Xingda Wei, Xiating Xie, Rong Chen*, Haibo Chen, and Binyu Zang. 2021 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, July 2021.\n\n- [EuroSys] FlexGraph: A Flexible and Efficient Distributed Framework for GNN Training. Lei Wang, Qiang Yin, Chao Tian, Jianbang Yang, Rong Chen*, Wenyuan Yu, Zihang Yao, and Jingren Zhou. The 16th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Edinburgh, Scotland, UK, April 2021.\n\n- [NSDI] Unifying Timestamp with Transaction Ordering for MVCC with Decentralized Scalar Timestamp. Xingda Wei, Rong Chen*, Haibo Chen, Zhaoguo Wang, Zhenhan Gong, and Binyu Zang. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, April 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Fast RDMA-based Ordered Key-Value Store using Remote Learned Cache. Xingda Wei, Rong Chen*, and Haibo Chen. The 14th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Banff, Alberta, Canada, November 2020.\n\n获奖信息\n\n- ACM Distinguished Member, 2024\n\n- Best Paper Award of EuroSys, 2024\n\n- Second Prize of the State Technological Invention Award, 2023\n\n- Honorable Mention of Gilles Muller Best Artifact Award of EuroSys, 2022\n\n- Honorable Mention of Dennis M. Ritchie Doctoral Dissertation Award (Co-advisor), 2021\n\n- CCF Distinguished Member, 2021\n\n- Young Scholar of Chang Jiang Scholars Program by Ministry of Education, 2021.\n\n- Huawei OlympusMons Pioneer Award, 2020\n\n- First Prize of Shanghai Science and Technology Award for Technical Invention, 2019\n\n- First Prize of Technology Invention Award by Ministry of Education, 2018\n\n- ACM ChinaSys Rising Star, 2018\n\n- Best Paper Award of APSys, 2017\n\n- Excellent Bachelor Thesis (Top 1%) of SJTU (Supervisor), 2017\n\n- Best Paper Award of EuroSys, 2015\n\n- Excellent Bachelor Thesis (Top 1%) of SJTU (Supervisor), 2014\n\n- Best Paper Award of ICPP, 2007\n\n学术服务\n\nProgram Committee Members\n\n- OSDI: USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation: 2025, 2022, 2021, 2020\n\n- SOSP: ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles: 2024, 2023\n\n- EuroSys: European Conference on Computer Systems: 2026, 2025, 2024, 2023, 2015\n\n- USENIX ATC: USENIX Annual Technical Conference: 2024, 2017\n\n- FAST: USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies: 2023, 2022\n\n- ASPLOS: ACM Intl. Conf. on Arch. Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems: 2026, 2025, 2024, 2023, 2018\n\n- NSDI: USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation: 2024\n\nJournal Editorship\n\n- Associate Editor: ACM Transactions on Computer Systems (2024–now)\n\n- Editorial Board of Young Scientists: Journal of Computer Science and Technology (2023–now)\n\n- Youth Editorial Board Members: CCF Transactions on High Performance Computing (2023–now)\n\n- Editor of Columns: Communications of the CCF (2023–2025)	\N
0812b08d-9bab-420a-9b30-a3731366cbc6	142141f5-c1e4-43c2-91cf-9f286bedbe8b	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenhaibo.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenhaibo.html	b173b86e9777499bb6f2bd20a9380f80	2026-10-22 06:16:51.137395+00	200	static	utf-8	73b0f5ef0c0201958a19a0e809450a2d	# 陈海波-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n陈海波\n\n特聘教授\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://ipads.sjtu.edu.cn/haibo_chen](https://ipads.sjtu.edu.cn/haibo_chen)\n\n个人简介\n\n上海交通大学特聘教授、校务委员会委员、领域操作系统教育部工程研究中心主任、人工智能操作系统研究院院长。 国家杰出青年基金获得者、ACM Fellow、IEEE Fellow、CCF Fellow，主要研究领域为操作系统、分布式系统与系统安全，研究成果通过产学研深度结合被应用到数十亿设备，产生了广泛的学术与产业影响。曾获中国计算机学会科技进步特等奖、陈嘉庚青年科学奖（信息技术科学奖）、中国青年科技奖、教育部技术发明一等奖、全国优秀博士学位论文奖等。目前担任开源鸿蒙项目群技术指导委员会主席、ACM SIGOPS首位非北美学者主席、ACM旗舰杂志Communications of the ACM首位中国学者编委与领域共同主席，曾任ACM EuroSys 2025程序委员会共同主席、ACM SIGOPS ChinaSys主席、ACM SOSP 2017年大会联席主席、《ACM Transactions on Storage》编委等。研究工作还获得了华为卓越贡献个人奖、SOSP、ASPLOS、EuroSys、VEE等最佳论文奖以及DSN“时间检验奖”、《Communications of the ACM》研究亮点奖等。按照csrankings.org的统计，其近十年在操作系统领域顶会SOSP/OSDI上发表的论文数居世界第一。主持撰写的《现代操作系统：原理与实现》获得了2020年度“最受读者喜爱的IT图书奖”与2022年上海交通大学优秀本科生教材奖（新版更名为《操作系统：原理与实现》）、以及机工科技--2023年度计算机领域十大好书，被高校、科研机构与企业广泛采用。\n\n教育背景\n\n2004.9 - 2009.1 复旦大学 计算机系统结构 博士 （获全国优博）\n\n2000.9 - 2004.7 复旦大学 计算机科学与技术 本科\n\n工作履历\n\n2011.9 - 现在 上海交通大学 教授、长聘教授、特聘教授\n\n2009.4 - 2011.12 复旦大学 讲师\n\n教授课程\n\n操作系统\n\n论文发表\n\n- [FAST] Sharpen the Spec, Cut the Code: A Case for Generative File System with SYSSPEC. Qingyuan Liu, Mo Zou, Hengbin Zhang, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. The 24th USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies, Santa Clara, CA, USA, February, 2026. (Erik Riedel Best Paper Award and Distinguished Artifact Award)\n\n- [SOSP] How to Copy Memory? Coordinated Asynchronous Copy as a First-ClassOSService. Jingkai He, Yunpeng Dong, Dong Du, Mo Zou, Zhitai Yu, Yuxin Ren, Ning Jia , Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 31th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles (SOSP'25). Seoul, Republic of Korea, October 13 – 16, 2025. (Best Paper Award).\n\n- [CACM] Many Faces of Ad Hoc Transactions. Chuzhe Tang, Zhaoguo Wang, Xiaodong Zhang, Qianmian Yu, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, and Haibo Chen. Communications of the ACM (Research Highlight & Cover Article) 68, 4, 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] Yuanpei Wu, Dong Du, Chao Xu, Yubin Xia, Ming Fu, Yang Yu, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen.OSRendering Service Made Parallel with Out-of-Order Execution and In-Order Commit. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] Preemptive Scheduling for Diverse XPUs using Multi-level Hardware Model. Weihang Shen, Mingcong Han, Jialong Liu, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] Fast and Live Model Auto Scaling without Caching. Dingyan Zhang, Haotian Wang, Yang Liu, Xingda Wei, Yizhou Shan, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [SOSP] PowerInfer: Fast Large Language Model Serving with a Consumer-grade GPU. Yixin Song, Zeyu Mi, Haotong Xie, Haibo Chen. The 30th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, Texas, USA, November 2024.\n\n- [OSDI] Microkernel Goes General: Performance and Compatibility in the HongMeng Production Microkernel. Haibo Chen, Xie Miao, Ning Jia, Nan Wang, Yu Li, Nian Liu, Yutao Liu, Fei Wang, Qiang Huang, Kun Li, Hongyang Yang, Hui Wang, Jie Yin, Yu Peng, and Fengwei Xu. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2024.\n\n- [OSDI] Using Dynamically Layered Definite Releases for Verifying the RefFS File System. Mo Zou, Dong Du, Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2024.\n\n- [OSDI] Fast and Scalable In-network Lock Management Using Lock Fission. Hanze Zhang, Ke Cheng, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2024.\n\n- [EuroSys] Serialization/Deserialization-free State Transfer in Serverless Workflows. Fangming Lu, Xingda Wei, Zhuobin Huang, Rong Chen, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 19th European Conference on Computer Systems (Best Paper Award), Athens, Greece, April, 2024\n\n- [Nature] DNA-based programmable gate arrays for general-purpose DNA computing. Hui Lv, Nuli Xie, Mingqiang Li, Mingkai Dong, Chenyun Sun, Qian Zhang, Lei Zhao, Jiang Li, Xiaolei Zuo, Haibo Chen, Fei Wang & Chunhai Fan. Nature (2023). September, 2023.\n\n- [SOSP] TreeSLS: A Tree-structured Microkernel with Efficient Whole-system Persistence on NVM. Fangnuo Wu, Mingkai Dong, Gequan Mo, Haibo Chen. The 29th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles (Best Paper Award), Koblenz, Germany, October 2023.\n\n- [SOSP] UGACHE: A Unified GPU Cache for Embedding-based Deep Learning Systems. Xiaoniu Song, Yiwen Zhang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 29th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, Koblenz, Germany, October 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Automated Verification of Idempotence for Stateful Serverless Applications. Haoran Ding, Zhaoguo Wang, Zhuohao Shen, Rong Chen, Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Security and Performance in the Delegated User-level Virtualization. Jiahao Chen, Dingji Li, Zeyu Mi, Yuxuan Liu, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] No Provisioned Concurrency: Fast RDMA-codesigned Remote Fork for Serverless Computing. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Tianxia Wang, Jinyu Gu, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Characterizing Off-path SmartNIC for Accelerating Distributed Systems. Xingda Wei, Rongxin Cheng, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen, Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Encrypted Databases Made Secure Yet Maintainable. Mingyu Li, Xuyang Zhao, Le Chen, Cheng Tan, Huorong Li, Sheng Wang, Zeyu Mi, Yubin Xia, Feifei Li, Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- OSDI] BWoS: Formally Verified Block-based Work Stealing for Parallel Processing. Jiawei Wang, Bohdan Trach, Ming Fu, Diogo Behrens, Jonathan Schwender, Yutao Liu, Jitang Lei, Viktor Vafeiadis, Hermann Härtig and Haibo Chen. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] Microsecond-scale Preemption for Concurrent GPU-accelerated DNN Inferences. Mingcong Han, Hanze Zhang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. The 16th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Carlsbad, CA, US, July 2022.\n\n- [SOSP] TwinVisor: Hardware-isolated Confidential Virtual Machines for ARM. Dingji Li, Zeyu Mi, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen, Haibing Guan. The 28th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles. October 25-28, 2021.\n\n- [SOSP] CLoF: A Compositional Lock Framework for Multi-level NUMA Systems. Rafael Chehab, Antonio Paolillo, Diogo Behrens, Ming Fu, Hermann Härtig, Haibo Chen. The 28th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles. Deerhurst Resort, Huntsville, October 25-28, 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Erhu Feng, Xu Lu, Dong Du, Bicheng Yang, Xueqiang Jiang, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Scalable Memory Protection in the PENGLAI Enclave. The 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Sijie Shen, Rong Chen, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. Retrofitting High Availability Mechanism to Tame Hybrid Transaction/Analytical Processing. The 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Mingyu Li, Tianxu Zhang, Jinhao Zhu, Cheng Tan, Yubin Xia, Sebastian Angel, Haibo Chen. Bringing Decentralized Search to Decentralized Services. 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Jiachen Wang, Ding Ding, Huan Wang, Conrad Christensen, Zhaoguo Wang, Haibo Chen, Jinyang Li. Polyjuice: High-Performance Transactions via Learned Concurrency Control. The 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, 2021.\n\n- [ASPLOS] VSync: Push-Button Verification and Optimization for Synchronization Primitives on Weak Memory Models. J. Oberhauser, R. Chehab, D. Behrens, M. Fu, A. Paolillo, L. Oberhauser, K. Bhat, Y. Wen, H. Chen, J. Kim, V. Vafeiadis. The 26th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems (Distinguished Paper Award), April, 2021.\n\n- [OSDI] Fast RDMA-based Ordered Key-Value Store using Remote Learned Cache. Xingda Wei, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 14th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Banff, Alberta, Canada, November 2020.\n\n- [SOSP] Performance and Protection in the ZoFS User-space NVM File System. Mingkai Dong, Heng Bu, Jifei Yi, Benchao Dong, Haibo Chen. The 27th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles. Deerhurst Resort, Huntsville, Ontario, Canada, October 27-30, 2019.\n\n- [SOSP] Using Concurrent Relational Logic with Helper for Verifying the AtomFS File System. Mo Zou, Haoran Ding, Dong Du, Ming Fu, Ronghui Gu, Haibo Chen. The 27th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles. Deerhurst Resort, Huntsville, Ontario, Canada, October 27-30, 2019.\n\n获奖信息\n\n- USENIX FAST 2026 Erik Riedel Best Paper Award and Distinguished Artifact Award.\n\n- ACM SOSP 2025最佳论文奖\n\n- 《Communications of the ACM》研究亮点（2025）\n\n- ACM EuroSys 2024最佳论文奖\n\n- CCF Fellow (2024年入选)\n\n- ACM Fellow（2023年入选）\n\n- ACM SOSP 2023最佳论文奖\n\n- 2023年ACM SIGMOD研究亮点奖\n\n- 2022年上海交通大学本科优秀教材一等奖（获奖教材为《现代操作系统：原理与实现》）\n\n- 2022年度陈嘉庚青年科学奖（信息技术科学）\n\n- IEEE Fellow（2022年入选）\n\n- IEEE/IFIP DSN 2022时间检验奖\n\n- ACM SIGMOD 2022最佳论文优胜奖\n\n- 2021 Dennis M. Ritchie Thesis Award (Advisor)优胜奖\n\n- ACM ASPLOS 2021杰出论文奖\n\n- 2020年度最受读者喜爱的IT图书奖（《现代操作系统：原理与实现》）\n\n- 2020年中国青年科技奖\n\n- 2020年上海交通大学校长奖\n\n- 2019年国家杰出青年基金\n\n- ACM VEE 2019最佳论文奖\n\n- 2018年度教育部技术发明一等奖\n\n- ACM APSys 2017最佳论文奖\n\n- 2017 CCF NASAC-东软青年软件创新奖\n\n- 2015 中国计算机学会青年科学家奖\n\n- 国家万人计划“青年拔尖人才计划”\n\n- ACM EuroSys 2015最佳论文奖\n\n- HPCA 2014最佳论文提名奖\n\n- 2014 国家科技进步二等奖\n\n- ACM SIGSPATIAL GIS CUP, 2013年冠军; 2014年季军\n\n- ACM APSys 2013最佳论文奖\n\n- 2013年度教育部“新世纪优秀人才支持计划”\n\n- 2011年全国百篇优秀博士学位论文奖\n\n- 2009年中国计算机学会博士学位论文奖\n\n- 2007年ICPP最佳论文奖\n\n学术服务\n\n- 学术组织&学术会议\n\n- ACM SIGOPS主席 (2023.7 - 2027.6)\n\n- ACM ASPLOS 2028 (大会共同主席)\n\n- ACM EuroSys: 2025（程序委员会共同主席）\n\n- SOSP: 2017 (大会主席 with Lidong Zhou), 2013 (注册主席 with Li Zhuang)\n\n- APSys: 2015-2020 (指导委员会主席 with Lorenzo Alvisi), 2014 (程序委员会主席 with Lorenzo Alvisi), 2011 (程序委员会主席 with Zheng Zhang)\n\n- ChinaSys: 2011至今 (联合创始人, 理事), 2018-2022 (大会主席)\n\n- CCS: 2018 (系统安全领域主席)\n\n- ASPLOS: 2020 (赞助者共同主席)\n\n- ICDCS: 2020 (程序委员会副主席)\n\n- 程序委员会委员\n\n- SOSP: 2025, 2023, 2021, 2019, 2017, 2015, 2013\n\n- OSDI: 2026, 2025, 2024\n\n- ASPLOS: 2024 (ERC), 2023, 2022, 2020, 2019, 2017\n\n- EuroSys: 2023, 2022, 2021, 2019, 2017, 2016, 2014, 2013\n\n- Usenix ATC: 2019, 2017, 2016, 2015, 2014, 2012\n\n- Oakland: 2020, 2018, 2017, 2016\n\n- CCS: 2019, 2018, 2017\n\n- HotOS: 2021\n\n- NDSS: 2020\n\n- SoCC: 2020\n\n- PPoPP: 2016\n\n- ISCA: 2022, 2016\n\n- FAST: 2017\n\n- 期刊&杂志编辑\n\n- 编辑、领域联席主席: Communications of the ACM (2019至今)\n\n- 副