5477fb0c-ea28-41f9-bb8f-5baa3059bd49	92b7eccb-b82f-4997-8858-f9309fc8aadb	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dongmingkai.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dongmingkai.html	d2d8eff567a35cb6a9d338a0b99cc7b9	2026-10-22 06:16:59.37687+00	200	static	utf-8	d9b6c96bc6dc5d7d3b24b8544b1f1c87	# 董明凯-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n董明凯\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：mingkaidong@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://dong.mk](https://dong.mk)\n\n个人简介\n\n上海交通大学并行与分布式系统研究所（IPADS）副研究员，分别于2015年和2021年获得上海交通大学学士和博士学位。主要研究方向为操作系统、文件与存储系统、DNA存储与计算，相关工作发表在FAST、USENIX ATC、SOSP等操作系统顶级国际会议。曾获SOSP2023最佳论文奖、2022年华为“火花奖”、英特尔中国学术英才计划2022年度荣誉学者、2020年华为奥林帕斯先锋奖。其研制的高性能持久内存文件系统SoupFS进入OpenEuler操作系统创新版；与华为合作的EROFS成为首个合入Linux内核主线的国人自主研发的文件系统，并已经成为Android系统分区的官方文件系统，运行在亿级智能手机之中。\n\n更多以及最新信息请见 [https://dong.mk](https://dong.mk)\n\n教育背景\n\n2011.09 - 2015.06 上海交通大学 软件工程 学士\n\n2015.09 - 2021.06 上海交通大学 计算机科学与技术 博士\n\n工作履历\n\n2021.08 - 2024.12 上海交通大学 电子信息与电气工程学院 助理研究员\n\n2025.01 - 至今 上海交通大学 计算机学院 副研究员\n\n教授课程\n\n本科生课程\n\n- SE127/SE1301 软件基础实践 (2019-2025)\n\n- SE232/SE2322 高级数据结构 (2020-2025 春季)\n\n- CS3601 操作系统 (2024-2025 秋季)\n\n- CS1501 程序设计思想与方法 (2021-2023 秋季)\n\n研究生课程\n\n- EI6711 高级操作系统 (2022-2025 春季)\n\n论文发表\n\nEuroSys '26\n\nSwitchFS: Asynchronous Metadata Updates for Distributed Filesystems with In-Network Coordination. Jingwei Xu, Mingkai Dong, Qiulin Tian, Ziyi Tian, Tong Xin and Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 21th European Conference on Computer Systems (EuroSys '26), Edinburgh, UK, April, 2026.\n\nNSDI '26\n\nFalconFS: Distributed File System for Large-Scale Deep Learning Pipeline. Jingwei Xu, Junbin Kang, Mingkai Dong, Mingyu Liu, Lu Zhang, Shaohong Guo, Ziyan Qiu, Mingzhen You, Ziyi Tian, Anqi Yu, Tianhong Ding, Xinwei Hu, and Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 23rd USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation (NSDI '26), Renton, WA, USA, May 4–6, 2026.\n\nFAST '25\n\nLiquid-State Drive: A Case for DNA Block Device for Enormous Data. Jiahao Zhou, Mingkai Dong, Fei Wang, Jingyao Zeng, Lei Zhao, Chunhai Fan, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 23rd USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies (FAST '25), Santa Clara, CA, US, February, 2025.\n\nOSDI '24\n\nUsing Dynamically Layered Definite Releases for Verifying the RefFS File System. Mo Zou, Dong Du, Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen.In Proceedings of the 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation (OSDI '24), Santa Clara, CA, US, July, 2024.\n\nSOSP '23Best Paper Award!\n\nTreeSLS: A Tree-structured Microkernel with Efficient Whole-system Persistence on NVM. Best Paper Award! Fangnuo Wu, Mingkai Dong, Gequan Mo, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 29th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles (SOSP '23), Koblenz, Germany, Octobar 23-26, 2023.\n\nNature\n\nDNA-based programmable gate arrays for general-purpose DNA computing. Hui Lv, Nuli Xie, Mingqiang Li, Mingkai Dong, Chenyun Sun, Qian Zhang, Lei Zhao, Jiang Li, Xiaolei Zuo, Haibo Chen, Fei Wang, Chunhai Fan. Nature (2023).\n\nFAST '22\n\nHTMFS: Strong Consistency Comes for Free with Hardware Transactional Memory in Persistent Memory File Systems. Jifei Yi, Mingkai Dong, Fangnuo Wu, Haibo Chen. In the 20th USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies (FAST '22), Santa Clara, CA, USA, February 22-24, 2022.\n\nFAST '22\n\nMT^2: Memory bandwidth Regulation on Hybrid NVM/DRAM Platforms. Jifei Yi, Benchao Dong, Mingkai Dong, Ruizhe Tong, Haibo Chen. In the 20th USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies (FAST '22), Santa Clara, CA, USA, February 22-24, 2022.\n\nAPSys '20\n\nOn the Precision of Precise Event Based Sampling. Jifei Yi, Benchao Dong, Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 11th Asia-Pacific Workshop on Systems (APSys '20), Tsukuba, Japan, August 2020.\n\nSOSP '19\n\nPerformance and Protection in the ZoFS User-space NVM File System. Mingkai Dong, Heng Bu, Jifei Yi, Benchao Dong, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 27th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles (SOSP '19), Ontario, Canada, October 2019.\n\nATC '19\n\nEROFS: A Compression-friendly Readonly File System for Resource-scarce Device. Xiang Gao, Mingkai Dong, Xie Miao, Wei Du, Chao Yu, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 2019 USENIX Annual Technical Conference (USENIX ATC '19), Renton, WA, USA, July 2019.\n\nATC '17\n\nSoft Updates Made Simple and Fast for Non-volatile Memories. Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 2017 USENIX Annual Technical Conference (USENIX ATC '17), Santa Clara, CA, USA, July 2017.\n\nToS\n\nEfficient and Available In-memory KV-Store with Hybrid Erasure Coding and Replication. Haibo Chen, Heng Zhang, Mingkai Dong, Zhaoguo Wang, Yubin Xia, Haibing Guan and Binyu Zang. ACM Transactions on Storage, 2017.\n\nAPSys '16\n\nRethinking Benchmarking for NVM-based File Systems. Mingkai Dong, Qianqian Yu, Xiaozhou Zhou, Yang Hong, Haibo Chen and Binyu Zang. In Proceedings of the 7th Asia-Pacific Workshop on Systems (APSys '16), Hong Kong, China, August 2016.\n\nFAST '16\n\nEfficient and Available In-memory KV-Store with Hybrid Erasure Coding and Replication. Heng Zhang, Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen. In Proceedings of the 14th USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies (FAST '16), Santa Clara, CA, USA, February 2016.\n\nCAL\n\nPersistent Transactional Memory. Zhaoguo Wang, Han Yi, Ran Liu, Mingkai Dong and Haibo Chen. IEEE Computer Architecture Letters, 2015.\n\n获奖信息\n\nSOSP2023最佳论文奖、2022年华为“火花奖”、英特尔中国学术英才计划2022年度荣誉学者、2020年华为奥林帕斯先锋奖\n\n学术服务\n\n担任 OSDI(2025)、FAST(2025,2026)、ASPLOS(2025,2026)、NSDI(2025) 程序委员会委员	\N
a2f804a0-c2f0-4aca-8923-a98e0587476b	68593e6d-68e9-4221-9128-d28d53a3197c	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dudongdong.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dudongdong.html	4dff7e78eef40b304af0c2b3b938bcd3	2026-10-22 06:17:08.24592+00	200	static	utf-8	b11aa210c633589ac62028a5e405dd4c	# 杜冬冬-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n杜冬冬\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：Dd_nirvana@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：上海市闵行区东川路 800 号上海交通大学软件学院3402 房间\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://dongd.info/](https://dongd.info/)\n\n个人简介\n\n杜冬冬（Dong Du），上海交通大学副研究员。中国计算机学会CCF会员，ACM会员。研究方向为操作系统与体系结构、模型原生系统、智能体系统、服务器无感知（Serverless）计算、系统安全。在操作系统领域顶会OSDI、SOSP以及体系结构四大顶会ASPLOS、ISCA、MICRO、HPCA发表/录用多篇学术论文。获SOSP 2025 最佳论文奖、FAST 2026 最奖论文奖和 Distinguished Artifact Award。\n\n教育背景\n\n2017.09 - 2022.06 上海交通大学 计算机科学与技术 博士\n\n2013.09 - 2017.06 上海交通大学 软件工程 学士\n\n工作履历\n\n2022.08 - 2025.12 上海交通大学 助理研究员\n\n2026.1-至今 上海交通大学 副研究员\n\n教授课程\n\n《云操作系统设计与实践》（本科生）、《软件基础实践》（本科生）、《计算机系统设计和实现：OpenHarmony》（研究生）\n\n论文发表\n\n- [OSDI] OS Rendering Service Made Parallel with Out-of-Order Execution and In-Order Commit. Yuanpei Wu, Dong Du, Chao Xu, Yubin Xia, Ming Fu, Yang Yu, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [OSDI] Fork in the Road: Reflections and Optimizations for Cold Start Latency in Production Serverless Systems. Xiaohu Chai, Tianyu Zhou, Keyang Hu, Jianfeng Tan, Tiwei Bie, Anqi Shen, Dawei Shen, Qi Xing, Shun Song, Tongkai Yang, Le Gao, Feng Yu, Zhengyu He, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Kang Chen, Yu Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2025.\n\n- [ASPLOS] D-VSync: Decoupled Rendering and Displaying for Smartphone Graphics. Yuanpei Wu, Dong Du, Chao Xu, Yubin Xia, Ming Fu, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. The 30th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, March 2025.\n\n- [SoCC] On-demand and Parallel Checkpoint/Restore for GPU Applications. Yanning Yang, Dong Du, Haitao Song, Yubin Xia. The 15th ACM Symposium on Cloud Computing (SoCC'24), Redmond, WA, USA. Nov 2024.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/yang-socc24.pdf)\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Harmonizing Efficiency and Practicability: Optimizing Resource Utilization in Serverless Computing with Jiagu. Qingyuan Liu, Yanning Yang, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Ping Zhang, Jia Feng, James Larus, Haibo Chen. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Santa Clara, CA, USA, July 2024.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/liu-atc24.pdf)\n\n- [OSDI] Using Dynamically Layered Definite Releases for Verifying the RefFS File System. Mo Zou, Dong Du, Mingkai Dong, Haibo Chen. The 18th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Santa Clara, CA, US, July 2024.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/zou-osdi24.pdf)\n\n- [ISCA] sNPU: Trusted Execution Environments on Integrated NPUs. Erhu Feng, Dahu Feng, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. The 51st International Symposium on Computer Architecture (ISCA'24), 2024.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/feng-isca24.pdf)\n\n- [ASPLOS] sIOPMP: Scalable and Efficient I/O Protection for TEEs. Erhu Feng, Dahu Feng, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Wenbin Zheng, Siqi Zhao, Haibo Chen. The 29th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, April 2024.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/feng-asplos24.pdf)\n\n- [SoCC] The Gap Between Serverless Research and Real-world Systems. Qingyuan Liu, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Ping Zhang, Haibo Chen. ACM Symposium on Cloud Computing, 2023.[paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/zh/publications/LiuSoCC23.pdf)\n\n- [MICRO] Accelerating Extra Dimensional Page Walks for Confidential Computing. Dong Du, Bicheng Yang, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. The 56th IEEE/ACM International Symposium on Microarchitecture (MICRO), Toronto, Canada. 2023.[paper-preprint](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/micro23-du-preprint.pdf)\n\n- [HPCA] Efficient Distributed Secure Memory with Migratable Merkle Tree. Erhu Feng, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. The 29th IEEE International Symposium on High-Performance Computer Architecture, February, 2023. [paper](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/hpca23.pdf)\n\n- [ACM TOCS] Boosting Inter-Process Communication with Architectural Support. Yubin Xia, Dong Du, Zhichao Hua, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen, Haibing Guan. ACM Transactions on Computer Systems. Accepted. 2022.\n\n- [ASPLOS] Serverless Computing on Heterogeneous Computers. Dong Du, Qingyuan Liu, Xueqiang Jiang, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. The 27th International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems (ASPLOS'22). [pdf](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/duasplos22.pdf)\n\n- [OSDI] Erhu Feng, Xu Lu, Dong Du, Bicheng Yang, Xueqiang Jiang, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Scalable Memory Protection in the PENGLAI Enclave. The 15th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, 2021.\n\n- [SoCC] Characterizing Serverless Platforms with ServerlessBench. Tianyi Yu, Qingyuan Liu, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Ziqian Lu, Pingchao Yang, Chenggang Qin, Haibo Chen. ACM Symposium on Cloud Computing, October 19-21, 2020. [[preprint](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/yusocc20.pdf)]\n\n- [ASPLOS] Catalyzer: Sub-millisecond Startup for Serverless Computing with Initialization-less Booting. Dong Du, Tianyi Yu, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Guanglu Yan, Chenggang Qin, Qixuan Wu, Haibo Chen. The 25th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems (Accepted), Lausanne, Switzerland, March, 2020. [[pdf](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/duasplos20.pdf)]\n\n- [SOSP] Using Concurrent Relational Logic with Helper for Verifying the AtomFS File System. Mo Zou, Haoran Ding, Dong Du, Ming Fu, Ronghui Gu, Haibo Chen. The 27th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles. Deerhurst Resort, Huntsville, Ontario, Canada, October 27-30, 2019. [[pdf](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/zousosp19.pdf)]\n\n- [ISCA] XPC: Architectural Support for Secure and Efficient Cross Process Call. Dong Du, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 46th ACM/IEEE International Symposium on Computer Architecture, Phoenix, Arizona, USA. June 22-26, 2019. [[pdf](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/duisca19.pdf)]\n\n- [USENIX ATC] EPTI: Efficient Defence against Meltdown Attack for Unpatched VMs. Zhichao Hua, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, and Binyu Zang, 2018 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2018 [[pdf](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/_media/publications/epti-atc18.pdf)]\n\n学术服务\n\nServices (Program Commitee): SOSP 2026 TPC，USENIX FAST’26 TPC, ASPLOS 2026 ERC, MICRO 2025 TPC, ISCA 2025 TPC, USENIX NSDI’25 TPC, ACM CCS’24 TPC, ACSAC’24 TPC, ChinaSys’24 TPC, ACM SoCC’22 TPC, MICRO’22 ERC\n\nServices (Organizing Commitee): SOSP’23 AEC Co-Chair, ASPLOS’24 Workshop (titled: OpenHarmony Tutorial) Co-Chair, APSys 2024 Publicity Co-Chair, ACM SIGOPS Blog Editor	\N
c62ff6a8-c33e-4cd7-94d4-191aae14b1f7	898c1976-24d6-4ea7-adf5-4c3b72f67926	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/gujinyu.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/gujinyu.html	36020b521522b2bc99919bb7c6176cb2	2026-10-22 06:17:18.503381+00	200	static	utf-8	af02672ac4a2b9675bdeb90527a9df89	# 古金宇-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n古金宇\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：gujinyu@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：软件大楼3207\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/zh/pub/members/jinyu_gu/](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/zh/pub/members/jinyu_gu/)\n\n个人简介\n\n研究方向为操作系统内核、系统安全、机器学习系统。担任开源鸿蒙具身智能PMC主席，领域操作系统教育部工程研究中心内核实验室主任，CCF系统软件专业委员会执委，CCF开源发展技术委员会执委。研究方向为操作系统内核、系统安全、机器学习系统。研究成果发表在本领域主流学术会议与期刊如SOSP、OSDI、EuroSys、USENIX ATC、USENIX Security、NSDI、IEEE TC等。研究成果通过产学研合作应用于开源鸿蒙操作系统、航天卫星操作系统、OPPO智能终端操作系统、南方电网的电力鸿蒙操作系统等。担任包括EuroSys和ATC在内的多个期刊审稿人及国际会议程序委员会成员。参与编著《智能终端操作系统与OpenHarmony实践》《操作系统：原理与实现》。获“示范性软件学院联盟十大关键软件技术成果”、“终端操作系统十大技术挑战特别贡献奖”、“OpenHarmony领航课题”等。指导学生获上海交通大学优异学士学位论文、全国大学生操作系统设计赛一等奖等。\n\n教育背景\n\n2016.09 - 2021.06 上海交通大学 计算机科学与技术 博士\n\n2012.09 - 2016.06 上海交通大学 软件工程 学士\n\n工作履历\n\n2025.01 - 至今 上海交通大学 副研究员\n2021.08 - 2024.12 上海交通大学 助理研究员\n\n教授课程\n\n承担计算机系统基础（ICS）、操作系统课程教学工作（课程实验[链接](https://github.com/SJTU-IPADS/OS-Course-Lab)）\n\n论文发表\n\n- [SIGCSE TS] Experiences with ChCore Experimental Operating System Kernel. Haibo Chen, Yubin Xia and Jinyu Gu. Proceedings of the 56th ACM Technical Symposium on Computer Science Education. February 2026.\n\n- [EuroSys] Xunjie Wang, Jiacheng Shi (co-first author), Zihan Zhao, Yang Yu, Zhichao Hua, Jinyu Gu ✉️. TZ-LLM: Protecting On-Device Large Language Models with Arm TrustZone. Proceedings of the 21th European Conference on Computer Systems, Edinburgh, UK, April, 2026.\n\n- [USENIX NSDI] Zixuan Wang, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Xingda Wei, Yubin Xia. OneSidedMW: Managing Disaggregated Memory Efficiently, Flexibly, and Securely with RNIC Offloading. The 23rd USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation. Renton, WA, USA, May 4–6, 2026.\n\n- [NeurIPS] Kaijun Zhou, Xingyu Yan, Xingda Wei, Xijun Li, Jinyu Gu ✉️. Multimodal Generation Made Efficient with Approximately Speculative Diffusion and Speculative Verification. NeurIPS 2025.\n\n- [SOSP] PhoenixOS: Concurrent OS-level GPU Checkpoint and Restore with Validated Speculation. Xingda Wei, Zhuobin Huang, Tianle Sun, Yingyi Hao, Rong Chen, Mingcong Han, Jinyu Gu, Haibo Chen. The 31st Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, 2025.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Wenxin Zheng, Bin Xu, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Haibo Chen. SAVE: Software-Implemented Fault Tolerance for Model Inference against GPU Memory Bit Flips. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2025.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Le Chen, Yiyang Wu, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. μEFI: A Microkernel-Style UEFI with Isolation and Transparency. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2025.\n\n- [EuroSys] A Hardware-Software Co-Design for Efficient Secure Containers. Jiacheng Shi, Yang Yu, Jinyu Gu ✉️, and Yubin Xia. The 20th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Rotterdam, Netherlands, 2025.\n\n- [USENIX Security] Jiacheng Shi, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Yubin Xia and Haibo Chen. Serverless Functions Made Confidential and Efficient with Split Containers. The 34th USENIX Security Symposium, Seattle, WA, USA, 2025.\n\n- [USENIX NSDI] Zixuan Wang, Xingda Wei, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Hongrui Xie, Rong Chen, Haibo Chen. ODRP: On-Demand Remote Paging with Programmable RDMA. 22nd USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation, Philadelphia, PA, USA, Carlsbad, April 28–30, 2025.\n\n- [IEEE TPDS] Ziqu Yu, Jinyu Gu ✉️ (co-first author), Zijian Wu, Nian Liu and Jian Guo. HTLL: Latency-Aware Scalable Blocking Mutex. IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems, 2025.\n\n- [IEEE TC] Jinyu Gu ✉️, Jiacheng Shi, Haoran Su, Wentai Li, Binyu Zang, Haibin Guan, Haibo Chen. Understanding and Mitigating Twin Function Misuses in Operating System Kernel. IEEE Transactions on Computers, 2023.\n\n- [OSDI] No Provisioned Concurrency: Fast RDMA-codesigned Remote Fork for Serverless Computing. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Tianxia Wang, Jinyu Gu, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, USA, July 2023.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Jinyu Gu ✉️, Hao Li, Wentai Li, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. EPK: Scalable and Efficient Memory Protection Key. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Carlsbad, CA, USA, July 2022.\n\n- [USENIX Security] Jinyu Gu, Bojun Zhu, Mingyu Li, Wentai Li, Yubin Xia, and Haibo Chen. A Hardware-Software Co-design for Efficient Intra-Enclave Isolation. The 31st USENIX Security Symposium, Boston, MA, USA, 2022.\n\n- [PPoPP] Nian Liu, Jinyu Gu ✉️, Dahai Tang, Kenli Li, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Asymmetry-aware Scalable Locking. The 27th ACM SIGPLAN Annual Symposium on Principles and Practice of Parallel Programming, Seoul, Korea, 2022.\n\n- [IEEE TC] Jinyu Gu, Xinyue Wu, Bojun Zhu, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, and Haibo Chen. Enclavisor: A Hardware-software Co-design for Enclaves on Untrusted Cloud. IEEE Transactions on Computers, 2020.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Jinyu Gu, Xinyue Wu, Wentai Li, Nian Liu, Zeyu Mi, Yubin Xia, and Haibo Chen. Harmonizing Performance and Isolation in Microkernels with Efficient Intra-kernel Isolation and Communication. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2020.\n\n获奖信息\n\n示范性软件学院联盟十大关键软件技术成果 2024\n\n中国产学研合作创新奖二等奖（排名第5）2024\n\nOpenHarmony领航课题 2024\n\n全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛操作系统设计赛优秀指导教师 2024\n\nOpenHarmony竞赛训练营特别创新奖指导老师 2024\n\n终端操作系统十大技术挑战特别贡献奖 2023\n\n学术服务\n\nEuroSys TPC 2026/2025/2023\n\nUSENIX ATC TPC 2025\n\nSOSP 2025 SRC Chair\n\nChinaSys 2024	\N
b9b12489-2001-4fe3-8c2a-d21967aa76ae	6604b6ee-3f2c-4b33-a65f-01a18cb89e84	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huazhichao.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huazhichao.html	e36dca43944a587b0bf408b04007b3b3	2026-10-22 06:17:30.243872+00	200	static	utf-8	2c7a1b793e45dd6bf8a6da76c9a91850	# 华志超-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n华志超\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：zchua@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n上海交通大学副研究员、博导，主要研究方向为操作系统、系统结构与大模型基础软件。在ISCA、MICRO、ASPLOS、USENIX ATC、EuroSys、USENIX Security、IEEE TC、ACM TOCS等计算机领域著名国际会议与期刊上发表论文十多篇。主持国家自然科学基金青年项目与面上项目，获上海市“市长奖”、中国产学研合作促进会创新成果二等奖等荣誉。\n\n教育背景\n\n2011 - 2015 上海交通大学 软件工程 学士\n\n2015 - 2020 上海交通大学 计算机科学与技术 博士\n\n教授课程\n\n- CS3601 操作系统 本科生（IEEE/ACM 班）\n\n- EI6711 高级操作系统 研究生\n\n论文发表\n\n- XpuTEE: A High-Performance and Practical Heterogeneous Trusted Execution Environment for GPUs. Shulin Fan, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. ACM Transactions on Computer Systems.2025 [ACM TOCS, CCF-A].\n\n- DPCapsule: A Decentralized Private Computing System With Self-Controlled Data. Yitong Chen, Yang Yu, Zhichao Hua. Internetware 2025.\n\n- DeFS: A Decentralized and High-Performance File System for Consortium Systems. Yitong Cheng, Shenglong Zhao, Yang Yu, Zhichao Hua. Internetware 2025.\n\n- CPS: A Cooperative Para-virtualized Scheduling Framework for Manycore Machines. Yuxuan Liu, Tianqiang Xu, Zeyu Mi, Zhichao Hua, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. The 29th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, April 2024. [ASPLOS, CCF-A]\n\n- ISA-grid: Architecture of Fine-grained Privilege Control for Instructions and Registers. Shulin Fan, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. The 50th International Symposium on Computer Architecture (ISCA),June 17–21, 2023, Orlando, FL, USA.[ISCA, CCF-A]\n\n- SecDFS: A Secure and Decentralized File System. Shenglong Zhao, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia. 2023 IEEE 29th International Conference on Parallel and Distributed Systems (ICPADS), Ocean Flower Island, China, 2023.\n\n- Boosting Inter-Process Communication with Architectural Support. Yubin Xia, Dong Du, Zhichao Hua, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen, Haibing Guan. ACM Transactions on Computer Systems.2022. [ACM TOCS, CCF-A]\n\n- COLONY: A Privileged Trusted Execution Environment with Extensibility. Yubin Xia, Zhichao Hua, Jinyu Gu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON COMPUTERS, 2022. [IEEE TC, CCF-A]\n\n- TZ-Container: Protecting Container from Untrusted OS with ARM TrustZone. Zhichao Hua, Yang Yu, Jinyu Gu, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. SCIENCE CHINA Information Sciences, 2021. [SCIS, CCF-A]\n\n- XPC: Architectural Support for Secure and Efficient Cross Process Call. Dong Du, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 46th ACM/IEEE International Symposium on Computer Architecture, Phoenix, Arizona, USA. June 22-26, 2019. [ISCA, CCF-A]\n\n- EPTI: Efficient Defence against Meltdown Attack for Unpatched VMs. Zhichao Hua, Dong Du, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, and Binyu Zang, 2018 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2018. [USENIX ATC, CCF-A]\n\n- vTZ: Virtualizing ARM TrustZone. Zhichao Hua, Jinyu Gu, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang and Haibing Guan. Usenix Security Symposium 2017. Vancouver, Canada, August, 2017. [USENIX Security, CCF-A]\n\n- Secure Live Migration of SGX Enclaves on Untrusted Cloud. Jinyu Gu, Zhichao Hua, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, Jinming Li. The 47th IEEE/IFIP International Conference on Dependable Systems and Networks, June 26-29, 2017. Denver, CO, USA. [DSN, CCF-B]\n\n获奖信息\n\n- 国家奖学金\n\n- 上海市优秀博士毕业生\n\n- 上海市青少年科技创新“市长奖”（35岁以下）\n\n- OpenHarmony竞赛训练营特别创新奖指导老师（年度唯一）\n\n- 产学研合作促进会科技成果二等奖\n\n学术服务\n\n- TPC of APSys 2025\n\n- TPC of SysTEX 2025\n\n- TPC of SIGOPS ChinaSys 2024\n\n- Transaction Reviewer of Journal of Systems Architecture: Embedded Software Design\n\n- Transaction Reviewer of CCF Transactions on High Performance Computing	\N
3d33d459-b91d-4149-baa8-d9c8a8adf6d6	72b118e0-f5c6-43c8-a010-61c00b4561ee	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/mizeyu.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/mizeyu.html	6a483c51c18716f2b8128c22424cd5ee	2026-10-22 06:17:42.952282+00	200	static	utf-8	461cb5e687b0421deac3c9cac2c1c300	# 糜泽羽-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n糜泽羽\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：yzmizeyu@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：软件学院5302室\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/pub/members/zeyu_mi](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/pub/members/zeyu_mi)\n\n个人简介\n\n糜泽羽博士，上海交通大学副教授/博士生导师。中国计算机学会CCF高级会员，ACM/IEEE会员。主要研究领域为大模型系统和操作系统。相关成果在 OSDI、SOSP、ASPLOS、EuroSys 等国际顶级会议和期刊，受邀担SOSP、ASLPOS等国际顶级会议PC。发起的开源项目PowerInfer星标为8.3K，曾连续两天蝉联GitHub Trending榜榜首。发布的世界首个手机侧部署的深度思考模型SmallThinker在HuggingFace趋势总榜排名第二，7天下载量突破10万。\n\n详情请见个人主页：https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/pub/members/zeyu_mi\n\n教育背景\n\n- 2014年-2020年，博士，上海交通大学软件学院，计算机科学与技术\n\n- 2010年-2014年，学士，南京大学软件学院，软件工程\n\n工作履历\n\n- 2023年-至今，副教授/博士生导师，上海交通大学软件学院\n\n- 2020年-2023年，助理研究员/硕士生导师，上海交通大学软件学院\n\n教授课程\n\n- 操作系统 2021-2025.\n\n- 离散数学 2019-2024.\n\n论文发表\n\n### 2026\n\n- [ASPLOS, CCF-A] Zhenliang Xue, Hanpeng Hu, Xing Chen, Yimin Jiang, Yixin Song, Zeyu Mi, Yibo Zhu, Daxin Jiang, Yubin Xia, Haibo Chen. PipeWeaver: Addressing Data Dynamicity in Large Multimodal Model Training with Dynamic Interleaved Pipeline. The 31st ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, March 2026. (Summer Cycle, Acceptance rate: 89/840 = 10.6%)\n\n### 2025\n\n- [ASPLOS, CCF-A] Yifan Tan, Cheng Tan, Zeyu Mi#, Haibo Chen. PipeLLM: Fast and Confidential Large Language Model Services with Speculative Pipelined Encryption. The 30th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, March 2025. (Summer Cycle, Acceptance rate: 65/510 = 12.7%)\n\n- [SOSP, CCF-A] Yixin Song, Zeyu Mi#, Haotong Xie, Haibo Chen. PowerInfer: Fast Large Language Model Serving with a Consumer-grade GPU. The 30th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, November 2024. (Acceptance rate: 43/248 = 17.3%)\n\n- [SOSP, CCF-A] Kaijie Guo*, Dingji Li*, Ben Luo, Yibin Shen, Kaihuan Peng, Ning Luo, Shengdong Dai, Chen Liang, Jianming Song, Hang Yang, Xiantao Zhang, Zeyu Mi#. VPRI: Optimized I/O Page Fault in Public IaaS. The 30th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles, November 2024. (Acceptance rate: 43/248 = 17.3%)\n\n- [USENIX ATC, CCF-A] Jiahao Chen, Zeyu Mi#, Yubin Xia, Haibing Guan, Haibo Chen. CPC: Flexible, Secure and Efficient CVM Maintenance with Confidential Procedure Calls. 2024 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, July 2024. (Acceptance rate: 77/488 = 15.8%)\n\n### 2023\n\n- [ASPLOS, CCF-A] Yuxuan Liu, Tianqiang Xu, Zeyu Mi#, Zhichao Hua, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. CPS: A Cooperative Para-virtualized Scheduling Framework for Manycore Machines. The 29th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, April 2024. (Acceptance rate: 50/238 = 21%)\n\n- [OSDI, CCF-A] Jiahao Chen*, Dingji Li*, Zeyu Mi#, Yuxuan Liu, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, Haibo Chen. Security and Performance in the Delegated User-level Virtualization. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, July 2023. (Acceptance rate: 50/255 = 19.6%)\n\n- [OSDI, CCF-A] Mingyu Li, Xuyang Zhao, Le Chen, Cheng Tan, Huorong Li, Sheng Wang, Zeyu Mi, Yubin Xia, Feifei Li, Haibo Chen. Encrypted Databases Made Secure Yet Maintainable. The 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, July 2023. (Acceptance rate: 50/255 = 19.6%)\n\n- [USENIX ATC, CCF-A] Dingji Li, Zeyu Mi#, Chenhui Ji, Yifan Tan, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, Haibo Chen. Analysis and Optimization of Network I/O Tax in Confidential Virtual Machines. 2023 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, July 2023. (Acceptance rate: 65/353 = 18.4%)\n\n### 2022\n\n- [IEEE TDSC, CCF-A] Zeyu Mi, Zhi Guo, Fuqian Huang, Haibo Chen#. Hawkeye: Eliminating Kernel Address Leakage in Normal Data Flows. IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing, 2022.\n\n### 2021\n\n- [SOSP, CCF-A] Dingji Li, Zeyu Mi#, Yubin Xia, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen, Haibing Guan. TwinVisor: Hardware-isolated Confidential Virtual Machines for ARM. The 28th ACM Symposium on Operating System Principles, October 2021. (Acceptance rate: 54/348 = 15.5%)\n\n- [IEEE TC, CCF-A] Zeyu Mi#, Haoqi Zhuang, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. General and Fast Inter-Process Communication via Bypassing Privileged Software. IEEE Transactions on Computers, 2021.\n\n### 2020\n\n- [USENIX ATC, CCF-A] Jinyu Gu, Xinyue Wu, Wentai Li, Nian Liu, Zeyu Mi, Yubin Xia# and Haibo Chen. Harmonizing Performance and Isolation in Microkernels with Efficient Intra-kernel Isolation and Communication. 2020 USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2020. (Acceptance rate: 65/348 = 18.6%)\n\n- [USENIX Security, CCF-A] Zeyu Mi, Dingji Li, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, and Haibing Guan#. (Mostly) Exitless VM Protection from Untrusted Hypervisor through Disaggregated Nested Virtualization. In Proceedings of the 29th USENIX Security Symposium, Boston, MA, USA, August, 2020. (Acceptance rate: 157/977 = 16.1%)\n\n### 2019\n\n- [EuroSys, CCF-A] Zeyu Mi, Dingji Li, Zihan Yang, Xinran Wang, and Haibo Chen#. SkyBridge: Fast and Secure Inter-Process Communication for Microkernels. In Proceedings of 14th ACM European Conference on Computer Systems, Dresden, Germany, March, 2019. (Acceptance rate: 45/207 = 21.7%)\n\n学术服务\n\n### 学术会议评审委员会委员（PC）\n\n- ASPLOS 2026\n\n- SOSP 2025\n