935e8442-e555-40f0-bd96-6b1759324633	bc4da947-e25c-4144-8e35-9ef392f96167	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wangzhaoguo.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wangzhaoguo.html	5fa6de5010c2d7cb3732193f01ca45eb	2026-10-22 06:17:56.332719+00	200	static	utf-8	a42ab82a15ffb8ad163140b32bd632b9	# 王肇国-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n王肇国\n\n教授\n\n邮箱：zhaoguowang@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://zhaoguowang.github.io/](https://zhaoguowang.github.io/)\n\n个人简介\n\n重点研发计划项目负责人，国家优秀青年科学基金获得者。主要从事分布式系统与数据库系统研究，成果被Nature，OSDI、SIGMOD、VLDB、NSDI、PPoPP、PODC等权威期刊和会议录用或发表。发表ACM通讯（Commmunications of the ACM） 亮点论文和封面文章，并获2023 ACM SIGMOD研究亮点奖、SIGMOD 2022最佳论文优胜奖（Honorable Mention）、CCF青年科技奖（CCF-IEEE CS）、ACM ChinaSys新星奖、华为奥林帕斯先锋奖，以及两次华为火花奖。学术兼职包括OpenHarmony技术指导委员会智能数据管理TSG负责人、ACM ChinaSys秘书长、CCF学术工作委员会委员、上海市计算机行业协会副会长等。曾受邀担任MLSys 2026、EuroSys 2026/2025、NSDI 2024、SoCC 2024/2023等国际会议的程序委员会成员，以及第22期秀湖论坛联合主席等。	\N
271b7669-d496-4973-9c79-6f3d35a0725b	6bb62592-ca8b-4f9a-b2d0-533781d06fce	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/weixingda.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/weixingda.html	d073a8fc95318cf9a468ec4a9f90d514	2026-10-22 06:18:09.751857+00	200	static	utf-8	4da8d8cc50fdc84da3aa109b2756ebf4	# 魏星达-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n魏星达\n\n长聘教轨副教授\n\n邮箱：wxdwfc@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n魏星达最近的研究聚焦于面向AI的分布式系统基础设施，期望能系统性地提升 AI 训练、推理和智能体等新兴应用的「性能」与「可靠性」。\n\n近期的研究工作主要围绕以下几个方向展开：\n\n- 一是通过「快速自动扩缩容机制」和「动态资源管理机制与策略」，构建可扩展的 AI 基础设施。代表性工作包括 BlitzScale（OSDI'25）、PhoenixOS（SOSP'25）和 KunServe（EuroSys'26）。\n\n- 二是设计高效的系统机制/策略，更充分地利用计算资源。代表性工作包括 LMMetric（OSDI'26）和 SpecActor（arXiv）。\n三是面向 AI 工作负载构建高速数据平面。代表性工作包括 AITurbo（FAST'26）和 KVCache 缓存研究（ATC'25）。\n\n上述工作大部分已经或正在被部署于华为、阿里巴巴、字节跳动等大型 AI 服务提供商的真实系统中。\n\n更多信息请参见： [https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/pub/members/xingda_wei](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/pub/members/xingda_wei)\n\n教授课程\n\n- 计算机系统工程\n\n- 计算机系统原理\n\n论文发表\n\n部份论文发表:\n\n- [OSDI'26] Simple is Better: Multiplication May Be All You Need for LLM Request Scheduling. Dingyan Zhang, Jinbo Han, Kaixi Zhang, Xingda Wei (corresponding author), Sijie Shen, Chenguang Fang, Wenyuan Yu, Jingren Zhou, Rong Chen. The 16th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation.\n\n- [SOSP'25] PhoenixOS: Concurrent OS-level GPU Checkpoint and Restore with Validated Speculation. Xingda Wei (co-first), Zhuobin Huang (co-first)，Tianle Sun, Yingyi Hao，Rong Chen，Mingcong Han，Jinyu Gu，Haibo Chen. The 31st Symposium on Operating Systems Principles.\n\n- [OSDI'25] Fast and Live Model Auto Scaling with O(1) Host Caching. Dingyan Zhang, Haotian Wang, Yang Liu, Xingda Wei (Corresponding author), Yizhou Shan, Rong Chen, Haibo Chen. The 19th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation.\n\n- [ATC'25] KVCache Cache in the Wild: Characterizing and Optimizing KVCache Cache at a Large Cloud Provider. Jiahao Wang, Jinbo Han, Xingda Wei (Corresponding author), Sijie Shen, Dingyan Zhang, Chenguang Fang, Rong Chen, Wenyuan Yu, Haibo Chen.\n\n- [NSDI'25] ODRP: On-Demand Remote Paging with Programmable RDMA. Zixuan Wang, Xingda Wei, Jinyu Gu, Hongrui Xie, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 22nd USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation.\n\n- [EuroSys'24 (Best paper) Serialization/Deserialization-free State Transfer in Serverless Workflows . Fangming Lu, Xingda Wei (Corresponding author), Zhuobin Huang, Rong Chen, Mingyu Wu, and Haibo Chen. The 19th ACM SIGOPS European Conference on Computer Systems, Athens, Greece, April 2024.\n\n- [OSDI'23] No Provisioned Concurrency: Fast RDMA-codesigned Remote Fork for Serverless Computing. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Tianxia Wang, Jinyu Gu, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n- [OSDI'23] Characterizing Off-path SmartNIC for Accelerating Distributed Applications. Xingda Wei, Rongxin Cheng, Yuhan Yang, Rong Chen, and Haibo Chen. 17th USENIX Symposium on Operating Systems Design and Implementation, Boston, MA, US, July 2023.\n\n获奖信息\n\n- Eurosys Best paper, 2024\n\n- 华为火花奖, 2022\n\n- ACM 中国优秀博士学位论文提名奖 (ACM China Doctoral Dissertation Award), 2021\n\n- ACM ChinaSys 优秀博士学位论文奖 (ACM ChinaSys Doctoral Dissertation Award), 2021\n\n- Honorable Mention of the ACM SIGOPS Dennis M. Ritchie Award, 2021\n\n- Huawei OlympusMons Pioneer Award, 2020\n\n- Microsoft Research Asia Fellowship Award, 2018\n\n- Excellent Bachelor Thesis, 2015\n\n学术服务\n\nProgram Committee Member\n\n- 2027: NSDI, OSDI\n\n- 2026: ASPLOS, EuroSys\n\n- 2025: NSDI, OSDI, CoNEXT, APSys\n\n- 2024: NSDI, ASPLOS (Fall), CoNEXT (Winter)\n\n- 2023: SysDW, Chinasys (Fall)\n\n- 2022: EuroDW	\N
