sign and Implementation. July 2026.\n\n- [SIGCSE TS] miniK8s: A Pedagogical Cloud-Native System. Dong Du, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. Proceedings of the 56th ACM Technical Symposium on Computer Science Education. February 2026.\n\n- [Preprint 2025] FairBatching: Fairness-Aware Batch Formation for LLM Inference. Hongtao Lyu, Boyue Liu, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen. arXiv Preprint arXiv:2510.14392, 2025.\n\n- [ACM TACO] Object-Aware Memory Compression for Smartphones. Xinrui Li, Zhenyu Yang, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. ACM Transactions on Architecture and Code Optimization. December 2025.\n\n- [ACM TOCS] Towards Serialization/Deserialization-free State Transfer in Serverless Workflows. Xingda Wei, Fangming Lu, Zhuobin Huang, Rong Chen, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen. ACM Transactions on Computer Systems. March 2025.\n\n- [EuroSys] Jade: A High-throughput Concurrent Copying Garbage Collector. Mingyu Wu, Liang Mao, Yude Lin, Yifeng Jin, Zhe Li, Hongtao Lyu, Jiawei Tang, Xiaowei Lu, Hao Tang, Denghui Dong, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. Proceedings of the 19th European Conference on Computer Systems, Athens, Greece, April, 2024.\n\n- [EuroSys] Characterization and Reclamation of Frozen Garbage in Managed FaaS Workloads. Ziming Zhao, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. Proceedings of the 19th European Conference on Computer Systems, Athens, Greece, April, 2024. (Awarded with ACM Badges: Artifacts Evaluated, Artifacts Functional)\n\n- [EuroSys] Serialization/Deserialization-free State Transfer in Serverless Workflows with RDMA-based Remote Memory Map. Fangming Lu, Xingda Wei, Zhuobin Huang, Rong Chen, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 19th European Conference on Computer Systems, Athens, Greece, April, 2024. (Best Paper Award)\n\n- [IEEE TC] Toward An SGX-friendly Java Runtime. Mingyu Wu, Zhe Li, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, Shaojun Wang, Lei Yu, Sanhong Li, Haitao Song. IEEE Transactions on Computers, pp. 44-57, January 2024. [link](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10268860)\n\n- [IEEE TC] Flock: Towards Multitasking Virtual Machines for Function-as-a-Service. Ziming Zhao, Mingyu Wu, Xujie Cao, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. IEEE Transactions on Computers, pp. 3153-3166, November 2023. [link](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10159516)\n\n- [ASPLOS] BeeHive: Sub-second Elasticity for Web Services with Semi-FaaS Execution. Ziming Zhao, Mingyu Wu, Jiawei Tang, Binyu Zang, Zhaoguo Wang, and Haibo Chen. The 28th ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, Vancouver, Canada, March 25-29, 2023.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Zero-Change Object Transmission for Distributed Big Data Analytics. Mingyu Wu, Shuaiwei Wang, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Carlsbad, CA, USA, July 2022. (Awarded with USENIX Badges: Artifacts Functional, Results Reproduced)\n\n- [VEE] Transparent and Lightweight Object Placement for Managed Workloads atop Hybrid Memories. Zhe Li, Mingyu Wu. The 18th ACM SIGPLAN/SIGOPS International Conference on Virtual Execution Environments, Lausanne, Switzerland, March 2022.\n\n- [EuroSys] Bridging the Performance Gap for Copy-based Garbage Collectors atop Non-Volatile Memory. Yanfei Yang, Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang. Sixteenth European Conference on Computer Systems, Online Event, United Kingdom, April 26-28, 2021.\n\n- [USENIX ATC] Platinum: A CPU-Efficient Concurrent Garbage Collector for Tail-Reduction of Interactive Services. Mingyu Wu, Ziming Zhao, Yanfei Yang, Haoyu Li, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, Sanhong Li, Chuansheng Lu, Tongbao Zhang. USENIX Annual Technical Conference, Boston, MA, USA, July 2020.\n\n- [VEE] GCPersist: An Efficient GC-assisted Lazy Persistency Framework for Resilient Java Applications on NVM. Mingyu Wu, Haibo Chen, Hao Zhu, Binyu Zang, Haibing Guan, The 16th ACM SIGPLAN/SIGOPS International Conference on Virtual Execution Environments, Lausanne, Switzerland, March 2020.\n\n- [VEE] ScissorGC: Scalable and Efficient Compaction for Java Full Garbage Collection. Haoyu Li, Mingyu Wu, Binyu Zang, and Haibo Chen. Proceedings of ACM SIGPLAN/SIGOPS International Conference on Virtual Execution Environments (VEE), 2019\n\n- [APSys] Analysis and Optimization of Java Full Garbage Collection. Haoyu Li, Mingyu Wu, and Haibo Chen. The 9th ACM SIGOPS Asia-Pacific Workshop on Systems, Jeju Island, South Korea, August 2018 (Best Paper Runner-up).\n\n- [SOSE] DwarfGC: A Space-Efficient and Crash-Consistent Garbage Collector in NVM for Cloud Computing. Heting Li, and Mingyu Wu, IEEE Symposium on Service-Oriented System Engineering, Bamberg, Germany, March 2018.\n\n- [ASPLOS] Espresso: Brewing Java For More Non-Volatility with Non-volatile Memory. Mingyu Wu, Ziming Zhao, Haoyu Li, Heting Li, Haibo Chen, Binyu Zang, and Haibing Guan. The 23rd ACM International Conference on Architectural Support for Programming Languages and Operating Systems, Williamsburg, VA, USA, March 2018.\n\n- [PPoPP] Recovering Performance for Vector-based Machine Learning on Managed Runtime. Mingyu Wu, Haibing Guan, Binyu Zang, Haibo Chen. Proceedings of the 22nd ACM SIGPLAN Symposium on Principles and Practice of Parallel Programming. ACM, 2017.\n\n获奖信息\n\nEuroSys 2024最佳论文奖\n\nAPSys 2018最佳论文runner-up奖\n\n学术服务\n\n程序委员会成员：\n\n- ASPLOS (2027)\n\n- PPoPP (2026/2027）\n\n- ChinaSys (2022/2025)\n\n- VEE (2022)	\N
40444dbf-d171-41d1-bede-8f18d30c6a6d	82c97da3-362d-423c-989b-ecc52e5f17c9	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liwei.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liwei.html	5a3b72805513e95e1dd8d09c0d06fe2b	2026-10-22 06:27:10.463768+00	200	static	utf-8	543625f69c606c9f51e233c84bd48024	# 李伟-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n李伟\n\n长聘教轨副教授\n\n邮箱：weili.cs@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：计算机应用研究所,约翰·霍普克罗夫特计算机科学中心\n\n个人主页：[https://lwkobe.github.io/](https://lwkobe.github.io/)\n\n个人简介\n\n李伟，上海交通大学计算机学院John Hopcroft 计算机科学中心担任长聘教轨副教授，上海市浦江人才。他对物理模拟领域充满热情，其研究目标是将物理学与计算机科学相结合，推动物理模拟的边界。主要研究研究方向为计算机图形学、物理仿真、和物理智能（为虚拟机器人创建高效的流体仿真平台，进行复杂环境下的智能学习；基于AI的物理仿真加速和优化，AI for physics等)。研究成果被发表在SIGGRAPH North America, SIGGRAPH Asia，TOG，TVCG, JCP 等国际重要会议和期刊上。曾获得上海市优秀毕业生，上海科技大学校长奖等荣誉且多次担任SIGGRAPH North America, SIGGRAPH Asia 会议，ACM Transactions on Graphics 和IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics审稿人。\n\n教育背景\n\n2015–2021, ShanghaiTech University & University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n\nPh.D in Computer Science, Advisor: Prof. Xiaopei Liu\n\n2011-2015, Northwestern Polytechnical University\n\nBS in Computer Science\n\n工作履历\n\nAssociate Professor · 2025/05—now\n\nIn Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Shanghai, China\n\nSenior Research Scientist · 2023/02— 2025/04\n\nIn Tencent Lightspeed studio, Shanghai, China\n\nPostdoctoral Researcher · 2021/10—2023/01\n\nIn INRIA, Paris, France · Advisor: Prof. Mathieu Desbrun\n\n论文发表\n\nSelected publications:\n\n请见：[https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9q7M_4MAAAAJ&hl=zh-CN](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9q7M_4MAAAAJ&hl=zh-CN)\n\n个人主页：[https://lwkobe.github.io/](https://lwkobe.github.io/)\n\nVolume-Preserving LBM-MPM Coupling for Air-Water-Sand Mixtures,\n\nXiaoyu Xiao, Haoxiang Wang, Xiaokang Yang, Mathieu Desbrun, and Wei Li (corresponding author)\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH 2026)\n\nFluid Simulation with the Lattice Boltzmann Method\n\nWei Li, Chaoyang Lyu, Mengyun Liu, Yixin Chen, Mathieu Desbrun, Kui Wu, Xiaopei Liu\n\nACM SIGGRAPH 2026 Course\n\nKinetic Free-Surface Flows and Foams with Sharp Interfaces\n\nHaoxiang Wang, Kui Wu, Hui Qiao, Mathieu Desbrun, Wei Li (corresponding author)\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH Asia 2025)\n\nGraphics processing unit accelerated high-order moment-encoded Lattice Boltzmann method for liquid-vapor phase-change simulations\n\nWei Li, Linlin Fei, and Ya-Ling He, accepted by Physics of Fluids, 2025.\n\nKinetic Simulation of Turbulent Multifluid Flows\n\nWei Li, Kui Wu, and Mathieu Desbrun,\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH), 43(55), 2024.\n\nHigh-Order Moment-Encoded Kinetic Simulation of Turbulent Flows\n\nWei Li, Tongtong Wang, Zherong Pang, Xifeng Gao, Kui Wu, and Mathieu Desbrun,\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH Asia), 42(6), 2023.\n\nFluid-Solid Coupling in Kinetic Two-Phase Flow Simulation\n\nWei Li, Mathieu Desbrun,\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH), 42(4), 2023.\n\nEfficient Kinetic Simulation of Two-Phase Flows\n\nWei Li, Yihui Ma, Xiaopei Liu, and Mathieu Desbrun,\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH), 41(4), 2022\n\nFast and Scalable Turbulent Flow Simulation with Two-Way Coupling\n\nWei Li, Yixin Chen, Mathieu Desbrun, Changxi Zheng, and Xiaopei Liu,\n\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of SIGGRAPH), 39 (4), 2020.\n\n资助项目\n\n[1] 国家自然科学基金青年科学基金项目（C类），主持，2027-2029\n\n[2] 华为Explore X基金项目，主持，2025-2027\n\n[3] 华为横向项目，主持，2025-2027\n\n[4] 上海浦江D类基金项目，主持，2025-2027\n\n[5] 智能电网国家科技重大专项“面向智能运维的输变电装备状态推演技术与平台化软件" ,项目骨干，2026年4月-2030年3月\n\n学术服务\n\nProgram committee:\n\n- Siggraph Asia, 2026\n\n- Symposium on Computer Animation (SCA), 2026	\N
1f60653e-363f-4ea5-b278-9b5d2a9d8bbb	33f21e02-888b-4f49-ac0b-380d168aa09b	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/xiayubin.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/xiayubin.html	5c7da3e24ddee85243460d02187fb935	2026-10-22 06:18:38.973012+00	200	static	utf-8	91aa3ba9ac58ec30b83939e086767cdf	# 夏虞斌-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n夏虞斌\n\n教授\n\n邮箱：xiayubin@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：并行与分布式系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/yubin_xia](https://ipads.se.sjtu.edu.cn/yubin_xia)\n\n个人简介\n\n教授，博士生导师，国家级青年人才计划入选者，上海市优秀学术带头人，“挑战杯”全国特等奖优秀指导老师，《麻省理工科技评论》中国“隐私计算科技创新人物”（全国10人），CCF杰出会员，ACM杰出会员。主要研究领域是计算机操作系统与系统结构，曾获教育部技术发明一等奖、上海市技术发明一等奖、SOSP“最佳论文奖”、DSN“十年时间验证奖”、CCF“NASAC青年软件创新奖”、国家教学成果二等奖、上海交通大学卓越教学奖等。担任VEE、IDCDS（Track）国际会议的程序委员会主席，以及SOSP、OSDI、EuroSys、ASPLOS等国际会议的程序委员会委员。目前担任CCF系统软件专委常务委员、CCF教育工委主任助理、上海交通大学-OpenHarmony技术俱乐部主任。	\N
