42e110f5-a9ec-4ea0-9802-0162267184b2	a21bd484-355c-4194-9873-09ac134632aa	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangweinan.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangweinan.html	9a9128c28abfb2a2b89a5d35b7662a7c	2026-10-22 06:25:00.111478+00	200	static	utf-8	52afa242c88453adea100056e8b03164	# 张伟楠-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n张伟楠\n\n教授\n\n邮箱：wnzhang@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：计算机应用研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://wnzhang.net/](https://wnzhang.net/)\n\n个人简介\n\n张伟楠博士现任上海交通大学计算机学院教授、博士生导师，科研领域包括强化学习、决策大模型、智能体技术、具身智能，发表CCF-A类国际会议和期刊100余篇学术论文，谷歌学术引用3万余次，H指数81，爱思唯尔中国高被引学者，获得5个最佳论文奖项，出版教材《动手学强化学习》和《动手学机器学习》等。张伟楠长期担任NeurIPS、ICML、ICLR等会议的领域主席和TPAMI等期刊的编委，作为负责人承担国自然优青项目和科技部重大项目课题，获得吴文俊优青奖和达摩院青橙奖。\n\n教育背景\n\n张伟楠本科毕业于上海交通大学ACM班，博士毕业于伦敦大学学院计算机系。\n\n工作履历\n\n上海交通大学，2016至今\n\n教授课程\n\n机器学习，https://wnzhang.net/teaching/sjtu-ml-2024/index.html\n\n强化学习，https://wnzhang.net/teaching/sjtu-rl-2024/index.html	\N
d2bd3b90-59f6-489e-b2a5-2fad585a52cd	37b4cbfc-bf42-43eb-9a36-fcf579a573ad	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/gushangding.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/gushangding.html	f4b08130d294c740b6d925c81abaeca6	2026-10-22 06:25:30.805729+00	200	static	utf-8	649717757bad8c3decd27a653fa8a931	# 顾尚定-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n顾尚定\n\n长聘教轨副教授\n\n邮箱：shangding.gu@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：计算机应用研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://sail-research-lab.github.io](https://sail-research-lab.github.io)\n\n个人简介\n\n顾尚定博士，上海交通大学计算机学院长聘教轨副教授、博士生导师，入选国家级青年人才计划。 2024 年获德国慕尼黑工业大学（Technical University of Munich）计算机科学博士学位，博士毕业后，于美国加州大学伯克利分校（UC Berkeley）从事博士后研究，开展安全智能决策及其在工业场景中的应用研究。研究聚焦于强化学习、AI 安全、Agentic AI、具身智能与机器人学习，重点探索如何构建安全、可靠、高效且能够持续学习与自主决策的智能系统，并推动相关技术在大语言模型、多模态智能体、机器人、自动化系统及半导体制造等真实场景中的应用。相关成果发表于 Science Advances、IEEE TPAMI、Artificial Intelligence、IEEE TASE、NeurIPS、ICLR 等国际顶级期刊与会议。曾获 OpenAI、NVIDIA、Lam Research等机构科研支持，并担任 NeurIPS、IJCNN等会议 Area Chair、IEEE TASE 专刊客座编辑、多个会议的程序委员会委员，以及多个国际研讨会和学术活动的组织者。更多信息请见实验室主页：[https://sail-research-lab.github.io](https://sail-research-lab.github.io)	\N
31f30678-2c07-4a17-85ef-17b71137b500	043afcb8-fa23-4fd1-9823-bad159744cde	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lichenda.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lichenda.html	f3f73c88421659ba86f08a61ca28bbd8	2026-10-22 06:26:02.721697+00	200	static	utf-8	6355483fdcf9b07809079d23972f2ba4	# 李晨达-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n李晨达\n\n助理研究员\n\n邮箱：lichenda1996@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：计算机应用研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://chenda.li/](https://chenda.li/)\n\n个人简介\n\n李晨达（Chenda Li）现任上海交通大学计算机科学与工程系助理研究员，硕士生导师，[听觉认知与计算声学实验室](https://audiocc.sjtu.edu.cn)（AudioCC Lab）成员。主要研究方向包括语音增强与分离、多模态语音与音频处理、语音语言模型及生成式音频建模，在 IEEE T-ASLP、ICASSP、Interspeech 等国际期刊与会议发表论文50余篇。担任开源语音增强与分离工具 ESPnet-SE 核心开发者与维护者、URGENT 系列通用语音增强挑战赛核心组织者。入选微软亚洲研究院“铸星计划”，2025年获年华为火花奖。\n\n个人主页：[https://chenda.li/](https://chenda.li/)；[Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=v7nc-MwAAAAJ)；[GitHub](https://github.com/LiChenda)。\n\n教育背景\n\n2020年9月—2024年9月｜上海交通大学\n\n计算机科学与技术博士；导师：[钱彦旻](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/qianyanmin.html)教授。\n\n2023年11月—2024年4月｜卡内基梅隆大学\n访问学者，[WAVLab](https://www.wavlab.org/)，语言技术研究所（Language Technologies Institute）；合作导师：Shinji Watanabe 教授。\n\n2018年9月—2020年6月｜上海交通大学\n计算机科学与技术硕士；导师：钱彦旻教授。\n\n2014年9月—2018年6月｜华中科技大学\n电子信息工程学士。\n\n工作履历\n\n2024年10月—至今｜上海交通大学计算机科学与工程系\n助理研究员，听觉认知与计算声学实验室（AudioCC Lab）。\n\n2024年1月—至今｜[URGENT 系列语音增强比赛](https://urgent-challenge.com/)组织\n核心组织者。\n\n2020年6月—至今｜[ESPnet-SE](https://github.com/espnet/espnet)\n核心开发者与维护者，参与 ESPnet 语音增强与分离工具链的研发和维护。\n\n教授课程\n\n上海交通大学 CS1501《程序设计思想与方法（C/C++）》\n\n论文发表\n\n最新列表请见[Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=v7nc-MwAAAAJ)。\n\n1. Marvin Sach, Yihui Fu, Kohei Saijo, Wangyou Zhang, Samuele Cornell, Robin Scheibler, Chenda Li, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Wei Wang, Yanmin Qian, Shinji Watanabe, and Tim Fingscheidt. “2025 Urgent Speech Enhancement Challenge Multilingual P.808 Listening Tests: Approach and Results.” ICASSP 2026, 2026, pp. 22477–22481, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP55912.2026.11465025).\n\n2. Haiyang Sun, Chenyang Le, Wei Wang, Leying Zhang, Chuang Li, Bing Han, Chenda Li, Mengxiao Bi, and Yanmin Qian. “Beyond Sentence-Level Labels: Integrating Conversational Context and Personal Experience for Natural Emotional Expression.” Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: ACL 2026, 2026, pp. 18839–18854, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2026.findings-acl.940).\n\n3. Masao Someki, Alexander Polok, Carlos Carvalho, Chyi-Jiunn Lin, Da-Hee Yang, Jiatong Shi, Jinchuan Tian, Nelson Enrique Yalta Soplin, Samuele Cornell, Siddhant Arora, Francisco Teixeira, Wei Wang, William Chen, Alberto Abad, Chenda Li, Shinji Watanabe, and Wangyou Zhang. “ESPnet3: Infrastructure for Scalable Speech and Audio Research in the Foundation Model Era.” Interspeech 2026, 2026, pp. 4767–4772, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2026-2698).\n\n4. Chenda Li, Wei Wang, Marvin Sach, Wangyou Zhang, Kohei Saijo, Samuele Cornell, Yihui Fu, Zhaoheng Ni, Tim Fingscheidt, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “ICASSP 2026 Urgent Speech Enhancement Challenge.” ICASSP 2026, 2026, pp. 21919–21921, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP55912.2026.11461686).\n\n5. Jiahe Wang, Hongyu Wang, Wei Wang, Lei Yang, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Lufen Tan, and Yanmin Qian. “MeanSE: Efficient Generative Speech Enhancement with Mean Flows.” ICASSP 2026, 2026, pp. 16827–16831, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP55912.2026.11464536).\n\n6. Tianhua Li, Chenda Li, Wei Wang, Xin Zhou, Xihui Chen, Jianqing Gao, and Yanmin Qian. “SLM-SS: Speech Language Model for Generative Speech Separation.” ICASSP 2026, 2026, pp. 15432–15436, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP55912.2026.11463173).\n\n7. Chenjun Zhao, Guangzhi Sun, Keqi Deng, Chenda Li, and Philip C. Woodland. “Str-DiffSep: Streamable Diffusion Model for Speech Separation.” ICASSP 2026, 2026, pp. 14412–14416, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP55912.2026.11464660).\n\n8. Qinzhe Hu, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Shujie Liu, Yan Lu, and Yanmin Qian. “TF-MoE: Time-Frequency Mixture-of-Experts for Efficient Speech Separation.” Interspeech 2026, 2026, pp. 3172–3177, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2026-1307).\n\n9. Zhenglong Liu, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, and Yanmin Qian. “Towards Array-Invariant Speech Enhancement via Geometry-Aware Dynamic Convolution.” Interspeech 2026, 2026, pp. 6974–6978, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2026-548).\n\n10. Wei Wang, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, Jiahe Wang, Samuele Cornell, Marvin Sach, Kohei Saijo, Yihui Fu, Zhaoheng Ni, Mengxiao Bi, Tim Fingscheidt, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “URGENT-MOS: Unified Multi-Metric and Preference Learning for Robust Speech Quality Assessment.” Interspeech 2026, 2026, pp. 5689–5694, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2026-1671).\n\n11. Hongyu Wang, Chenda Li, Xin Zhou, Shuai Wang, and Yanmin Qian. “USE: A Unified Model for Universal Sound Separation and Extraction.” the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2026, pp. 33476–33484, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1609/aaai.v40i39.40635).\n\n12. Yanmin Qian, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, and Shaoxiong Lin. “Contextual Understanding with Contextual Embeddings for Multi-Talker Speech Separation and Recognition in a Cocktail Party.” npj Acoustics, 2025, pp. 3, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1038/s44384-025-00004-x).\n\n13. Jiahong Li, Yiwen Shao, Jianheng Zhuo, Chenda Li, Liliang Tang, Dong Yu, and Yanmin Qian. “Efficient Multilingual ASR Finetuning via LoRA Language Experts.” Interspeech 2025, 2025, pp. 1138–1142, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2025-1374).\n\n14. Wei Wang, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, Jaitong Shi, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Improving Speech Enhancement with Multi-Metric Supervision from Learned Quality Assessment.” 2025 IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop (ASRU), 2025, pp. 1–8, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ASRU65441.2025.11434718).\n\n15. Kohei Saijo, Wangyou Zhang, Samuele Cornell, Robin Scheibler, Chenda Li, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Marvin Sach, Yihui Fu, Wei Wang, Tim Fingscheidt, and Shinji Watanabe. “Interspeech 2025 URGENT Speech Enhancement Challenge.” Interspeech 2025, 2025, pp. 858–862, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2025-1363).\n\n16. Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Wei Wang, Robin Scheibler, Kohei Saijo, Samuele Cornell, Yihui Fu, Marvin Sach, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Tim Fingscheidt, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Less Is More: Data Curation Matters in Scaling Speech Enhancement.” 2025 IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop (ASRU), 2025, pp. 1–8, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ASRU65441.2025.11434638).\n\n17. Wangyou Zhang, Kohei Saijo, Samuele Cornell, Robin Scheibler, Chenda Li, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Marvin Sach, Wei Wang, Yihui Fu, Shinji Watanabe, Tim Fingscheidt, and Yanmin Qian. “Lessons Learned from the URGENT 2024 Speech Enhancement Challenge.” Interspeech 2025, 2025, pp. 853–857, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2025-1246).\n\n18. Chenda Li and Yanmin Qian. “Online Generative Speech Enhancement with Diffusion Gradient Guidance.” ACTA ACUSTICA, 2025, pp. 1644–1651, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.12395/0371-0025.2024270).\n\n19. Jiatong Shi, Haoran Wang, William Chen, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Jinchuan Tian, and Shinji Watanabe. “PURE Codec: Progressive Unfolding of Residual Entropy for Speech Codec Learning.” 2025 IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop (ASRU), 2025, pp. 1–8, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ASRU65441.2025.11434720).\n\n20. Jiahe Wang, Chenda Li, Wei Wang, Wangyou Zhang, Samuele Cornell, Marvin Sach, Robin Scheibler, Kohei Saijo, Yihui Fu, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Tim Fingscheidt, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “URGENT-PK: Perceptually-Aligned Ranking Model Designed for Speech Enhancement Competition.” 2025 IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop (ASRU), 2025, pp. 1–7, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ASRU65441.2025.11434807).\n\n21. Wangyou Zhang, Kohei Saijo, Jee-weon Jung, Chenda Li, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Beyond Performance Plateaus: A Comprehensive Study on Scalability in Speech Enhancement.” Interspeech 2024, 2024, pp. 1740–1744, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2024-1266).\n\n22. Chenda Li, Samuele Cornell, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Diffusion-Based Generative Modeling With Discriminative Guidance for Streamable Speech Enhancement.” 2024 IEEE Spoken Language Technology Workshop (SLT), 2024, pp. 333–340, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/SLT61566.2024.10832147).\n\n23. Xin Zhou, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, and Yanmin Qian. “Insights from Hyperparameter Scaling of Online Speech Separation.” ISCSLP, 2024, pp. 561–565.\n\n24. Jiahong Li, Chenda Li, Yifei Wu, and Yanmin Qian. “Unified Cross-Modal Attention: Robust Audio-Visual Speech Recognition and Beyond.” IEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing, 2024, pp. 1941–1953, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/TASLP.2024.3375641).\n\n25. Wangyou Zhang, Robin Scheibler, Kohei Saijo, Samuele Cornell, Chenda Li, Zhaoheng Ni, Anurag Kumar, Jan Pirklbauer, Marvin Sach, Shinji Watanabe, Tim Fingscheidt, and Yanmin Qian. “URGENT Challenge: Universality, Robustness, and Generalizability For Speech Enhancement.” Interspeech 2024, 2024, pp. 4868–4872, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2024-1239).\n\n26. Chenda Li, Yao Qian, Zhuo Chen, Naoyuki Kanda, Dongmei Wang, Takuya Yoshioka, Yanmin Qian, and Michael Zeng. “Adapting Multi-Lingual ASR Models for Handling Multiple Talkers.” Interspeech 2023, 2023, pp. 1314–1318, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2023-1276).\n\n27. Yifei Wu, Chenda Li, and Yanmin Qian. “Light-Weight Visualvoice: Neural Network Quantization On Audio Visual Speech Separation.” ICASSP 2023, 2023, pp. 1–5, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSPW59220.2023.10193263).\n\n28. Linfeng Yu, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, and Yanmin Qian. “Overlap-Aware Continuous Speech Separation without Permutation Invariant Training.” Interspeech 2023, 2023, pp. 3512–3516, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2023-1530).\n\n29. Chenda Li, Yifei Wu, and Yanmin Qian. “Predictive Skim: Contrastive Predictive Coding for Low-Latency Online Speech Separation.” ICASSP 2023, 2023, pp. 1–5, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP49357.2023.10097107).\n\n30. Jiahong Li, Chenda Li, Yifei Wu, and Yanmin Qian. “Robust Audio-Visual ASR with Unified Cross-Modal Attention.” ICASSP 2023, 2023, pp. 1–5, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP49357.2023.10096893).\n\n31. Chenda Li, Yao Qian, Zhuo Chen, Dongmei Wang, Takuya Yoshioka, Shujie Liu, Yanmin Qian, and Michael Zeng. “Target Sound Extraction with Variable Cross-Modality Clues.” ICASSP 2023, 2023, pp. 1–5, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP49357.2023.10095266).\n\n32. Chenda Li, Zhuo Chen, and Yanmin Qian. “Dual-Path Modeling With Memory Embedding Model for Continuous Speech Separation.” IEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing, 2022, pp. 1508–1520, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/TASLP.2022.3165712).\n\n33. Yen-Ju Lu, Xuankai Chang, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Samuele Cornell, Zhaoheng Ni, Yoshiki Masuyama, Brian Yan, Robin Scheibler, Zhong-Qiu Wang, Yu Tsao, Yanmin Qian, and Shinji Watanabe. “ESPnet-SE++: Speech Enhancement for Robust Speech Recognition, Translation, and Understanding.” Interspeech 2022, 2022, pp. 5458–5462, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2022-10727).\n\n34. Bowen Qu, Chenda Li, Jinfeng Bai, and Yanmin Qian. “Improving Speech Separation with Knowledge Distilled from Self-Supervised Pre-Trained Models.” ISCSLP, 2022, pp. 329–333, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ISCSLP57327.2022.10038203).\n\n35. Chenda Li, Lei Yang, Weiqin Wang, and Yanmin Qian. “Skim: Skipping Memory Lstm for Low-Latency Real-Time Continuous Speech Separation.” ICASSP 2022, 2022, pp. 681–685, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP43922.2022.9746372).\n\n36. Wei Wang, Xun Gong, Yifei Wu, Zhikai Zhou, Chenda Li, Wangyou Zhang, Bing Han, and Yanmin Qian. “The Sjtu System For Multimodal Information Based Speech Processing Challenge 2021.” ICASSP 2022, 2022, pp. 9261–9265, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP43922.2022.9746874).\n\n37. Yifei Wu, Chenda Li, Jinfeng Bai, Zhongqin Wu, and Yanmin Qian. “Time-Domain Audio-Visual Speech Separation on Low Quality Videos.” ICASSP 2022, 2022, pp. 256–260, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP43922.2022.9746866).\n\n38. Yen-Ju Lu, Samuele Cornell, Xuankai Chang, Wangyou Zhang, Chenda Li, Zhaoheng Ni, Zhong-Qiu Wang, and Shinji Watanabe. “Towards Low-Distortion Multi-Channel Speech Enhancement: The ESPNET-Se Submission to the L3DAS22 Challenge.” ICASSP 2022, 2022, pp. 9201–9205, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP43922.2022.9747146).\n\n39. Yifei Wu, Chenda Li, Song Yang, Zhongqin Wu, and Yanmin Qian. “Audio-Visual Multi-Talker Speech Recognition in a Cocktail Party.” Interspeech 2021, 2021, pp. 3021–3025, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2021-2128).\n\n40. Wangyou Zhang, Jing Shi, Chenda Li, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Closing the Gap Between Time-Domain Multi-Channel Speech Enhancement on Real and Simulation Conditions.” 2021 IEEE Workshop on Applications of Signal Processing to Audio and Acoustics (WASPAA), 2021, pp. 146–150, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/WASPAA52581.2021.9632720).\n\n41. Cong Han, Yi Luo, Chenda Li, Tianyan Zhou, Keisuke Kinoshita, Shinji Watanabe, Marc Delcroix, Hakan Erdogan, John R. Hershey, Nima Mesgarani, and Zhuo Chen. “Continuous Speech Separation Using Speaker Inventory for Long Recording.” Interspeech 2021, 2021, pp. 3036–3040, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2021-338).\n\n42. Chenda Li, Zhuo Chen, Yi Luo, Cong Han, Tianyan Zhou, Keisuke Kinoshita, Marc Delcroix, Shinji Watanabe, and Yanmin Qian. “Dual-Path Modeling for Long Recording Speech Separation in Meetings.” ICASSP 2021, 2021, pp. 5739–5743, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP39728.2021.9414127).\n\n43. Chenda Li, Yi Luo, Cong Han, Jinyu Li, Takuya Yoshioka, Tianyan Zhou, Marc Delcroix, Keisuke Kinoshita, Christoph Boeddeker, Yanmin Qian, Shinji Watanabe, and Zhuo Chen. “Dual-Path RNN for Long Recording Speech Separation.” 2021 IEEE Spoken Language Technology Workshop (SLT), 2021, pp. 865–872, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/SLT48900.2021.9383514).\n\n44. Chenda Li, Jing Shi, Wangyou Zhang, Aswin Shanmugam Subramanian, Xuankai Chang, Naoyuki Kamo, Moto Hira, Tomoki Hayashi, Christoph Boeddeker, Zhuo Chen, and Shinji Watanabe. “ESPnet-SE: End-To-End Speech Enhancement and Separation Toolkit Designed for ASR Integration.” 2021 IEEE Spoken Language Technology Workshop (SLT), 2021, pp. 785–792, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/SLT48900.2021.9383615).\n\n45. Pengcheng Guo, Florian Boyer, Xuankai Chang, Tomoki Hayashi, Yosuke Higuchi, Hirofumi Inaguma, Naoyuki Kamo, Chenda Li, Daniel Garcia-Romero, Jiatong Shi, Jing Shi, Shinji Watanabe, Kun Wei, Wangyou Zhang, and Yuekai Zhang. “Recent Developments on Espnet Toolkit Boosted By Conformer.” ICASSP 2021, 2021, pp. 5874–5878, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP39728.2021.9414858).\n\n46. Yi Luo, Zhuo Chen, Cong Han, Chenda Li, Tianyan Zhou, and Nima Mesgarani. “Rethinking The Separation Layers In Speech Separation Networks.” ICASSP 2021, 2021, pp. 1–5, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP39728.2021.9414176).\n\n47. Shinji Watanabe, Florian Boyer, Xuankai Chang, Pengcheng Guo, Tomoki Hayashi, Yosuke Higuchi, Takaaki Hori, Wen-Chin Huang, Hirofumi Inaguma, Naoyuki Kamo, Shigeki Karita, Chenda Li, Jing Shi, Aswin Shanmugam Subramanian, and Wangyou Zhang. “The 2020 ESPnet Update: New Features, Broadened Applications, Performance Improvements, and Future Plans.” 2021 IEEE Data Science and Learning Workshop (DSLW), 2021, pp. 1–6, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/DSLW51110.2021.9523402).\n\n48. Chenda Li and Yanmin Qian. “Deep Audio-Visual Speech Separation with Attention Mechanism.” ICASSP 2020, 2020, pp. 7314–7318, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP40776.2020.9054180).\n\n49. Chenda Li and Yanmin Qian. “Listen, Watch and Understand at the Cocktail Party: Audio-Visual-Contextual Speech Separation.” Interspeech 2020, 2020, pp. 1426–1430, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2020-2028).\n\n50. Chenda Li and Yanmin Qian. “Prosody Usage Optimization for Children Speech Recognition with Zero Resource Children Speech.” Interspeech 2019, 2019, pp. 3446–3450, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.21437/Interspeech.2019-2659).\n\n资助项目\n\n上海交通大学 Explore X 基金，2025年\n\n腾讯 AI Lab 犀牛鸟专项研究计划｜入选项目，2025年\n\n获奖信息\n\n2025年｜华为公司火花奖。\n\n2025年｜入选 Microsoft Research Asia 2025 StarTrack Program。\n\n2025年｜上海交通大学计算机学院优秀论文指导教师。\n\n2022年｜L3DAS22 挑战赛三维语音增强赛道第一名（ICASSP 2022）。\n\n2022年｜MISP 挑战赛音视频语音识别赛道第三名。\n\n2021年｜第十六届全国人机语音通讯学术会议博士生论坛最佳口头报告。\n\n学术服务\n\n期刊审稿\nIEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing (TASLP)、Speech Communication 等。\n\n会议审稿\nICASSP、Interspeech、AAAI、ACL 等。	\N
