 图像工程 ### 科研项目 主持的科研项目 1. 国家自然科学基金面上项目：“基于非凸目标函数的稀疏学习及其在医疗诊断中的应用”(61273298) 承担的科研项目 1. 国家重点基础研究发展计划(973)课题：“多源异质数据的信息提取与快速变化检测” (2011CB707104)‚ 2011-2015. 学术骨干 (负责人: 张桂戌教授) 2. 国家自然基金面上项目：“与图像处理相关的几何热流问题及其应用” (10971066)‚ 2010.1-2012.12. 参与 曾受以下基金资助 上海市科协青年科技人才飞翔计划 (2010) ### 学术成果 论文列表及引用情况请参见 [Google Scholar](http://scholar.google.com/citations?user=axtR_4QAAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao)、[DBLP](https://dblp.org/pid/32/3402-1.html)、[ResearchGate](https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Chaomin-Shen-28852371)、[OpenReview](https://openreview.net/profile?id=~Chaomin_Shen1)、[IEEE Xplore](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/author/37829584900)、[Semantic Scholar](https://www.semanticscholar.org/author/Chaomin-Shen/1684866)、[Paper with Code](https://paperswithcode.com/search?q=author%3AChaomin+Shen)、[ORCID](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9389-6472)、[ScholarMate](https://www.scholarmate.com/psnweb/homepage/show?des3PsnId=TZgthystGyo%253D)、[Catalyzex](https://www.catalyzex.com/author/Chaomin%20Shen)、[Aminer(中文)](https://www.aminer.cn/profile/chaomin-shen/53f4575adabfaeee22a37a2c)、[全球学者库](http://www.globalauthorid.com/WebPortal/AuthorView?wd=GAID10233609&rc=KO4X09) 至2025.3， Google Scholar引用 1195, H-index 19. 代表性成果： C. Shen, Y. Huang, H. Zhu, J. Fan, G. Zhang, ``Student-oriented teacher knowledge refinement for knowledge distillation,”in ACM Multimedia, 4543-4552, 2024. J. Wen, Y. Zhu*,J. Li, M. Zhu, Z. Tang, K. Wu, Z. Xu, N. Liu, R. Cheng, C.Shen*, Y. Peng, F. Feng, and J. Tang, “TinyVLA: Towards fast, data-efficient vision-language-action models for robotic manipulation," IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters, Early Access, DOI: 10.1109/LRA.2025.3544909, 2025. M. Zhu, Y. Zhu*, N. Liu, X. Liu, Z. Xu, C. Shen*, Y. Peng, ``Mipha: A Comprehensive Overhaul of Multimodal Assistant with Small Language Models,'' to appear in AAAI 2025. M. Zhu, Y. Zhu, J. Li, J. Wen, Z. Xu, Z. Che, C. Shen*, Y. Peng, D. Liu, F. Feng, and J. Tang*, ``Language-conditioned robotic manipulation with fast and slow thinking,'' in ICRA, 4333-4339, 2024. J. Wen, Y. Zhu, M. Zhu, J. Li, Z. Xu, Z. Che, C. Shen*, Y. Peng, D. Liu, F. Feng, and J. Tang*, ``Object-centric instruction augmentation for robotic manipulation,'' in ICRA, 4318-4325, 2024. ### 荣誉及奖励 |\n\n| |\n\n| |\n\n| 10 访问 |\n\n| ### 相关教师 |	\N
