ty Theory](https://notes.sjtu.edu.cn/s/vwJHPOfSJ) (Fall 2023)\n\n- [CS3958: Topics in Modern Algorithms](https://notes.sjtu.edu.cn/s/vFVUoTUUp) (Fall 2023)\n\n- [CS1212: Introduction to Theoretical Computer Science](https://notes.sjtu.edu.cn/s/7aZT8HBsl) (Fall 2023)\n\n- [CS1961: Combinatorics in Computer Science](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/Comb2023/) (Spring 2023)\n\n- [AI2613: Stochastic Processes](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/SP2023/) (Spring 2023)\n\n- [CS1961: Combinatorics in Computer Science](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/Comb2022/) (Fall 2022)\n\n- [CS3958: Advanced Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/AA2022/) (Fall 2022)\n\n- [CS1212: Introduction to Theoretical Computer Science](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/IntroTCS2022/) (Fall 2022)\n\n- [AI2613: Stochastic Processes](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/SP2022spring/) (Spring 2022)\n\n- [AI2615: Design and Analysis of Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/Algo2022spring/) (Spring 2022)\n\n- [CS3958: Advanced Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/AA2021fall/) (Fall 2021)\n\n- [AI2613: Stochastic Processes](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/SP2021spring/) (Spring 2021)\n\n- [AI2615: Design and Analysis of Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/Algo2021spring/) (Spring 2021)\n\n- [EI374: Advanced Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/AA2020fall/) (Fall 2020)\n\n- [CS7346: Algorithms for Big Data](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/BDA2020fall/) (Fall 2020)\n\n- [EI374: Advanced Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/AA2020spring/) (Spring 2020)\n\n- [CS243: Algorithms for Big Data](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/BDA2019fall/) (Fall 2019)\n\n- [EI374: Advanced Algorithms](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching/AA2019spring/) (Spring 2019)\n\n论文发表\n\nFor the most up-to-date information and better formatting, please see [https://chihaozhang.com/papers.html](https://chihaozhang.com/teaching.html).\n\n- [Improved sampling algorithms and Poincaré inequalities for non-log-concave distributions](https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.11236) with [Yuchen He](https://yuchen-he00.github.io/), Zhehan Lei and Jianan Shao Manuscript, 2025\n\n- [Tight regret bounds for fixed-price bilateral trade](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.04349) with Houshuang Chen, [Yaonan Jin](https://yj10027.github.io/) and [Pinyan Lu](http://pinyanlu.com/) Manuscript, 2025\n\n- [On the query complexity of sampling from non-log-concave distributions](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.06200) with [Yuchen He](https://yuchen-he00.github.io/) The 38th Annual Conference on Learning Theory (COLT 2025)\n\n- [Decay of correlation for edge colorings when q>3Δ](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.06586) with Zejia Chen, Yulin Wang and [Zihan Zhang](https://z-z1han.github.io/) The 52nd EATCS International Colloquium on Automata, Languages, and Programming (ICALP 2025)\n\n- [Tight gap-dependent memory-regret trade-off for single-pass streaming stochastic multi-armed bandits](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.02428) with [Zichun Ye](https://alchemistye.github.io/) and Jiahao Zhao The 31st International Computing and Combinatorics Conference (COCOON 2025)\n\n- [FPTAS for Holant problems with log-concave signatures](https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.04989) with [Kun He](https://hekun-theory.com/), [Zhidan Li](https://lizhidan00.github.io/) and Guoliang Qiu The 36th Annual ACM-SIAM Symposium on Discrete Algorithms (SODA 2025)\n\n- [Understanding memory-regret trade-off for streaming stochastic multi-armed bandits](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19752) with [Yuchen He](https://yuchen-he00.github.io/) and [Zichun Ye](https://alchemistye.github.io/) The 36th Annual ACM-SIAM Symposium on Discrete Algorithms (SODA 2025)\n\n- [On the problem of best arm retention](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.11866) with Houshuang Chen and [Yuchen He](https://yuchen-he00.github.io/) Theoretical Computer Science 1041 (2025): 115213 Conference version appeared in the 5th International Joint Conference on Theoretical Computer Science – 18th Frontier of