61f14c27-e4f0-4837-b498-0eecbf92ab97	8d90c524-affe-4dc6-b72d-f470a9466e1f	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/suruidan.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/suruidan.html	9abf8f7f01ba4f14c9a7b41af0a818c5	2026-10-22 09:59:57.567198+00	200	static	utf-8	6bfbd42b1a14ba57be86ec2cf95241c6	# 苏锐丹-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n苏锐丹\n\n助理研究员\n\n邮箱：suruidan@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：通用人工智能研究所\n\n个人简介\n\nI am an research assistant professor at AGI Institute, School of Computer Science, Shanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU). I obtained my B.Eng in Communication Engineering in 2006, and Ph.D degree in Computer Application Technology from Northeastern University, China in 2014.\nPrior to SJTU, I was an Assistant Professor[2015-2021] of [Shanghai Advanced Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences](http://www.sari.ac.cn/), where I worked in field of science is High-speed Train Control Strategy, Computational Intelligence, Software Engineering, Machine Learning and Multiple Object Tracking.\nMy research interest includes machine learning, AI4Science, specifically AI for material design.\n\n工作履历\n\n2015-2021 Shanghai Advanced Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n2021- School of Computer Science, Shanghai Jiao Tong University\n\n论文发表\n\n- ｜Tianshu Zhang, Ruidan Su*, Anli Zhong, Minwei Fang, Yu-dong Zhang*, "[From Data to Deployment: A Comprehensive Analysis of Risks in Large Language Model Research and Development](https://ietresearch.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1049/ise2/7358963)". IET Information Security, 2025 (CCF-C 期刊)\n\n- ｜Ruidan Su, Chun Chi, Shikui Tu, Lei Xu. “[A Deep Reinforcement Learning Approach for Portfolio Management in Non-Short-Selling Market](https://ietresearch.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1049/2024/5399392)". IET Signal Processing, 2024. (CCF-C 期刊)\n\n- ｜Yao Zhou, Ruidan Su, Shikui Tu* and Lei Xu*. "[A Deep Temporal Factor Analysis Method for Large Scale Financial Portfolio Selection](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10095847)," ICASSP 2023 - 2023 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP), Rhodes Island, Greece, 04-10 June 2023, pp. 1-5 (CCF-B 会议) [[codes]](https://github.com/CMACH508/DFA-PS)\n\n- ｜盛庆杰, 苏锐丹, 涂仕奎, 徐雷. “[基于Lmser-in-Lmser双向网络的人脸素描图像生成方法](http://manu46.magtech.com.cn/Jweb_prai/CN/Y2022/V35/I7/589)"[J]. 模式识别与人工智能, 2022, 35(7): 589-601 (CCF 中文T2) [[codes]](https://github.com/CMACH508/Lmser-in-Lmser)\n\n- ｜Guo,Xiangzhe;Su,Ruidan; Tu,Shikui;Xu,Lei. "[Searching for Textual Adversarial Examples with Learned Strategy](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-981-99-1639-9_32)" International Conference on Neural Information Processing (ICONIP 2022), Part of the Communications in Computer and Information Science book series(CCF-C 会议)\n\n- ｜Liu,Sheng;Xiao,Ziya;You,Xiaoming;Su,Ruidan*. "[Multistrategy boosted multicolony whale virtual parallel optimization approaches](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0950705122001253)", KNOWLEDGE-BASED SYSTEMS, April 2022(CCF-C 期刊)\n\n- ｜R Su, H Liu, YD Zhang, M Soleimani, "Deep processing of multimedia data", Multimedia Tools and Applications 81, 18977, 2022\n\n- ｜K. Zhang, W. Huang, X. Hou, J. Xu, and R. Su*, "A Fault Diagnosis and Visualization Method for High-Speed Train Based on Edge and Cloud Collaboration," Applied Sciences, vol. 11, no. 3, p. 1251, 2021.\n\n- ｜W. Huang, Y. Li, K. Zhang, X. Hou, J. Xu, and R. Su*, "An Efficient Multi-Scale Focusing Attention Network for Person Re-Identification," Applied Sciences, 2021.\n\n- ｜