afa3e3a7-2b5c-49ab-b676-8b4d2e1bc06b	5609269f-9de7-44fd-bc35-5dd1048eed64	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huacunqing.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huacunqing.html	64396b8bdcd544f55834cb89825b9021	2026-10-22 10:21:58.287734+00	200	static	utf-8	cc2d835fcc755b5b84c9c025af0384c4	# 化存卿-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n化存卿\n\n教授\n\n邮箱：cqhua@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：东川路800软件大楼5-203\n\n所在研究所：系统安全研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院）教授、博士生导师，长期从事无线通信与网络空间安全交叉领域研究，在IEEE Journal on Selected Areas in Communications、IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security、IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing、IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications等国际权威期刊及IEEE INFOCOM、ICML、WiSec、ICC、Globecom等旗舰会议发表学术论文150余篇，出版英文专著1部，获授国际PCT及国内发明专利20余项。 先后主持国家重点研发计划、国家863计划、国家自然科学基金等国家级科研项目和企业合作项目20余项。目前主持国家自然科学基金航运联合基金重点项目“甚高频数据交换系统（VDES）海上广域船舶通信关键技术”（2026—2029），聚焦下一代海事通信系统在广域覆盖与容量增强、高效频谱利用及安全弹性等方面的基础理论与关键技术；同时主持国家自然科学基金面上项目“基于神经塌陷的无源开放世界射频指纹识别技术研究”（2027—2030），围绕AI赋能的6G物理层安全，探索开放动态环境下的射频指纹识别机制。\n\n研究方向主要涉及6G网络、卫星互联网等领域，聚焦AI驱动的智能无线网络和内生安全技术等方向，包括但不限于：\n\n- AI驱动的卫星互联网高效组网与传输技术：涵盖低轨星座动态资源调度、星间协作通信与干扰认知管理；\n\n- 面向卫星互联网的零信任安全机制：涵盖星地链路持续认证、分布式接入控制、星地协同安全防御机制等；\n\n- 基于区块链的星地融合可信安全与分布式信任机制：基于联盟链/DID/智能合约的去中心化信任锚、跨域动态授权、威胁情报共享与防篡改审计\n\n- 星地融合网络架构与协议：涵盖异构网络无缝切换、星地协同传输与服务质量保障；\n\n- 智能频谱管控与动态共享：涵盖频谱态势感知、干扰智能规避、多域频谱协同调度、低空无人机频谱监测；\n\n- AI内生的6G物理层安全机制：涵盖基于深度学习的射频指纹识别、物理层密钥生成与无线信道特征认证；\n\n- 无线AI安全与对抗性防御：涵盖针对无线AI模型的投毒攻击防御、对抗样本检测及鲁棒学习理论。\n\n教育背景\n\n2003.8~2006.7 香港中文大学讯息工程系 博士\n\n2000.8~2002.7 香港中文大学讯息工程系 硕士\n\n1995.9~2000.7 中国科技大学电子工程系 本科\n\n工作履历\n\n2025.01~至今 上海交通大学计算机学院 教授\n\n2017.01~2024.12 上海交通大学网络空间安全学院 教授\n\n2011.07~2016.12 上海交通大学信息安全工程学院 副教授\n\n2008.12~2011.06 浙江大学信息与电子工程学系 副教授\n\n2006.09~2008.12 美国德州休斯顿大学计算机系 博士后\n\n教授课程\n\n本科课程：无线网络安全\n\n研究生课程：空间信息网络与安全前沿技术\n\n论文发表\n\n无线网络与系统安全\n\n- Kunling Li, Cunqing Hua, Source-Free Open-World RF Fingerprint Identification, ICML 2026.\n\n- Rilong Qian, Cunqing Hua, Xiaoliang Yin, Pengwenlong Gu, Unified Online Traffic Analyzer and Scheduling Engine in 5G Open-RAN, ACM Workshop on Wireless Security and Machine Learning 2026 (WiseML 2026)\n\n- Zhaoyi Lu, Wenchao Xu, Yuhan Zhang, Cunqing Hua, Black-Box RF Fingerprint Spoofing via Surrogate-Guided Generative Perturbations, ACM Conference on Security and Privacy in Wireless and Mobile Networks (ACM WiSec 2026).\n\n- Jiaping Gui, Ruiwen Ji, Haishi Huang, Jianan Hong,Cunqing Hua, Solving Data Contamination in DDoS Detection: A Method Based on Hierarchical Federated Learning, IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, vol. 20, pp. 7013-7028, 2025.\n\n- Zhaoyi Lu, Wenchao Xu, Cunqing Hua, Ming Tu, Xin Xie，Identity-Preserving Covert Communication with Generative Perturbation，IEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering, vol. 13, pp. 3701-3719, 2026\n\n- Zhaoyi Lu, Ming Tu, Xin Xie, Wenchao Xu, Cunqing Hua and Weihua Zhuang, Concealing Radio Frequency Fingerprints via Active Adversarial Perturbation，IEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering, vol. 12, no. 5, pp. 4098-4113, Sept.-Oct. 2025.\n\n- Kunling Li, Jiazhong Bao, Xin Xie, Jianan Hong, Cunqing Hua，Receiver-Agnostic Radio Frequency Fingerprint Identification for Zero-Trust Wireless Networks，IEEE Journal of Selected Area in Communications, vol. 43, no. 6, pp. 1981-1997, June 2025.\n\n- Xin Xie, Jianan Hong, Yanhong Xu, Cunqing Hua, Communication Efficient Ciphertext-Field Aggregation in Wireless Networks via Over-the-Air Computation, IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics & Security, vol. 20, pp. 31-45, 2025.\n\n- Xin Xie, Cunqing Hua, Jianan Hong, Wenchao Xu, Optimal Power Control and CSI Acquisition for Over-the-Air Computation in OFDM System, IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, Volume: 23, Issue: 6, June 2024\n\n- Xin Xie, Cunqing Hua, Jianan Hong, Pengwenlong Gu, Wenchao Xu, AirCon: Over-the-Air Consensus for Wireless Blockchain Networks, IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing, vol. 23, no. 5, pp. 4566-4582, May 2024.\n\n- Liang Feng, Cunqing Hua, Lingya Liu and Jianan Hong, Quality and Diversity Balanced Neighbor Selection against Eclipse Attack in Blockchain System, IEEE Transactions on Network and Service Management, vol. 22, no. 6, pp. 6037-6047, Dec. 2025\n\n- Liang Feng, Cunqing Hua and Jianan Hong, Zero-Determinant Incentive Strategy for Transaction Trading in Blockchain System, IEEE Transactions on Network and Service Management, vol. 22, no. 3, pp. 2311-2322, June 2025.\n\n- Pengwenlong Gu, Cunqing Hua, Rida Khatoun, Yue Wu, Ahmed Serhrouchni, Control Channel Anti-Jamming in Vehicular Networks via Cooperative Relay Beamforming, IEEE Internet of Things Journal, vol. 6, issue 9, Feb. 2020\n\n卫星网络组网与传输技术\n\n- Jindi Chen, Cunqing Hua, Lingya Liu, Haihua Xie, Siyue Sun, Pengwenlong Gu, Theoretical Analysis and Adaptive Optimization of Random Access for VDE-SAT Systems, IEEE ICC 2026\n\n- Yuhan Zhang,Cunqing Hua, Lingya Liu, Pengwenlong Gu, Zhuochen Xie, Guisong Yang, DS-Route: GNN-based Flow-Level Latency Prediction in Software-Defined LEO Satellite Networks, IEEE INFOCOM 2026\n\n- Yuhan Zhang,Cunqing Hua, Lingya Liu, Pengwenlong Gu, Zhaoyi Lu, Ping Du, Lightweight RL-Based Raptor Codes for Inter-Satellite Transmission in LEO Satellite Network, accepted by IEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering, May 2026.\n\n- Jinsong Yu, Cunqing Hua, Lingya Liu, Pengwenlong Gu, Accurate Beam Tracking for Robust USV-to-Satellite Transmission under Wave Fluctuation, IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, vol. 25, pp. 16320-16335, 2026.\n\n- Yuhan Zhang,Cunqing Hua, Lingya 