e5e68a4f-da60-4ea0-8206-060af052dfb4	7363426f-d142-4f29-89a5-2494618fa448	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaohan.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaohan.html	8cd3fdcd3f82a890a13977023f5fbdad	2026-10-22 10:34:11.656162+00	200	static	utf-8	dea551d2248294ca55aaa840f0998937	# 赵涵-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n赵涵\n\n助理研究员\n\n邮箱：zhaohan_miven@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：电院3号楼119\n\n所在研究所：先进计算研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://mivenhan.github.io/](https://mivenhan.github.io/)\n\n个人简介\n\nI am an assistant professor at [Computer Science and Engineering Department](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/) in [Shanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU)](https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/). I received the Master and Ph.D. degrees from Shanghai Jiao Tong University under the supervision of [Prof. Quan Chen](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~chen-quan/index_EN.html) and [Prof. Minyi Guo](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~guo-my/). For now, I still work closely with [Prof. Quan Chen](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~chen-quan/index_EN.html) and [Assist Prof. Weihao Cui](https://raphael-hao.top/).\n\nMy previous research focused on:\n\n- Task scheduling across various architectures\n\n- Resource management in datacenters\n\n- DNN inference system design\n\nCurrently, my research focus on:\n\n- Cloud computing and deep learning systems\n\n- LLM inference and training systems\n\n- Serverless architectures for diverse applications\n\n- Advanced resource management in datacenters\n\nI am now looking for perspective Undergraduate Students and Master Students (Enrollment Date: 2026.09). If you are interested in above areas, we should talk.\n\n教育背景\n\n- 2019.09 – 2022.06, Shanghai Jiao Tong University Doctor\n\n- 2016.09 – 2019.03, Shanghai Jiao Tong University Master\n\n- 2012.09 – 2016.06, Huazhong University of Science and Technology Bachelor\n\n教授课程\n\n- 2023.1 - Now, Intelligent Computing Systems 智能计算系统\n\n- 2023.1 - Now, Parallel Computing and Parallel Algorithms 并行计算与并行算法\n\n论文发表\n\n### Preprint\n\n- * Denotes the Corresponding author.\n\n- ^ Denotes the Equal contribution.\n\n- Chuhao Xu, Zijun Li, Quan Chen, Han Zhao, Minyi Guo. LLM-Mesh: Enabling Elastic Sharing for Serverless LLM Inference. (On Arxiv)\n\n- Weihao Cui, Ji Zhang, Han Zhao*, Chao Liu, Wenhao Zhang, Jian Sha, Quan Chen, Bingsheng He, Minyi Guo. Xputimer: Anomaly diagnostics for divergent llm training in gpu clusters of thousand-plus scale. (On Arxiv)\n\n- Weihao Cui, Ziyi Xu, Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Zijun Li, Bingsheng He, Minyi Guo. Efficient Function-as-a-Service for Large Language Models with TIDAL. (On Arxiv)\n\n- Weihao Cui^, Yukang Chen^, Han Zhao^, Ziyi Xu, Quan Chen, Xusheng Chen, Yangjie Zhou, Shixuan Sun, Minyi Guo, M. Optimizing SLO-oriented LLM Serving with PD-Multiplexing. (On Arxiv)\n\n- Chunyu Xue, Weihao Cui, Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Shulai Zhang, Pengyu Yang, Jing Yang, Shaobo Li, Minyi Guo. A codesign of scheduling and parallelization for large model training in heterogeneous clusters. (On Arxiv)\n\n### Published\n\n- Shulai Zhang, Ao Xu, Quan Chen, Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Zhen Wang, Yan Li, Limin Xiao, Minyi Guo. Efficient Performance-Aware GPU Sharing with Compatibility and Isolation through Kernel Space Interception . ATC2025 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Zijun Li, Zhenhua Han, Nan Wang, Yu Feng, Jieru Zhao, Chen Chen, Jingwen Leng, Minyi Guo. EDAS: Enabling Fast Data Loading for GPU Serverless Computing. TACO2025 (CCF-A)\n\n- Pengyu Yang, Weihao Cui, Chunyu Xue, Han Zhao, Chen Chen, Quan Chen, Jing Yang, Minyi Guo. Taming Flexible Job Packing in Deep Learning Training Clusters. TACO2025 (CCF-A)\n\n- Yifu He, Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Weihao Cui, Minyi Guo. ARACHNE: Optimizing distributed parallel applications with reduced inter-process communication. TACO2025 (CCF-A)\n\n- Shulai Zhang, Quan Chen, Weihao Cui, Han Zhao, Chunyu Xue, Zhen Zheng, Wei Lin, Minyi Guo. Improving GPU Sharing Performance through Adaptive Bubbleless Spatial-Temporal Sharing. Eurosys2025 (CCF-A)\n\n- Yu Feng, Weikai Lin, Zihan Liu, Jingwen Leng, Minyi Guo, Han Zhao, Xiaofeng Hou, Jieru Zhao, Yuhao Zhu. Potamoi: Accelerating neural rendering via a unified streaming architecture. TACO2024 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao^, Junxiao Deng^, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Youtao Zhang, Deze Zeng, Minyi Guo. Adaptive Kernel Fusion for Improving the GPU Utilization while Ensuring QoS. TC2024 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Junxiao Deng, Weihao Cui, Deze Zeng, Jing Yang, Minyi Guo. Exploiting all intra-SM parallelism to maximize the throughput while ensuring QoS. Chinese Science Information Science 2024 (CCF-A)\n\n- Chuhao Xu, Yiyu Liu, Zijun Li, Quan Chen, Han Zhao, Deze Zeng, Qian Peng, Xueqi Wu, Haifeng Zhao, Senbo Fu, Minyi Guo. FaaSMem: Improving Memory Efficiency of Serverless Computing with Memory Pool Architecture. In ASPLOS2024 (CCF-A)\n\n- Binghao Chen, Han Zhao*, Weihao Cui, Yifu He, Shulai Zhang, Quan Chen, Zijun Li, Minyi Guo. Maximizing the Utilization of GPUs Used by Cloud Gaming through Adaptive Co-location with Combo. SoCC2023 (CCF-B)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Jingwen Leng, Deze Zeng, Minyi Guo. Improving Cluster Utilization Through Adaptive Resource Management for Deep Neural Network and CPU Jobs Colocation. TC2023 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Minyi Guo. ISPA: Exploiting Intra-SM Parallelism in GPUs via Fine-grained Resource Management. TC2022 (CCF-A)\n\n- Weihao Cui, Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Hao Wei, Zirui Li, Deze Zeng, Chao Li, Minyi Guo. DVABatch: Diversity-aware Multi-Entry Multi-Exit Batching for Efficient Processing of DNN Services on GPUs. ATC2022 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Youtao Zhang, Yanchao Lu, Chao Li, Jingwen Leng, Minyi Guo. Tacker:Tensor-CUDA Core Kernel Fusion for Improving the GPU Utilization while Ensuring QoS. HPCA2022 (CCF-A)\n\n- Weihao Cui, Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Ningxin Zheng, Jingwen Leng, Jieru Zhao, Zhuo Song, Tao Ma, Yong Yang, Chao Li, Minyi Guo. Enable Simultaneous DNN Services Based on Deterministic Operator Overlap and Precise Latency Prediction. SC2021 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Jieru Zhao, Jingwen Leng, Minyi Guo. Exploiting Intra-SM Parallelism in GPUs via Persistent and Elastic Blocks. ICCD2021 (CCF-B)\n\n- Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Han Zhao, Mengze Wei, Xiaoxin Tang, Minyi Guo. E2bird: Enhanced Elastic Batch for Improving Responsiveness and Throughput of Deep Learning Services. TPDS2020 (CCF-A)\n\n- Han Zhao, Weihao Cui, Quan Chen, Jingwen Leng, Kai Yu, Deze Zeng, Chao Li, Minyi Guo. CODA: Improving Resource Utilization by Slimming and Co-locating DNN and CPU Jobs. ICDCS2020 (CCF-B)\n\n- Han Zhao, Quan Chen, Yuxian Qiu, Ming Wu, Yao Shen, Jingwen Leng, Chao Li, Minyi Guo. Bandwidth and Locality Aware Task-stealing for Manycore Architectures with Bandwidth-Asymmetric Memory. TACO2019 (CCF-A)\n\n-\n\n资助项目\n\n### National Project\n\n- 2024-2026, 国家自然科学基金青年项目，服务器无感知计算的加速器高效共享研究（项目负责人）\n\n- 2025-2027, 国家重点研发计划, 针对异构计算平台的资源实时隔离与高效调度系统（实际项目实施）\n\n- 2024-2026, 国家重点研发计划, 面向新一代国产超算系统的统一并行编程模型与并行编译（子课题负责人）\n\n- 2023-2026, 国家重点研发计划, 新型数据流异构处理器架构及计算系统（子课题负责人）\n\n### Industrial Project\n\n- 2025-2026, CCF-蚂蚁绿色基金, 最小化大模型推理成本：同构及异构模型极致合并部署降本研究（项目负责人）\n\n- 2024-2025, HW云联合实验室, 大模型推理服务与微调任务的高效混部关键技术研究技术（项目负责人）\n\n- 2023-2024, HW委托研究项目, 源码并行化检测与提示工具项目（联合项目负责人）\n\n- 2023-2024, HW委托研究项目, 单节点到多节点并行应用源到源翻译工具项目（联合项目负责人）\n\n-\n\n获奖信息\n\n- 2025 CCF Distinguished Paper CCF杰出论文奖\n\n- 2025 MSRA StarTrack Scholar 微软铸星学者\n\n- 2023 CCF Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award in Computer Architecture CCF体系结构优博\n\n- 2021 SC2021 Finalist SC2021最佳实现提名奖	\N
8849360c-921f-482c-990e-6862a7bbdde2	431981d6-1667-47aa-9b2e-81cd7640a8d8	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaojieru.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaojieru.html	343700d418e6a1a8873f8459f53466ee	2026-10-22 10:35:02.760352+00	200	static	utf-8	d7bd65213c9f67608cb72552a533e9e9	# 赵杰茹-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n赵杰茹\n\n长聘教轨副教授\n\n邮箱：zhao-jieru@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：电院3号楼529室\n\n所在研究所：先进计算研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://zjru.github.io/](https://zjru.github.io/)\n\n个人简介\n\n赵杰茹，上海交通大学计算机学院副教授，博士生导师。入选上海市青年科技35人引领计划、上海市海外高层次人才计划和浦江A类人才计划。研究方向包括智能计算系统、计算机体系结构、编译优化、异构计算（GPU、FPGA、NPU）等。面向新兴人工智能模型，从软硬件角度探索其在端侧和云侧等不同场景下的高效部署问题。在HPCA、SC、ISCA、ASPLOS、DAC、ICCAD等领域顶级会议上发表高水平论文50余篇，研究成果多次获得最佳论文奖或最佳论文奖提名，包括ICCAD 2017最佳论文奖、HPCA 2024杰出系统奖，以及5次最佳论文提名（ICCD 2024、ISCA 2024、DATE 2022、SC 2021、CASES 2018）。主持国自然面上项目、青年基金、上海浦江、以及华为、阿里、字节等多项企业课题，参与多项国自然重点项目。自2025年起担任IEEE TCAD编委（AE），受邀担任2025年ICCD硬件架构领域主席，连续多年担任DAC、ICCAD、ICCD等程序委员会委员及TCAD等期刊审稿人。\n\n教育背景\n\n2015年-2020年，香港科技大学，博士\n\n2011年-2015年，南京大学，学士\n\n工作履历\n\n2024年至今，上海交通大学，副教授\n\n2021年-2023年，上海交通大学，助理教授\n\n教授课程\n\n本科生课程《编译原理》，每年春季学期\n\n研究生课程《高级计算机系统结构》，每年秋季学期\n\n论文发表\n\n详见个人主页：[https://zjru.github.io/](https://zjru.github.io/)\n\n我们诚挚欢迎感兴趣的同学加入课题组实习或者读研，欢迎与我联系！\n\n获奖信息\n\n- Shanghai Science and Technology U35 in 2025\n\n- ICCD Best Paper Nomination in 2024\n\n- ISCA Best Paper Nomination in 2024\n\n- HPCA Distinguished Artifact Award in 2024\n\n- Shanghai Overseas High-level Talent in 2022\n\n- DATE Best Paper Nomination in 2022\n\n- Shanghai Pujiang Talent in 2021\n\n- SC Best Reproducibility Advancement Award Finalist in 2021\n\n- HKUST SENG Academic Award for 2018-2019 (Top Research Post-Graduate (Rpg) Award)\n\n- ESWEEK CASES Best Paper Nomination in 2018\n\n- William J. McCalla ICCAD Best Paper Award in 2017\n\n- Hong Kong Ph.D. Fellowship from 2015 to 2019 (Top 3% among more than 4000 applications)\n\n- Outstanding Graduate of Nanjing University in 2015\n\n- National Scholarship (Top 2%) in 2013\n\n学术服务\n\n- 编委\n\n- TCAD Associate Editor\n\n- 学术会议\n\n- ICCD 2025 Track Chair\n\n- ASP-DAC 2022, 2023 SRF Chair\n\n- FPT 2022, 2025 Phd Forum Chair\n\n- ISEDA 2025, 2026 Track Chair\n\n- 程序委员会委员\n\n- DAC: 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025\n\n- ICCAD: 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026\n\n- ASP-DAC: 2025\n\n- FPT: 2021, 2022, 2025\n\n- ISEDA: 2025, 2026	\N
d39ec5c9-4b0b-4bf5-a559-fb815191ea35	867a673f-b526-45d9-ac0b-f077377bf15a	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lichengzhang.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lichengzhang.html	1795e458bcd97b8351959f20095e1a9a	2026-10-23 19:41:06.395107+00	200	static	utf-8	84fc463ddaebf8ce0c1c43ceb14d8490	# 李承璋-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n李承璋\n\n副教授\n\n邮箱：lichengzhang@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：先进网络研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n李承璋，上海交通大学计算机学院长聘教轨副教授、博士生导师，入选国家级海外高层次青年人才，上海市海外高层次青年人才。本科毕业于清华大学，博士毕业于弗吉尼亚理工大学，曾在美国NSF人工智能-边缘网络研究所（NSF AI-EDGE Institute）担任研究科学家。主要研究方向为人工智能与边缘网络的交叉，包括人工智能应用在边缘网络的部署，以及基于人工智能的通信网络优化。已在INFOCOM、MobiHoc、ICDCS、ToN、TMC、JSAC、IoTJ等国际会议/期刊上发表论文40余篇，已发表两项美国专利。目前担任国际会议INFOCOM、MobiHoc、ICDCS的程序委员会委员。\n\n教育背景\n\n2017-08至2022-12，美国，弗吉尼亚理工大学（Virginia Tech），计算机工程，博士，导师Tom Hou（IEEE Fellow）\n\n2013-09至2017-07，清华大学，电子工程系，学士。\n\n工作履历\n\n2024-09至2025-12，美国，NSF人工智能-边缘网络研究所（NSF AI-EDGE Institute），研究科学家（Research Scientist），合作导师 Ness Shroff （IEEE Fellow）\n\n2023-01至 2024-08，美国，俄亥俄州立大学（Ohio State University），博士后，合作导师 Ness Shroff （IEEE Fellow）\n\n2022-05至 2022-08，美国，英伟达公司（NVIDIA Corp），5G工程师\n\n论文发表\n\n代表性论文：\n\n1. Chengzhang Li, Peizhong Ju, Atilla Eryilmaz, and Ness B. Shroff, “Two Levels Are All You Need: Simplifying Data Compression for Timely Edge Classification,” accepted by ACM MobiHoc, 2025.\n\n2. Chengzhang Li, Peizhong Ju, Atilla Eryilmaz, and Ness B. Shroff, “Efficient Multi-dimensional Compression for Network-edge Classification,” in Proc. ACM MobiHoc, pp. 91–100, Athens, Greece, Oct. 7–10, 2024.\n\n3. Chengzhang Li, Shaoran Li, Qingyu Liu, Y. Thomas Hou, Wenjing Lou, and Sastry Kompella, “Eywa: A general approach for scheduler design in AoI optimization,” in Proc. IEEE INFOCOM, 9 pages, New York, USA, May 17–20, 2023.\n\n4. Chengzhang Li, Qingyu Liu, Shaoran Li, Yongce Chen, Y. Thomas Hou, and Wenjing Lou, “On Scheduling with AoI Violation Tolerance,” in Proc. IEEE INFOCOM, 9 pages, virtual conference, May 10–13, 2021.\n\n5. Chengzhang Li, Shaoran Li, Yongce Chen, Y. Thomas Hou, and Wenjing Lou, “AoI Scheduling with Maximum Thresholds,” in Proc. IEEE INFOCOM, pp. 436–445, virtual conference, July 6–9, 2020.\n\n6. Chengzhang Li, Yan Huang, Yongce Chen, Brian Jalaian, Y. Thomas Hou, and Wenjing Lou, “Kronos: A 5G Scheduler for AoI Minimization under Dynamic Channel Conditions,” in Proc. IEEE ICDCS, pp. 1466–1475, Dallas, TX, July 7–10, 2019.\n\n7. Chengzhang Li, Shaoran Li, and Y. Thomas Hou, “A General Model for Minimizing Age of Information at Network Edge,” in Proc. IEEE INFOCOM, pp. 118–126, Paris, France, April 29–May 2, 2019.\n\n学术服务\n\n程序委员会委员：\n\nIEEE INFOCOM 2024-2027\n\nACM MobiHoc 2026\n\nIEEE ICDCS 2026\n\n审稿人：\n\nIEEE/ACM ToN, IEEE TIT, IEEE TWC, IEEE TNSE, IEEE ISIT, IEEE Comm. Magazine, AAAI AI Magazine, Nature Scientific Reports.	\N
d3c8c028-71bc-4dc8-9b53-2e943673c33a	37acdf2e-4897-47ef-a1b1-619510def61c	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liqinya.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liqinya.html	f85d23a881b2a2c70b31b9d6feb0e734	2026-10-23 19:41:17.749098+00	200	static	utf-8	af92fe9e2115a4e974fdfc3402ceae9f	# 李沁雅-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n李沁雅\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：qinyali@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：先进网络研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n主要从事移动计算、边缘智能、移动端人工智能、分布式机器学习等方向的研究，长期招收博士生、硕士生和本科生！\n\n教育背景\n\n2015.9-2020.8 上海交通大学 计算机科学与技术 博士\n\n2011.9-2015.6 东北大学 物联网工程 本科\n\n工作履历\n\n2021-2024 上海交通大学 助理研究员\n\n2024-至今 上海交通大学 副研究员\n\n教授课程\n\n操作系统课程设计 2023 2024 2025\n\n程序设计思想与方法（C++） 2023 2024 2025\n\n论文发表\n\n部分代表性论文如下：\n\n会议\n\n1. Kewei Zhao, Xiaowei Hu, Qinya Li*; Device-Cloud Collaborative Learning Framework for Efficient Unknown Object Detection, ACM MM 2025. (CCF-A) (通讯作者)\n\n2. Zewei Xin, Qinya Li*, Chaoyue Niu*, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen; Adaptive Routing of Text-to-Image Generation Requests Between Large Cloud Model and Light-Weight Edge Model, ICCV 2025. (CCF-A) (共同通讯)\n\n3. Xu Jinda, Yuhao Song, Daming Wang, weiwei Zhao, Minghua Chen, Kangliang Chen, Qinya Li*; Quality over Quantity: Boosting Data Efficiency through Ensembled Multimodal Data Curation, AAAI 2025. (CCF-A) (通讯作者)\n\n4. Zhuomin He, Yizhen Yao, Pengfei Zuo, Bin Gao, Qinya Li*, Zhenzhe Zheng, Fan Wu; AdaSkip: Adaptive Sublayer Skipping for Accelerating Long-Context LLM Inference, AAAI 2025. (CCF-A) (通讯作者)\n\n5. Qinya Li; Zhenzhe Zheng; Fan Wu; Guhai Chen ; Generative Adversarial Networks-based Privacy-Preserving 3D Reconstruction, 2020 IEEE/ACM 28th International Symposium on Quality of Service (IWQoS), Online, 2020-6-15至2020-6-17 (CCF-B)\n\n6. Qinya Li; Fan Wu; Guhai Chen ; ImgPricing: Everyone Can Earn Proper Rewards by Simply Taking Photos, 2018 IEEE/ACM 26th International Symposium on Quality of Service (IWQoS), Banff, AB, Canada, 2018-6-4至2018-6-6 (CCF-B)\n\n7. Rui Xing, Zhenzhe Zheng, Qinya Li, Fan Wu, and Guihai Chen. "Distributed Model Interpretation for Vertical Federated Learning with Feature Discrepancy." in IEEE/ACM International Symposium on Quality of Service (IWQoS). 2023. (CCF-B)\n\n8. Songli Zhang; Zhenzhe Zheng; Qinya Li; Fan Wu; Guihai Chen. Mobility-Aware Device Sampling for Statistical Heterogeneity in Hierarchical Federated Learning, in 2024 IEEE 44th International Conference on Distributed Computing Systems (ICDCS). (CCF-B)\n\n期刊：\n\n1. Qinya Li; Fan Wu; Guhai Chen; An Efficient, Fair, and Robust Image Pricing Mechanism for Crowdsourced 3D Reconstruction, IEEE Transactions on Services Computing (TSC), 2022, 15(1): 498- 512. (CCF-A)\n\n2. Qinya Li; Zun Li; Zhenzhe Zheng; Fan Wu; Shaojie Tang; Zhao Zhang; Guihai Chen ; Capitalize Your Data: Optimal Selling Mechanisms for IoT Data Exchange, IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing (TMC), 2023, 22(4): 1988-2000. (CCF-A)\n\n3. Zewei Xin, Qinya Li*, Bowen Sheng, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen; Scale-Shift Attention in Polarization Domain for Fine-Grained Classification of Satellite ISAR Images, to accepted by IEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM). (CCF-B, SCI一区Top) (通讯作者)\n\n4. Shaoting Feng, Quanquan Peng, Qinya Li*, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen; Grouping Algorithms for Optimal Configuration of Virtual Links in AFDX, to accepted by Journal of Computer Science and Technology (JCST) 2025. (CCF-B) (通讯作者)\n\n5. 李沁雅; 吴帆; 陈贵海 ; 众包全景拼接系统下基于图像质量的酬劳分配策略, 计算机学报, 2021, 44(6): 1246-1257 (CCF-A)\n\n6. Anran Xu, Zhenzhe Zheng, Qinya Li, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen. “ VAP: Online Data Valuation and Pricing for Machine Learning Models in Mobile Health”, IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing，vol.23, no.5, pp.5966-5983. (CCF-A)\n\n7. Fang Dong, Xinghua Ge, Qinya Li, Jinghui Zhang, Dian Shen, Siqi Liu, Xiao Liu, Gang Li, Fan Wu, Junzhou Luo. “PADP-FedMeta: A personalized and adaptive differentially private federated meta learning mechanism for AIoT.” Journal of Systems Architecture, vol. 134, pp.102754. (CCF-B)\n\n资助项目\n\n(1) 国家自然科学基金委员会, 青年科学基金项目, 面向三维重建的群智感知关键技术研究, 2023 至 2025, 主持\n\n(2) 科技部，国家重点研发计划，制造大数据价值理论与方法，2020至2023，子课题负责人\n\n(3) 中国航天科工二院平湖空间感知实验室，开放基金项目，主持（三期）	\N
