b1cfb3a4-3eea-4f07-9a0c-afdab18f0035	88b846b7-92a7-46fc-b1e1-029190f223aa	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dongyihong.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dongyihong.html	f48e2188260cd948a44a434844ea43d7	2026-10-22 10:36:49.642164+00	200	static	utf-8	754dfc2f7dc5f0d5ef02836f26ec4279	# 董益宏-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n董益宏\n\n助理教授\n\n邮箱：dongyh@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：先进人工智能研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=-bNMkykAAAAJ&hl=zh-CN](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=-bNMkykAAAAJ&hl=zh-CN)\n\n个人简介\n\n董益宏，上海交通大学计算机学院新入职PI，主要研究方向是智能化软件工程、大语言模型以及多智能体协同，近两年发表CCF-A类论文30余篇，其中一作论文引用2000余次，在AI4SE领域属于高被引，且多项学术成果转化为实际应用落地，提出最早的多智能体协同软件开发框架Self-collaboration。曾获通义阿里星、字节 TikTok、京东 TGT、腾讯青云、美团北斗等顶尖人才计划，以及CCF软工专委博士学位论文激励计划、北京大学优秀博士学位论文、北京大学计算机学院“学术十杰”、CCF中国科协博士青托计划、CCF青年开源专项基金种子计划、通义实验室2025年度Top30专利、ACL2026 SAC Highlight Award等10余项荣誉奖项。\n\n论文发表\n\n代表性论文（10篇）：\n\n- Self-collaboration Code Generation via ChatGPT, TOSEM 24 (CCF-A, Citation: 673, First Multi-agent Collaboration Coding Framework, Same as Long-horizon Harness Design for Claude Code in Mar 2026 (See www.anthropic.com/engineering/harness-design-long-running-apps))\n\n- Self-planning Code Generation with Large Language Model, TOSEM 24 (CCF-A, Citation: 546)\n\n- Generalization or Memorization: Data Contamination and Trustworthy Evaluation for Large Language Models, ACL 24 / TSE 26 (CCF-A, Citation: 303)\n\n- Codescore: Evaluating Code Generation by Learning Code Execution, TOSEM 25 (CCF-A, Citation: 187）\n\n- A Survey on Code Generation with LLM-based Agents, Journal of Software 26 (CCF-A, Citation: 176)\n\n- FAN: Fourier Analysis Networks, NeurIPS 25 (CCF-A, Citation: 107)\n\n- Rethinking Repetition Problems of LLMs in Code Generation, ACL 26 (CCF-A, Oral < 2.96%)\n\n- CodeRL+: Improving Code Generation via Reinforcement with Execution Semantics Alignment, ACL 26 (CCF-A, Oral < 2.7%)\n\n- RL-PLUS: Countering Capability Boundary Collapse of LLMs in Reinforcement Learning with Hybrid-policy Optimization, ACL 26 (CCF-A, VeRL Awesome Work, Tongyi Lab Top 30 Patent)\n\n- Saber: Efficient Sampling with Adaptive Acceleration and Backtracking Enhanced Remasking for Diffusion Language Model in Code Generation, ACL 26 (CCF-A, Best Paper Candidate, SAC Highlight Award < 0.5%)	\N
