2df6285d-eb8e-486a-900f-2923cb7b3b67	9859cd42-1dc9-4df0-ae8e-98d1a52fea5f	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhengzhenzhe.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhengzhenzhe.html	bb6cd44dc2e3c78553c09a41424eb5ec	2026-10-23 19:43:45.805008+00	200	static	utf-8	438a6a19cc9605f0b1a5164ab8c960bd	# 郑臻哲-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n郑臻哲\n\n教授\n\n电话：13166358184\n\n邮箱：zhengzhenzhe@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：3-509 SEIEE Building 800 Dongchuan Road\n\n所在研究所：先进网络研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://zhengzhenzhe220.github.io/](https://zhengzhenzhe220.github.io/)\n\n个人简介\n\nI am currently a professor in the School of Computer Science @ Shanghai Jiao Tong University. I was supported by NSFC Excellent Young Scholars Program. I received my Ph.D. from the CS department @ Shanghai Jiao Tong University in March 2018. My advisors were Prof. Prof. Fan Wu and Prof. Guihai Chen. I was a visiting research scholar and then a postdoctoral researcher in the Coordinated Science Laboratory (CSL) @ UIUC from September 2016 to October 2019, advised by Prof. R. Srikant. I am the recipient of the China Computer Federation (CCF) Excellent Doctoral Dissertation Award in 2018. During my Ph.D. program, I was supported by Google Ph.D. Fellowship and Microsoft Research Asia Ph.D. Fellowship.\n\nMy research interests are in the intersection of economics, learning and system. In particular, I have focused on game theory, machine learning, mobile computing and their applications for Agentic AI system, such as On-device AI Agent and Multi-agents online platform markets.\n\n教育背景\n\n- Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Mar. 2015 - Mar. 2018, Ph.D. in Computer Science\n\nCo-Advisors: Prof. Guihai Chen and Prof. Fan Wu\n\nThesis: Game Models and Mechanism Design for Mobile Internet\n\n- University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign, Sep. 2016 - Mar. 2018, Visiting Scholar in Electrical and Computer Engineering\n\nAdvisor: Prof. R. Srikant\n\nResearch Topic: Dynamic Pricing for Cloud Bandwidth Markets\n\n- Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Sep. 2012 - Mar. 2015, M.S. in Computer Science\n\nAdvisor: Prof. Fan Wu\n\nThesis: Game Theory based Resource Management in Non-Cooperative Wireless Networks\n\n- Xidian University, Sep. 2008 - June 2012, B.E. in Software Engineering\n\n工作履历\n\n- Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Aug. 2024 - Now, Professor in School of Computer Science\n\n- Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Jan. 2023 - Aug. 2024, Associate Professor in School of Computer Science\n\n- Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Jan. 2020 - Jan. 2023, Assistant Professor in School of Computer Science\n\n- University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign, Mar. 2018 - Dec. 2019, Post Doctoral in Coordinated Science Laboratory (CSL) & Electrical and Computer Engineering (ECE)\n\nAdvisor: Prof. R. Srikant\n\n教授课程\n\n- CS3333-01-博弈论\n\n- CS7333-033-M01-计算机网络\n\n论文发表\n\nC1. Chen Gong , Rui Xing, Zhenzhe Zheng#, Fan Wu “A Two-Stage Data Selection Framework for Data-Efficient Model Training on Edge Devices” in Proceedings of the 2025 ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (SIGKDD 2025), Toronto, ON, Canada Aug. 3 - Aug 7, 2025.\nC2. Qilong Lin , Yangsu Liu, Dagui Chen, Zhenzhe Zheng#, Jian Xu, Bo Zheng, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen “Robust Data-Driven Auction Design” in Proceedings of the 2025 ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (SIGKDD 2025), Toronto, ON, Canada Aug. 3 - Aug 7, 2025.\n\nC3. Haibo Liu , Da Huo , Zhenzhe Zheng#, Fan Wu “Latency-aware Online Continual Learning for Non-Stationary Data Streams” in Proceedings of the 44th IEEE International Conference on Computer Communications (IEEE INFOCOM 2025), London, United Kingdom, May 19-22, 2025.\n\nC4. Ruitao Zhu , Yangsu Liu, Dagui Chen, Zhenjia Ma, Chufeng Shi, Zhenzhe Zheng#, Jie Zhang, Jian Xu, Bo Zheng, Fan Wu “Contextual Generative Auction with Permutation-level Externalities for Online Advertising” in Proceedings of the 2025 ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (ACM SIGKDD 2025), Toronto, ON, Canada Aug. 3 - Aug 7, 2025.\n\nC5. Yan Zhuang , Zhenzhe Zheng#, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen, “LiteMoE: Customizing On-device LLM Serving via Proxy Submodel Tuning” in Proceedings of the 22nd ACM Conference on Embedded Networked Sensor Systems (ACM SenSys 2024), Hangzhou, China, Nov. 4 - 7, 2024.\n\nC6. Yumou Liu , Haoming Li , Zhenzhe Zheng#, Fan Wu, Guihai Chen, “On the Analysis of Two-Stage Stochastic Bandit” in Proceedings of the 25th International Symposium on Theory, Algorithmic Foundations, and Protocol Design for Mobile Networks and Mobile Computing (ACM MobiHoc 2024), Athens, Greece, Oct. 14 - 27, 2024.\n\nC7. Chen Gong , Zhenzhe Zheng#, Fan Wu, Xiaofeng Jia, Guihai Chen, “ A Cloud-assisted Data Enrichment Framework for On-Device Continual Learning” in Proceedings of the 30th Annual International Conference On Mobile Computing and Networking (ACM MobiCom 2024), Washington, D.C., USA, Nov. 18 - 22, 2024.\n\nC8. Haoming Li , Yusen Huo, Shuai Dou, Zhenzhe Zheng#, Zhilin Zhang, Chuan Yu, Jian Xu, Fan Wu, “Trajectory-wise Iterative Reinforcement Learning Framework for Auto-bidding”, in Proceedings of the ACM Web Conference (ACM WWW 2024), Singapore, May 13 - 17, 2024.\n\nC9. Hongtao Lv , Xiaohui Bei, Zhenzhe Zheng#, and Fan Wu, “Auction Design for Bidders with Ex Post ROI Constraints” in Proceedings of the 19th Conference on Web and Internet Economics (Springer WINE 2023), Shanghai, China, Dec. 04-08, 2023.\n\nC10. Yiqing Wang , Xiangyu Liu, Zhenzhe Zheng#, Zhilin Zhang, Miao Xu, Chuan Yu, and Fan Wu: “On Designing a Two-stage Auction for Online Advertising”, in Proceedings of The ACM Web Conference (WWW 2022), in Economics, Monetization, and Online Markets track, Lyon, France, April 25-29, 2022.\n\n资助项目\n\n主持国家自然科学基金青年/面上/优青项目\n\n科技部重点研发课题\n\n上海市浦江人才\n\n中国博士后创新人才计划项目\n\n获奖信息\n\n中国计算机学会（CCF）优秀博士论文奖；\n\n英特尔中国学术英才计划；\n\n上海市计算机学会自然科学奖一等奖（排二）；\n\n上海市科技进步一等奖（排五）\n\n学术服务\n\n上海市计算机学会普适计算与嵌入式专委会秘书长\n\n中国电子学会-物联网专委会\n\n中国自动化学会-联邦数据与联邦智能专业委员会委员，	\N
8d2e6ccc-6302-40ff-9cac-805c812dfcf0	6f148bdb-3720-41c5-ad1e-dd12efee1b36	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhouxuanhe.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhouxuanhe.html	32fa5cba708fab146cf8d8c5eb8fb4d1	2026-10-23 19:44:11.611492+00	200	static	utf-8	46383941150be428267c00d6cb54426a	# 周煊赫-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n周煊赫\n\n助理教授\n\n电话：18811522118\n\n邮箱：zhouxuanhe@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：先进网络研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://db.zhouxh.store](https://db.zhouxh.store)\n\n个人简介\n\n周煊赫，现任上海交通大学计算机学院长聘轨助理教授，上海人工智能实验室兼职助理研究员，第四范式技术顾问。主要研究Self-Improving Agent、世界行为模型（如多模态数据对齐）、Agent记忆体系统，曾获得通信学会科学技术一等奖1项、CCF-A类国际顶会论文奖2项。\n\n本人在SIGMOD、VLDB、NIPS、CVPR、ECCV、ACL、TKDE等CCF A类会议和期刊上已发表论文数十篇，包括近五年NIPS、VLDB、ICDE高被引论文，入选卡耐基梅隆大学、康奈尔大学等高校课程。谷歌学术引用量四千余次。曾获 ACM Jim Gray博士论文提名奖（大陆首位）【1】、VLDB 2023最佳工业论文亚军奖（第一作者）【2】、CCF优博、世界人工智能大会云帆奖【3】、微软学者、字节跳动奖学金、清华特奖等荣誉。代表性工作OpenMLDB已经落地第四范式先知（AIOS）平台【4】，并在金融、电商、能源等百余个真实场景中实现规模化应用。\n\n【1】[https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OsjD01C1E_-Cel3YkCpFpA](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OsjD01C1E_-Cel3YkCpFpA)\n\n【2】[https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FJWva702Q8QCjBq8gm501Q](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FJWva702Q8QCjBq8gm501Q)\n\n【3】[https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uzOpuSwU6VM4SQdgnkQSqQ](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uzOpuSwU6VM4SQdgnkQSqQ)\n\n【4】[https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UtvvnDz-C-JTkNWhfYrh9g](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UtvvnDz-C-JTkNWhfYrh9g)\n\n教授课程\n\n- 春季学期 数据结构（致远荣誉工科）；\n\n论文发表\n\nComplete List of Publications:\n\n- [Google scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=hTEZzf4AAAAJ&hl=en)\n\n- [DBLP](https://dblp.org/pid/247/8418.html)\n\n# List of Publications:\n\n- Zirui Tang, Boyu Niu, Xuanhe Zhou*, Boxiu Li, Wei Zhou, Jiannan Wang, Guoliang Li, Xinyi Zhang, Fan Wu. ST-Raptor: LLM-Powered Semi-Structured Table Question Answering. In SIGMOD, 2026.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Wei Zhou, Liguo Qi, Hao Zhang, Dihao Chen, Bingsheng He, Mian Lu, Guoliang Li, Fan Wu, Yuqiang Chen. "OpenMLDB: A Real-Time Relational Data Feature Computation System for Online ML." In SIGMOD. 2025.\n\n- Wei Zhou, Yuyang Gao, Xuanhe Zhou*, Guoliang Li. "Cracking SQL Barriers: An LLM-based Dialect Translation System." In SIGMOD, 2025.\n\n- Zhaoyan Sun, Xuanhe Zhou, Jianming Wu, Wei Zhou, Guoliang Li. "D-Bot: An LLM-Powered DBA Copilot." In SIGMOD, 2025.\n\n- Zhaoyan Sun, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li. "R-bot: An llm-based query rewrite system." In VLDB, 2024.\n\n- Yihang Zheng, Bo Li, Zhenghao Lin, Yi Luo, Xuanhe Zhou, Chen Lin, Jinsong Su, Guoliang Li, Shifu Li. "Revolutionizing Database Q&A with Large Language Models: Comprehensive Benchmark and Evaluation." In SIGKDD, 2025.\n\n- Yang Wu, Xuanhe Zhou, Xiaoguang Li, Feifei Li, Yong Zhang. "MemQ: A Graph-Based Query Memory Prediction Framework for Effective Workload Scheduling." In ICDE, 2025.\n\n- Yihang Zheng, Chen Lin, Xian Lyu, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li, Tianqing Wang. "Robustness of Updatable Learning-based Index Advisors against Poisoning Attack." In SIGMOD, 2024.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li, Zhaoyan Sun, Zhiyuan Liu, Weize Chen, Jianming Wu, Jiesi Liu, Ruohang Feng, Guoyang Zeng. "D-Bot: Database Diagnosis System using Large Language Models." In VLDB, 2024.\n\n- Wei Zhou, Chen Lin, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li. "Breaking it down: An in-depth study of index advisors." In VLDB, 2024.\n\n- Zhao, Xinyang, Xuanhe Zhou, and Guoliang Li. "Chat2data: An interactive data analysis system with rag, vector databases and llms." In VLDB, 2024.\n\n- Li, Guoliang, Xuanhe Zhou, and Xinyang Zhao. "Llm for data management." In VLDB 2024.\n\n- Wei Zhou, Chen Lin, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li. "TRAP: tailored robustness assessment for index advisors via adversarial perturbation." In ICDE, 2024.\n\n- Yang Wu, Xuanhe Zhou, Yong Zhang, Guoliang Li. "Automatic Index Tuning: A Survey." In TKDE, 2024.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li, Wei Guo, Luyang Liu. "Grep: A graph learning based database partitioning system." In SIGMOD, 2023.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Cheng Chen, Kunyi Li, Bingsheng He, Mian Lu, Qiaosheng Liu, Wei Huang, Guoliang Li, Zhao Zheng, Yuqqiang Chen. "Febench: A benchmark for real-time relational data feature extraction." In VLDB, 2023.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li, Jianming Wu, Jiesi Liu, Zhaoyan Sun, Xinning Zhang. "A learned query rewrite system." In VLDB, 2023.\n\n- Sun, Zhaoyan, Xuanhe Zhou, and Guoliang Li. "Learned index: A comprehensive experimental evaluation." In VLDB, 2023.\n\n- Yuanning Gao, Xiuqi Huang, Xuanhe Zhou, Xiaofeng Gao, Guoliang Li. "Dbaugur: An adversarial-based trend forecasting system for diversified workloads." In ICDE, 2023.\n\n- Li, Jinyang, et al. "Can LLM already serve as a database interface? a big bench for large-scale database grounded text-to-SQLs." In NeurIPS, 2023.\n\n- Zhao, Xinyang, Xuanhe Zhou, and Guoliang Li. "Automatic database knob tuning: A survey." In TKDE, 2023.\n\n- Zhou Xuanhe, Zhaoyan Sun, and Guoliang Li. "Db-gpt: Large language model meets database." In DSE, 2024.\n\n- Lixi Zhang, Chengliang Chai, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li. "Learnedsqlgen: Constraint-aware sql generation using reinforcement learning." In SIGMOD, 2022.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li, Chengliang Chai, Jianhua Feng. "A learned query rewrite system using monte carlo tree search." In VLDB, 2021.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Luyang Liu, Wenbo Li, Lianyuan Jin, Tianqing Wang, Shifu Li. "Autoindex: An incremental index management system for dynamic workloads." In ICDE, 2022.\n\n- Chen Lin, Junqing Zhuang, Jiadong Feng, Hui Li, Xuanhe Zhou, Guoliang Li. "Adaptive code learning for spark configuration tuning." In ICDE, 2022.\n\n- Li, Guoliang, and Xuanhe Zhou. "Machine learning for data management: A system view." In ICDE, 2022.\n\n- Guoliang Li, Xuanhe Zhou, Ji Sun, Xiang Yu, Yue Han, Lianyuan Jin, Wenbo Li, Tianqing Wang, Shifu Li. "opengauss: An autonomous database system." In VLDB,2021.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Lianyuan Jin, Ji Sun, Xinyang Zhao, Xiang Yu, Shifu Li, Tianqing Wang, et al. "Dbmind: A self-driving platform in opengauss." In VLDB, 2021.\n\n- Li, Guoliang, Xuanhe Zhou, and Lei Cao. "AI meets database: AI4DB and DB4AI." In SIGMOD, 2021.\n\n- Li, Guoliang, Xuanhe Zhou, and Lei Cao. "Machine learning for databases." In VLDB, 2021.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Ji Sun, Guoliang Li, Jianhua Feng. "Query performance prediction for concurrent queries using graph embedding." In VLDB, 2020.\n\n- Xuanhe Zhou, Chengliang Chai, Guoliang Li, Ji Sun. "Database meets artificial intelligence: A survey." In TKDE, 2020.\n\n- Guoliang Li, Xuanhe Zhou, Shifu Li, Bo Gao. "Qtune: A query-aware database tuning system with deep reinforcement learning." In VLDB, 2019.\n\n资助项目\n\n主持\n\n- 国家自然科学基金青年项目(2026-2028)\n\n- 蚂蚁（2026）：面向智能体多轮交互轨迹数据的合成方法\n\n- 华为（2026）：LLM 驱动的端侧用户数据模拟生成技术\n\n- 电信（2026）：智融大数据增强引擎\n\n- CCF-华为胡杨林基金项目(2025-2026)：查询资源预估和智能任务调度\n\n- CCF-腾讯犀牛鸟基金项目(2025-2026)：LLM 赋能的智能数据系统\n\n- 字节跳动基金项目(2025-2026)：大模型方言转换\n\n- 字节跳动基金项目(2025-2026)：大模型驱动的系统运维\n\n获奖信息\n\n- 2025 - ACM Jim Gray Dissertation Honorable Mention Award (中国大陆首位)\n\n- 2025 - 世界人工智能大会云帆奖\n\n- 2024 - CCF Doctoral Dissertation Award (CCF 优博，全国十位)\n\n- 2023 - VLDB Best Industry Paper RunnerUp Award (第一作者)\n\n- 2023 - Top 100 Open Source Achievements by Benchcouncil (第一作者)\n\n- 2022 - Outstanding Scholarship of Tsinghua University (清华特奖，清华最高学生荣誉)\n\n- 2022 - ByteDance Fellowship (全国十位)\n\n- 2022 - MSRA Fellowship (亚洲十二位)\n\n- 2021 - Zhongshimo Fellowship (钟士模奖学金，清华计算机最高学生荣誉)\n\n- 2021 - Apple Scholars in AI/ML Nomination\n\n学术服务\n\nJournals - TKDE, VLDB Journal, ACM CSUR, Transactions on Computers, Journal of Big Data	\N
