d Topics on Internet of Things (in English), Fall, 2023, for postgraudate students\n\n- Computer Networking, Fall, 2024, for UG students in Ziyuan School\n\n- Advanced Topics on Internet of Things (in English), Fall, 2023, for postgraudate students\n\n- Computer Networking, Fall, 2023, for UG students in Ziyuan School\n\n- Advanced Topics on Internet of Things (in English), Fall, 2023, for postgraudate students\n\n- Computer Networking, Fall, 2022, for UG students in Ziyuan School\n\n- Advanced Topics on Internet of Things (in English), Fall, 2022, for postgraudate students\n\n- Computer Networking, Fall, 2021, for UG students in Ziyuan School\n\n- Advanced Topics on Internet of Things (in English), Fall, 2021, for postgraudate students\n\n- Computer Networking, Fall, 2020, for UG students in Ziyuan School\n\n论文发表\n\n# Complete List of Publications:\n\n- [Google scholar](http://scholar.google.com/citations?user=onGydcgAAAAJ&hl=en)\n\n- [DBLP](https://dblp.org/pid/25/8709-6.html)\n\n# Journal Papers:\n\n- Li Lu, Jiadi Yu, Yingying Chen, and Yanmin Zhu, “An Indirect Eavesdropping Attack of Keystrokes on Touch Screen through Acoustic Sensing,” IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing (IEEE TMC), vol. 20, no. 2, pp. 337-351, February, 2021.\n\n- Tianzi Zang, Yanmin Zhu, Yanan Xu, and Jiadi Yu, “Jointly Modeling Spatio-Temporal Dependencies and Daily Flow Correlations for Crowd Flow Prediction,” ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (ACM TKDD), vol. 15, no. 4, pp. 1-20, March, 2021.\n\n- Tianchen Ding, Shiyou Qian, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Yanmin Zhu, Jiadi Yu, and Minglu Li, “MO-Tree: An Efficient Forwarding Engine for Spatiotemporal-aware Pub/Sub Systems,” IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems (IEEE TPDS), vol. 32, no. 4, pp. 855 - 866, April 1, 2021.\n\n- Ruobing Jiang, Zhenni Feng, Desheng Zhang, Shuai Wang, Yanmin Zhu, Fan Zhang, and Tian He, “Data-Driven Digital Advertising with Uncertain Demand Model in Metro Networks,” IEEE Transactions on