347dbb57-c17d-4d05-822d-13973ce411ea	d8304309-2c2e-4552-a84e-8dfcbc75c84b	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/luoyuan.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/luoyuan.html	61054d14f53f6e68e1d7ccadca77dc7a	2026-10-23 19:46:09.031161+00	200	static	utf-8	81e4114f79f2e775831692a36f648c7a	# 骆源-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n骆源\n\n长聘教授\n\n邮箱：yuanluo@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：信息安全与密码学研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n骆源，上海交通大学计算机学院长聘教授，学院下属计算机系主任，上海交通大学区块链研究中心副主任。科技部区块链重点研发计划首席科学家， 国家网信办网信优秀人才，负责科技部区块链重点研发计划1项，国家自然科学基金7项，上海市科技创新行动计划1项，及其他项目十余项。1999年获得南开大学数学系概率统计专业博士学位，中国科学院系统所和德国杜伊斯堡埃森大学博士后。2003年入职上海交通大学。研究方向为信息论、信息安全和区块链技术，在IEEE TIT TIFS TWC JSAC等国际重要刊物发表学术论文150余篇。其中2026年在ASE国际会议上，获ACM杰出论文奖，2025年获中国电子学会信息论分会学术激励计划。\n\n论文发表\n\n2026年发表的部分论文：\n\n- 陈一齐、董晨、骆源，编码器带有因果状态信息的任意变化窃听信道上的强保密通信，通信学报，vol. 47, no. 4, pp. 1-12，2026.\n\n- F. Xia, Q. Zhang, C. Ying, H. Zhu, S. Wang, Y. Luo, P. Ma, Y. Du, KQFuzz: Knowledge-Guided Fuzzing for Quantum Libraries via Large Language Models, The 41st IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE2026, 12-16 October 2026 Munich, Germany. ACM SIGSOFT Distinguished Paper Award. CCF A\n\n- Tinghan Wang, Chenghao Ying, Jia Wang, Yuan Luo, Security Problem in Cluster Distributed Storage Systems: Regenerating Code Against Two General Types of Active Adversaries, IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, vol. 21, pp. 6200-6215, July, 2026. CCF A\n\n- Wei Chen, Chenhao Ying, Yibin Xu, Senjian Zhang, Haiming Jin, Xikun Jiang, Jie Li, Yuan Luo, FedAegis: Secure and Credible Federated Learning with zk-SNARKs on Sharded Blockchains, IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing, TMC-2026-02-0660 , Minor Revision. CCF A\n\n- Fuyuan Xia, Chenhao Ying , Xikun Jiang, Weiting Zhang, Haiming Jin, Jie Li, Yuan Luo, FedNereus: Incentive-Aware Heterogeneous Federated Learning under Resource Constraint, IEEE Transactions on Computers, DOI: 10.1109/TC.2026.3713425 Accepted on July 5, 2026, CCF A\n\n- Zhiyuan Peng, Wei Tao, Xin Yin, Chenhao Ying, Yuan Luo, Yiwen Guo, Making LLM-Generated GUI Code Playable: From Evaluation to Refinement, ACM International Conference on the Foundations of Software Engineering (FSE2026), July 5-9, 2026, Montreal, Canada. CCF A\n\n- B. Xie, S. Zhang, Z. Peng, W. Chen, X. Yin, C. Ying, Y. Luo , ArkEval: Benchmarking and Evaluating Automated Code Repair for ArkTS, The 41st IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE2026, 12-16 October 2026 Munich, Germany. CCF A\n\n- Chen Dong, Bowei Cheng, Chenhao Ying, Yuan Luo, Covert AirComp-Enabled Federated Edge Learning via Artificial Noise, 2026 IEEE International Symposium on Information Theory (ISIT), June 28 – July 3, Guangzhou, China.\n\n- Tinghan Wang, Chenhao Ying, Yuan Luo, On the Resiliency Capacity of Cluster Distributed Storage Systems with Separate Nodes Against Active Adversaries, The 8th International Conference on Science of Cyber Security (SciSec 2026), Beijing, May 29-31 2026.\n\n- Khushal Haider Syed, Ruben Poghosyan, Hongjian Shi, Ruhui Ma, Yuan Luo, Ejafa Bassam, Ziang Zhou, Zhongle Qu, and Haibing Guan, DecentFL: A Decentralized Federated Learning System with Multiple Aggregators and Evaluators, accepted by IEEE Internet of Things Journal, July 3 2026, CCF C, DOI: 10.1109/JIOT.2026.3710438.\n\n2025年发表的论文：其中CCF A类论文10篇，B类论文5篇\n\n- 应臣浩、郭尚坤、骆源、李颉、斯雪明，“区块链与人工智能融合应用研究” ，《中国互联网3.0发展报告（2024）》，Annual report on development of WEB 3.0 in China (2024)，潘妍主编，社会科学文献出版社，Social Sciences Academic Press (China)，2025年1月出版。ISBN 9787522845920\n\n- 董晨、代彬、陈一齐、骆源，2025年度信息