fcef2ef6-ffde-4bea-a920-c74dffb2e1f7	843174ea-974a-41a7-b4a5-c489fab4cd2a	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/caopei.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/caopei.html	86685a78a31fed371533b11b69d25228	2026-10-23 19:46:42.664375+00	200	static	utf-8	2760dd3e9390decca83712254ea95904	# 曹培-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n曹培\n\n助理研究员\n\n邮箱：loccs_cp@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：信息安全与密码学研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n研究聚焦于密码工程、AI安全、侧信道分析与防护等方向，提出一系列针对实际密码系统（如USIM卡、专用密码芯片、低功耗蓝牙）的侧信道分析方法和检测方法。近五年在TCHES、TIFS、DAC、ESORICS、JCST、TVLSI等密码工程领域的重要会议和期刊发表论文10余篇；主导研发了侧信道分析软件工具SCAnalyzer pro；主导研制了MCU信息泄漏采集设备、多协议采集设备等；主导了国际NIST轻量级密码算法软硬件实现的侧信道测评工作；作为核心成员主持或参与国家自然科学基金青年项目（C类）、国自然面上项目、国网科技项目等重点项目。获上海市技术发明奖一等奖、上海交通大学科研成果奖二等奖等。\n\n欢迎感兴趣的老师和同学们联系交流！\n\n教授课程\n\n本-(2026-2027-1)-NIS3605-01-密码工程实践\n\n论文发表\n\n[1] Cao P, Zhang H, Gu D, et al. AL-PA: cross-device profiled side-channel attack using adversarial learning[C]//Proceedings of the 59th ACM/IEEE Design Automation Conference. 2022: 691-696. （CCF-A, EDA顶会）\n\n[2] Cao P, Zhang C, Lu X, et al. Improving deep learning based second-order side-channel analysis with bilinear CNN[J]. IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, 2022, 17: 3863-3876. （CCF-A, 信息安全领域顶刊）\n\n[3] Cao P, Zhang C, Lu X, et al. Cross-device profiled side-channel attack with unsupervised domain adaptation[J]. IACR Transactions on Cryptographic Hardware and Embedded Systems, 2021: 27-56.（CCF-B, 密码工程领域顶会）\n\n[4] Cao P, Zhang C, Lu X J, et al. Side-channel analysis for the re-keying protocol of bluetooth low energy[J]. Journal of Computer Science and Technology, 2023, 38(5): 1132-1148. （CCF-B）\n[5] Yu J, Wang Y, Cao P, et al. TAME: A Deep Learning-based Blind Side-Channel Analysis Framework[J]. IACR Transactions on Cryptographic Hardware and Embedded Systems, 2026, 2026(4): 632-655.（CCF-B, 密码工程领域顶会）\n[6] An Z, Zhang C, Zhao Y, et al. MixPincer: A Discrepancy-Based Adversarial Learning Framework for Cross-Device Profiled Side-Channel Analysis[C]. European Symposium on Research in Computer Security (ESORICS), 2026. (CCF-B)\n\n[7] Wang Y, Yu J, Cao P, et al. CAPE: Cross-Block Deep Learning Framework for Non-Profiled Side-Channel Analysis[C]. European Symposium on Research in Computer Security (ESORICS), 2026. (CCF-B)\n\n[8] Zhang N, Wang T, Chen C, et al. A Holistic PS-PL-AIE Co-Design for ML-KEM and ML-DSA on Versal AI Platforms[C]. The 28th International Conference on Information and Communications Security (ICICS), 2026. (CCF-C)\n[9] Wang X, Cao P, Zhang C, Gu D and Ji J. PIPE-SCD: Pipeline-Aware Side-Channel Disassembly of Multi-Instruction Power Traces[C]. The 28th International Conference on Information and Communications Security (ICICS), 2026. (CCF-C)\n[10] Yu J, Wang Y, Qu S, et al. Efficient End-to-End Non-Profiled Side-Channel Analysis on Long Raw Traces[C]. European Symposium on Research in Computer Security (ESORICS), 2025. (CCF-B)\n\n[11] Wang T, Zhang C, Zhang X, et al. Optimized Hardware-Software Co-Design for Kyber and Dilithium on RISC-V SoC FPGA[J]. IACR Transactions on Cryptographic Hardware and Embedded Systems, 2024, 2024(3): 99-135. （CCF-B, 密码工程领域顶会）\n\n[12] Zhang C, Lu X, Cao P, et al. A nonprofiled side-channel analysis based on variational lower bound related to mutual information[J]. Science China Information Sciences, 2023, 66(1): 112302. （CCF-A）\n\n[13] Lu X, Zhang C, Cao P, et al. Pay attention to raw traces: A deep learning architecture for end-to-end profiling attacks[J]. IACR Transactions on Cryptographic Hardware and Embedded Systems, 2021: 235-274. （CCF-B, 密码工程领域顶会）\n\n[14] Wang T, Zhang C, Cao P, et al. Efficient implementation of dilithium signature scheme on FPGA SoC platform[J]. IEEE Transactions on Very Large Scale Integration (VLSI) Systems, 2022, 30(9): 1158-1171. （CCF-B）\n\n获奖信息\n\n2023上海市技术发明奖一等奖；\n\n2023上海交通大学科研成果奖二等奖；\n\nSAFE 2023 Best Paper Award；\n\nSAFE 2026 Best Paper Award；\n\nopenHiTLS 2025 协作先锋奖\n\n学术服务\n\nNIST 轻量级密码算法侧信道安全国际评估团队成员；\n\nCHES、TIFS、TDSC等密码工程领域会议和期刊审稿人；\n\nOpenHiTLS密码开源社区委员会委员	\N
