rection. In: Proceedings of the 62nd Design Automation Conference (DAC 2025), June 22-25, 2025, San Francisco, USA.\n\n23.[DAC'25] Yunfei Gu, Yixuan Liu, Xinyuan Wu, Bo Shao, Chentao Wu, Shiyi Li, Jieru Zhao, Jie Li, Minyi Guo, Kunlin Yang, Wengui Zhang, and Feilong Lin. MemSeer: Leveraging Memory Failure Distinctions and Multi-Grained Prediction in Ultra-Scale Heterogeneous X86/ARM Clusters. In: Proceedings of the 62nd Design Automation Conference (DAC 2025), June 22-25, 2025, San Francisco, USA.\n\n24.[DAC'25] Chenqi Zhang, Yu Feng, Jieru Zhao, Guangda Liu, Wenchao Ding, Chentao Wu, and Minyi Guo. StreamingGS: Voxel-Based Streaming 3D Gaussian Splatting with Memory Optimization and Architectural Support. In: Proceedings of the 62nd Design Automation Conference (DAC 2025), June 22-25, 2025, San Francisco, USA.\n\n25.[HPCA'25] Zixiao Chen, Chentao Wu, Yunfei Gu, Ranhao Jia, Jie Li and Minyi Guo. Gaze into the Pattern: Characterizing Spatial Patterns with Internal Temporal Correlations for Hardware Prefetching. In: Proceedings of the 31st IEEE International Symposium on High-Performance Computer Architecture (HPCA 2025), March 1-5, 2025, Las Vegas, USA.\n\n26.[ATC'24] Yunfei Gu, Chentao Wu, and Xubin He. Exploit both SMART Attributes and NAND Flash Wear Characteristics to Effectively Forecast SSD-based Storage Failures in Clusters. In: Proceedings of the 2024 USENIX Annual Technical Conference (ATC 2024), July 10-12, 2024, Santa Clara, USA.\n\n资助项目\n\n主持项目\n\n2026-2029 国家自然科学基金联合基金重点项目“面向云网融合应用的网络编码关键技术研究”\n\n2023-2026 科技部国家重点研发计划项目“TB级高效安全持久内存系统的研究”\n\n2023-2025 国家级青年人才项目“高可靠非易失存储阵列的研究”\n\n2020-2023 国家自然科学基金面上项目“大规模数据中心多可用区高可靠纠删码技术的研究”\n\n2018-2021 科技部国家重点研发计划课题“自动驾驶电动汽车大数据云雾融合平台研究”\n\n2017-2018 国家自然科学基金海外与港澳学者合作项目（Co-PI）“高可靠存储系统纠删码技术的研究”\n\n2014-2016 国家自然科学基金青年项目“磁盘阵列自适应可扩展构架的研究”\n\n2014-2016 教育部留学归国人员科研基金“云存储系统可扩展技术的研究”\n\n2025-2027 上海市探索者计划“面向国产AI芯片的高性能KV Cache管理策略的研究”\n\n2018-2021 上海市自然科学基金“高可靠非易失存储阵列的研究”\n\n2013-2016 上海市自然科学基金“云存储系统能效优化方法的研究”\n\n2025-2026 华为合作项