5ae3b0f0-6423-4054-b2fc-f02a390b2aea	568bcd10-7435-4e15-96f5-f549ddf1ffd1	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenyichao.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/chenyichao.html	d34e07d057d330c09c18a4e0236d59be	2026-10-24 05:28:39.358961+00	200	static	utf-8	733467f71d2cdb6c6f95f3057d5de85e	# 陈奕超-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n陈奕超\n\n长聘教轨副教授\n\n邮箱：yichao@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：智能软件与系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n陈奕超，上海交通大学计算机学院副教授、博士生导师，长期从事移动计算、无线感知、物联网安全与空间智能研究。研究聚焦空间智能在真实世界落地面临的关键挑战，包括可观测性、多用户交互、人与机器人协同安全、以及可信感知。在这些方向中，研究团队提出了可编程环境、超表面辅助感知、主动视觉、毫米波人体状态建模、静默语音交互以及具身系统安全基线等多项原创技术体系，推动智能体实现真正的"物理世界闭环"。其论文发表于 MobiCom、MobiSys、SenSys 等国际顶级会议与期刊，并获得多项论文奖项、发明奖和教学奖。\n\n个人主页：[https://yichao0319.github.io/](https://yichao0319.github.io/)\n\nYi-Chao Chen is an Associate Professor at Shanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU). His research focuses on mobile computing, wireless sensing, IoT security, and spatial intelligence. He works on core challenges that block spatial intelligence from real-world deployment, including observability, multi-user interaction, human–robot collaboration safety, and trustable sensing. His work introduces programmable environments, metasurface-assisted sensing, active vision on commodity hardware, mmWave-based human state modeling, silent-speech interaction, and trust and safety baselines for embodied systems. His publications appear in top venues such as MobiCom, MobiSys, NSDI, SenSys, INFOCOM, CCS, and Security, and he has received multiple awards for research, invention, and teaching.\n\nPersonal website: [https://yichao0319.github.io/](https://yichao0319.github.io/)\n\n教育背景\n\n- 计算机科学博士，德克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校（UT Austin），2009–2015\n\n- 計算機科學與信息工程碩士，台灣大學，2004–2006\n\n- 計算機科學與信息工程學士，台灣大學，2000–2004\n\n- Ph.D., Computer Science, The University of Texas at Austin, 2009–2015\n\n- M.S., Computer Science and Information Engineering, National Taiwan University, 2004–2006\n\n- B.S., Computer Science and Information Engineering, National Taiwan University, 2000–2004\n\n工作履历\n\n- 副教授，上海交通大学，2018–至今\n\n- 访问学者，微软亚洲研究院（上海），2023–2024\n\n- 访问学者，國立情報學研究所 (日本东京)，2024\n\n- 首席科学家，Hauoli LLC (美国德州)，2017–2018\n\n- 研究员，华为研究院（香港），2015–2017\n\n- 研究实习，AT&T Research Labs (美国新泽西)，2011\n\n- 研究助理，中央研究院 (台北)，2008–2009\n\n- Associate Professor, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, 2018–present\n\n- Visiting Scholar, Microsoft Research Asia (Shanghai), 2023–2024\n\n- Visiting Scholar, National Institute of Informatics (Tokyo, Japan), 2024\n\n- Chief Scientist, Hauoli LLC (Texas, USA), 2017–2018\n\n- Researcher, Huawei Research (Hong Kong), 2015–2017\n\n- Research Intern, AT&T Research Labs (New Jersey, USA), 2011\n\n- Research Assistant, Academia Sinica (Taipei, Taiwan), 2008–2009\n\n教授课程\n\n-《计算机网络》，本科生课程，2018–至今\n\n-《移动感知与计算》，研究生课程，2018–至今\n\n-《物联网技术与趋势》，MEM 研究生课程，2019–至今\n\n- Computer Networks (SJTU top-tier A1 rating), 2018–present\n\n- Mobile Sensing and Computing (SJTU top-tier A0 rating), 2018–present\n\n- Technologies and Trends of IoT (SJTU MEM Program, Outstanding Teaching Award), 2019–present\n\n论文发表\n\n- Runting Zhang, Yijie Li, Dian Ding, Yi-Chao Chen, Yida Wang, Dongyao Chen, Jingxian Wang, Jiadi Yu, Ling Ma, and Guangtao Xue. Bridge: Enabling BLE Direction Finding Feature Compatible with All Bluetooth Devices. ACM MobiCom 2025.\n\n- Hao Pan, Yezhou Wang, Jiting Liu, Ruichun Ma, Lili Qiu, Yi-Chao Chen, Guangtao Xue, and Ju Ren. CGMM: Non-Invasive Continuous Glucose Monitoring in Wearables Using Metasurfaces. ACM MobiCom 2025.\n\n- Yezhou Wang, Hao Pan, Yongjian Fu, Qinyun Hu, Lili Qiu, Yi-Chao Chen, Guang