2f04d7f3-584b-4e6b-9081-002d083b6fef	b02c8176-b4e4-47da-a82e-42df52b40709	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/qianshiyou.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/qianshiyou.html	536469c87bc9bac1f36cb7734b5ae3a5	2026-10-24 05:30:03.298695+00	200	static	utf-8	3a224922ecd8103dae8bb7aecb2a6730	# 钱诗友-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n钱诗友\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：qshiyou@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：智能软件与系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n博士，副研究员，博士生导师，主要研究方向包括云计算、大数据分析、推荐系统及算法。在国际学术期刊和会议上发表论文120多篇，获得授权发明专利30多项，软件著作权20多项。主持国家自然科学基金面上项目1项，重点研发子课题1项，中交水运、华为、阿里巴巴、淘宝等校企合作项目10余项。获得省部级及行业协会科技进步奖10余项。\n\n教育背景\n\n（1） 2010.09 - 2015.06 上海交通大学，计算机科学与技术，博士\n\n（2） 2004.09 - 2007.07 中国矿业大学，计算机应用技术，硕士\n\n工作履历\n\n（1）2019.01 至今, 上海交通大学, 计算机学院, 副研究员\n\n（2）2016.01 - 2018.12, 上海交通大学, 电子信息与电气工程学院，计算机科学与工程系, 助理研究员\n\n教授课程\n\nC++程序设计思想与方法（本科生）\n\n论文发表\n\n在国内外重要刊物和会议上发表论文120多篇，期刊包括TPDS，TC，TKDE，TON，TSC等，会议包括ASPLOS，WWW，SIGMETRICS，SIGKDD，AAAI等。近3年发表的部分论文如下：\n\n[1] Qin Hua, Dingyu Yang, Shiyou Qian*, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: Humas: A Heterogeneity- and Upgrade-Aware Microservice Auto-Scaling Framework in Large-Scale Data Centers. IEEE Trans. Computers 74(3): 968-982 (2025)\n\n[2] Zhengyu Liao, Shiyou Qian*, Zhonglong Zheng*, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: AWB+-Tree: A Novel Width-Based Index Structure Supporting Hybrid Matching for Large-Scale Content-Based Pub/Sub Systems. IEEE Trans. Parallel Distributed Syst. 36(6): 1268-1281 (2025)\n\n[3] Jiaang Duan, Shiyou Qian*, Hanwen Hu, Dingyu Yang, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: PipeCo: Pipelining Cold Start of Deep Learning Inference Services on Serverless Platforms. SIGMETRICS (Abstracts) 2025: 151-153\n\n[4] Hanwen Hu, Cheng Zeng, Shiyou Qian*, Jianhua Zhou, Jian Cao, Yirong Chen, Jie Wang, Han Han: MPF: A Multi-Noise Perception Framework to Enhance Online Map Matching Algorithms. IEEE Trans. Intell. Transp. Syst. 26(4): 4633-4646 (2025)\n\n[5] Hanwen Hu, Shiyou Qian*, Dingyu Yang, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: Iterative Time Series Imputation by Maintaining Dependency Consistency. ACM Trans. Knowl. Discov. Data 19(1): 6:1-6:24 (2025)\n\n[6] Hanwen Hu, Zhangchi Han, Shiyou Qian*, Dingyu Yang, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: Pattern-oriented Attention Mechanism for Multivariate Time Series Forecasting. ACM Trans. Knowl. Discov. Data 19(2): 38:1-38:26 (2025)\n\n[7] Haiyang Ren, Shiyou Qian*, Zhonglong Zheng*, Jiange Zhang, Zhengyu Liao, Hanwen Hu, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: EPC: An ensemble packet classification framework for efficient and stable performance. Comput. Networks 265: 111306 (2025)\n\n[8] Yongpeng Dong, Shiyou Qian*, Tianchen Ding, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: Proactive event matching with predictive analysis in content-based publish/subscribe systems. Inf. Syst. 129: 102508 (2025)\n\n[9] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Haiyan Zhao, Yang Gu, Shiyou Qian: Survey and Benchmark of Anomaly Detection in Business Processes. IEEE Trans. Knowl. Data Eng. 37(1): 493-512 (2025)\n\n[10] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Jianqi Gao, Haiyan Zhao, Shiyou Qian: DABL: Detecting Semantic Anomalies in Business Processes Using Large Language Models. AAAI 2025: 11735-11744\n\n[11] Yang Gu, Jian Cao*, Hengyu You, Nengjun Zhu, Shiyou Qian: ADELA: Accelerating Evolutionary Design of Machine Learning Pipelines with the Accompanying Surrogate Model. AAAI 2025: 16915-16923\n\n[12] Qiqi Cai, Jian Cao*, Yirong Chen, Shiyou Qian, Liangxiao Yuan, Jie Wang: PREFER: A Pre-trained Model Recommendation Framework for Edge Computing Enabled Traffic Flow Prediction. ACM Trans. Knowl. Discov. Data 19(2): 30:1-30:26 (2025)\n\n[13] Zhengyu Liao, Shiyou Qian*, Zhonglong Zheng*, Jiange Zhang, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: PT-Tree: A Cascading Prefix Tuple Tree for Packet Classification in Dynamic Scenarios. IEEE/ACM Trans. Netw. 32(1): 506-519 (2024)\n\n[14] Zhengyu Liao, Shiyou Qian*, Zhonglong Zheng*, Jiange Zhang, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li: DBTable: Leveraging Discriminative Bitsets for High-Performance Packet Classification. IEEE/ACM Trans. Netw. 32(6): 5232-5246 (2024)\n\n[15] Yongpeng Dong, Shiyou Qian*, Wanghua Shi, Junshen Li, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: OEM: An operation-aware event matching algorithm for content-based Pub/Sub systems. Comput. Networks 250: 110561 (2024)\n\n[16] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Haiyan Zhao, Yang Gu, Shiyou Qian: WAKE: A Weakly Supervised Business Process Anomaly Detection Framework via a Pre-Trained Autoencoder. IEEE Trans. Knowl. Data Eng. 36(6): 2745-2758 (2024)\n\n[17] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Yang Gu, Shiyou Qian: GAMA: A multi-graph-based anomaly detection framework for business processes via graph neural networks. Inf. Syst. 124: 102405 (2024)\n\n[18] Yang Gu, Jian Cao*, Shiyou Qian, Nengjun Zhu, Wei Guan: ProSwats: A Proxy-based Scientific Workflow Retrieval Approach by Bridging the Gap between Textual and Structural Semantics. ICWS 2024: 932-943\n\n[19] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Yan Yao, Yang Gu, Shiyou Qian: COMB: Interconnected Transformers-Based Autoencoder for Multi-Perspective Business Process Anomaly Detection. ICWS 2024: 1115-1124\n\n[20] Qin Hua, Dingyu Yang, Shiyou Qian*, Hanwen Hu, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: KAE-Informer: A Knowledge Auto-Embedding Informer for Forecasting Long-Term Workloads of Microservices. WWW 2023: 1551-1561\n\n[21] Hanwen Hu, Shiyou Qian*, Jingchao Ouyang, Jian Cao, Han Han, Jie Wang, Yirong Chen: AMM: An Adaptive Online Map Matching Algorithm. IEEE Trans. Intell. Transp. Syst. 24(5): 5039-5051 (2023)\n\n[22] Yongpeng Dong, Shiyou Qian*, Wanghua Shi, Jian Cao, Guangtao Xue: EEM: An elastic event matching framework for content-based publish/subscribe systems. Comput. Networks 232: 109837 (2023)\n\n[23] Qin Hua, Hanwen Hu, Shiyou Qian*, Dingyu Yang, Jian Cao: Bi-GAE: A Bidirectional Generative Auto-Encoder. J. Comput. Sci. Technol. 38(3): 626-643 (2023)\n\n[24] Yang Gu, Jian Cao*, Shiyou Qian and Wei Guan, SWORTS: A Scientific Workflow Retrieval Approach by Learning Textual and Structural Semantics, IEEE Transactions on Services Computing, 2023, 4205-4219\n\n[25] Jian Cao*, Naixuan Wang, Shiyou Qian, Wei Guan: When to Invoke a Prediction Service for Business Process Monitoring? IEEE Trans. Serv. Comput. 16(4): 3061-3074 (2023)\n\n[26] Wei Guan, Jian Cao*, Yang Gu, Shiyou Qian: GRASPED: A GRU-AE Network Based Multi-Perspective Business Process Anomaly Detection Model. IEEE Trans. Serv. Comput. 16(5): 3412-3424 (2023)\n\n[27] Bohan Jia, Jian Cao*, Shiyou Qian, Nengjun Zhu, Xin Dong, Liang Zhang, Lei Cheng, Linjian Mo: SMONE: A Session-based Recommendation Model Based on Neighbor Sessions with Similar Probabilistic Intentions. ACM Trans. Knowl. Discov. Data 17(8): 111:1-111:22 (2023)\n\n[28] Yang Gu, Jian Cao*, Jinghua Tang, Shiyou Qian, Wei Guan，SWARM: A Scientific Workflow Fragments Recommendation Approach via Contrastive Learning and Semantic Matching, The 21st International Conference on Service-Oriented Computing (ICSOC2023)，Vol. 14419 Part II: 54-71\n\n[29] Jian Cao*, Chi Wang, Wei Guan, Shiyou Qian, Haiyan Zhao， Remaining Time Prediction for Collaborative Business Processes with Privacy Preservation, The 21st International Conference on Service-Oriented Computing (ICSOC2023)，Vol. 14419 Part II: 38-53\n\n[30] Yang Gu, Jian Cao*, Yuan Guo, Shiyou Qian, Wei Guan，Plan, Generate and Match: Scientific Workflow Recommendation with Large Language Models, The 21st International Conference on Service-Oriented Computing (ICSOC2023)，Vol. 14419 Part I: 86-102\n\n资助项目\n\n主持完成：\n\n国家自然科学基金项目1项\n\n国家重点研发计划子课题1项\n\n中交、华为、阿里等横向课题10余项\n\n参与完成：\n\n国家自然科学基金重点项目2项，国家863计划课题3项，上海市科委重大项目2项等\n\n获奖信息\n\n上海市技术发明一等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n上海市科技进步二等奖2项（主要完成人）\n\n华为火花奖2项\n\n港口行业科技进步一等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n上海市计算机学会技术发明一等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n中国水运建设行业协会科学技术奖一等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n中国施工协会科学技术进步二等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n上海勘察设计优秀项目计算机类二等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n上海交通大学科研成果二等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n上海产学研合作优秀项目奖三等奖1项（主要完成人）\n\n学术服务\n\nCCF、ACM、IEEE会员	\N
