e Speech Emotion Recognition in IoT Environments With Mel Feature Compression," IEEE Internet of Things Journal, 2025.\n\n[4] Tang Jinghua, Fang Nan, Yang Lanqing, Pei Yuqiao, Wang Ran, Ding Dian, Lu Yu, Xue Guangtao. "CarbonNet: Enterprise-Level Carbon Emission Prediction with Large-Scale Datasets," International Conference on Intelligent Computing, pp. 411-422, 2024.\n\n[5] Tang Jinghua, Zhang Liyun, Lu Yu, Ding Dian, Yang Lanqing, Chen YiChao, Bian Minjie, Li Xiaoshan, Xue Guangtao. "VCEMO: Multi-Modal Emotion Recognition for Chinese Voiceprints," arXiv preprint arXiv:2408.13019, 2024.\n\n[6] Fu Yongjian, Yang Lanqing, Pan Hao, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao, Ren Ju. "Magspy: Revealing user privacy leakage via magnetometer on mobile devices," IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing, 2024.\n\n[7] Yang Lanqing, Chen Xinqi, Jian Xiangyong, Yang Leping, Li Yijie, Ren Qianfei, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao, Ji Xiaoyu. "Remote attacks on speech recognition systems using sound from power supply," 32nd USENIX Security Symposium (USENIX Security 23), pp. 4571-4588, 2023.\n\n[8] Zhang Yongzhao, Wang Yezhou, Yang Lanqing, Wang Mei, Chen Yi-Chao, Qiu Lili, Liu Yihong, Xue Guangtao, Yu Jiadi. "Acoustic sensing and communication using metasurface," 20th USENIX Symposium on Networked Systems Design and Implementation (NSDI 23), pp. 1359-1374, 2023.\n\n[9] Jian Xiangyong, Yang Lanqing, Li Yijie, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao. "SingMonitor: E-bike Charging Health Monitoring Using Sound from Power Supplies," Applied Sciences, Vol. 13, No. 5, pp. 3087, 2023.\n\n[10] Li Yijie, Tong Xiatong, Ren Qianfei, Li Qingyang, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao, Ji Xiaoyu, Yu Jiadi. "AUDIOSENSE: Leveraging Current to Acoustic Channel to Detect Appliances at Single-Point," 2023 20th Annual IEEE International Conference on Sensing, Communication, and Networking (SECON), pp. 240-248, 2023.\n\n[11] Ding Dian, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao. "Handwriting recognition system leveraging vibration signal on smartphones," IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing, Vol. 22, No. 7, pp. 3940-3951, 2022.\n\n[12] Xue Guangtao, Li Yijie, Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Ji Xiaoyu, Yu Jiadi. "ScreenID: Enhancing QRCode security by utilizing screen dimming feature," IEEE/ACM Transactions on Networking, Vol. 31, No. 2, pp. 862-876, 2022.\n\n[13] Pan Hao, Tan Feitong, Li Wenhao, Chen Yi-Chao, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao, Ji Xiaoyu. "Magdefender: Detecting eavesdropping on mobile devices using the built-in magnetometer," 2022 19th Annual IEEE International Conference on Sensing, Communication, and Networking (SECON), pp. 28-36, 2022.\n\n[14] Li Yijie, Chen Yi-Chao, Ji Xiaoyu, Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao, Yu Jiadi. "Screenid: Enhancing qrcode security by fingerprinting screens," IEEE INFOCOM 2021-IEEE Conference on Computer Communications, 2021.\n\n[15] Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Li Honglu, You Chuang-Wen, Ji Xiaoyu, Chen Yi-Chao, Hu Zhenxian, Xue Guangtao. "Magthief: Stealing private app usage data on mobile devices via built-in magnetometer," 2021 18th Annual IEEE International Conference on Sensing, Communication, and Networking (SECON), 2021.\n\n[16] Ding Dian, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao. "VibWriter: handwriting recognition system based on vibration signal," 2021 18th Annual IEEE International Conference on Sensing, Communication, and Networking (SECON), 2021.\n\n[17] Ding Dian, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao. "Leakage or identification: Behavior-irrelevant user identification leveraging leakage current on laptops," Proceedings of the ACM on Interactive, Mobile, Wearable and Ubiquitous Technologies, Vol. 5, No. 4, 2021.\n\n[18] Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Pan Hao, Ding Dian, Xue Guangtao, Kong Linghe, Yu Jiadi, Li Minglu. "Magprint: Deep learning based user fingerprinting using electromagnetic signals," IEEE INFOCOM 2020-IEEE Conference on Computer Communications, pp. 696-705, 2020.\n\n[19] Yang Lanqing, Li Honglu, Chen Zhaoxi, Ji Xiaoyu, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao, You Chuang-Wen. "Appliance fingerprinting using sound from power supply," Adjunct Proceedings of the 2020 ACM International Joint Conference on Pervasive and Ubiquitous Computing and Proceedings of the 2020 ACM International Symposium on Wearable Computers, pp. 160-163, 2020.\n\n[20] Li Yijie, Chen Yi-Chao, Ji Xiaoyu, Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao, Yu Jiadi. "Toward a secure QR code system by fingerprinting screens," Proceedings of the 26th Annual International Conference on Mobile Computing and Networking, 2020.\n\n[21] Li Yijie, Chen Yi-Chao, Ji Xiaoyu, Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao, Yu Jiadi. "Poster: Toward a Secure QR Code System by Fingerprinting Screens," 2020.\n\n[22] Pan Hao, Yang Lanqing, Chen Yi-Chao, Xue Guangtao, You Chuang-Wen, Ji Xiaoyu, Chen Pai-Yen. "Poster: Secure Visible Light Communication based on Nonlinearity of Spatial Frequency in Light," The 25th Annual International Conference on Mobile Computing and Networking, 2019.\n\n[23] Pan Hao, Chen Yi-Chao, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao, You Chuang-Wen, Ji Xiaoyu. "mqrcode: Secure qr code using nonlinearity of spatial frequency in light," The 25th Annual International Conference on Mobile Computing and Networking, 2019.\n\n[24] Ye Qi, Yang Lanqing, Xue Guangtao. "Hand-free gesture recognition for vehicle infotainment system control," 2018 IEEE Vehicular Networking Conference (VNC), 2018.\n\n资助项目\n\n[1] 国家自然科学基金委员会，青年科学基金项目（C类）[原青年科学基金项目]，62502303，感知受限场景下面向移动物联终端的电磁感知关键技术研究，2026-01-01至2028-12-31，30万元，在研，主持\n\n[2] 上海市, 上海市2024年度“科技创新行动计划”自然科学基金面上项目, 24ZR1439100, 移动端电磁感知关键技术研究, 2024-10 至 2027-09, 20万元, 在研, 主持\n\n[3] 国家自然科学基金委员会，面上项目，82571164，基于多模态特征嵌入与融合的病损图像分析提升口腔潜在恶性疾患诊断效能的可解释性研究，2026-01-01至2029-12-31，49万元，在研，参与\n\n[4] 国家自然科学基金委员会, 面上项目, 62072306, 基于电磁辐射旁路信号的移动计算与智能感知技术研究, 2021-01-01 至 2024-12-31, 57万元, 资助期满, 参与\n\n[5] 国家自然科学基金委员会, 重点项目, 61936015, 边缘智能架构中资源优化分配关键技术研究, 2020-01-01 至 2024-12-31, 298万元, 资助期满, 参与\n\n获奖信息\n\n2021世界人工智能大会优秀论文提名奖、上海市优秀毕业生\n\n学术服务\n\n1. 中国计算机学会-物联网专委会委员\n\n2. 教育部研究生学位论文评审专家\n\n3. 担任UbiComp/ISWC 2025、ICPADS 2025、IEEE/CIC ICCC 2025领域主席\n\n4. 会议审稿人：IEEE TPAMI、TNNLS、AAAI、NIPS\n\n5. 参与起草国家标准《 物联网 470MHz/2.4GHz频段传感网通信与信息交换 第1部分：物理层要求及链路层协议》	\N
319dd51f-86d8-41c1-93e7-b060a6193f79	73e53be0-3470-4e12-8e0e-3703eb0fdaa6	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yujiadi.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yujiadi.html	2f61d949f00e55acaed46b47eaa51339	2026-10-24 05:30:42.443501+00	200	static	utf-8	0a40930552cd7a313e94718c3064f89a	# 俞嘉地-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n俞嘉地\n\n高级工程师\n\n邮箱：jiadiyu@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：电信3号楼515\n\n所在研究所：智能软件与系统研究所\n\n个人主页：[https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu)\n\n个人简介\n\n俞嘉地，博士生导师，主要研究兴趣包括物联网、移动感知计算、移动安全等。\n\n工作履历\n\n2007年7月毕业与上海交通大学计算机系，并获工学博士学位。随后进入上海交通大学电子工程系博士后流动站。从2009年1月至2011年8月，在美国Stevens Institute of Technology从事博士后研究工作。2011年底回国后加入上海交通大学计算机系工作至今。\n\n教授课程\n\n"软件工程“ （本科生）\n\n”物联网导论“ （研究生）\n\n论文发表\n\n发表学术论文近100余篇，并在Springer出版社出版外文专著三部。发表中国计算机协会（CCF）推荐A 类论文50余篇，IEEE Transactions 论文40余篇，中科院第一/二区SCI 期刊论文30 余篇。发表论文于国内外高水平学术期刊与国际会议，例如IEEE Communications Surveys and Tutorial (IEEE COMST)、IEEE/ACM Trans. on Networking (ToN)、IEEE Trans. on Mobile Computing (TMC) 、IEEE Trans. on Information Forensics and Security(TIFS)、计算机学报、ACM MobiCom、ACM UbiComp、ACM MobiSys、IEEE InfoCom 等。\n\n获得ACM MobiCom 2019/2022最佳海报奖（Best Poster Award）， IEEE ICPADS 2019最佳学生论文奖（Best Student Paper Award）, IEEE BigData 2022最佳学生论文奖（Best Student Paper Award）, 以及2022年上海计算机学会普适计算与嵌入式最佳论文奖。\n\n论文列表见：https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu\n\n资助项目\n\n作为项目负责人主持了国家自然基金面上项目、国家自然基金重点国际合作研究项目子课题，及国家重点研发项目子课题。\n\n详见：https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu\n\n获奖信息\n\n作为第一完成人获得2023年CCF科技创新大赛一等奖，及2023年中国发明协会发明创新二等奖；作为主要完成人获得两次上海市科技进步二等奖（2016、2018），一次上海自然科学二等奖（2020），中国产学研合作创新成果奖（2022），以及上海市计算机学会自然科学一等奖（2024）。\n\n详见：https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu\n\n学术服务\n\nCCF/IEEE 高级会员;\n\n中国计算机学会物联网、普适技术专委会执行委员;\n\nACM China SigBed专委会委员.\n\n详见：https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~jdyu	\N
435db8f8-d82c-4b4d-98d1-b9f4b916e90d	d0cecaed-710b-4fe3-86c8-43e19c257220	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangyiming.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangyiming.html	ab96ca305408c4d2d9c8521f42a8ab4e	2026-10-24 05:30:53.891326+00	200	static	utf-8	09de5ca210bc15b6428fdbf862355961	# 张一鸣-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n张一鸣\n\n特聘教授\n\n邮箱：zhangyiming@cs.sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：智能软件与系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\nDr. Yiming Zhang's research is focused on operating, networking, storage, and AI systems. As the first/corresponding author, he has published more than 50 highly-influential papers in top conferences including SIGCOMM, NSDI, and FAST, and famous Journals like TOCS, TOS and TON. He is an associate editor of IEEE Transactions on Computers and IEEE Transactions on Services Computing, and a member of 2022 EuroSys Roger Needham Award Committee. He has received the Best Paper Award of USENIX FAST'23, the National Science and Technology Award (2nd prize), the Natural Science Award of Hunan province (1st prize), and the (top 10) Outstanding Dissertation Award. As the team leader, he won the CCF Award of Science and Technology (1st prize) in 2021.\n\n论文发表\n\nRecent Conferences\n\n1. Yan Chen, Xinyi Yu, Shengyun Liu, Ruofan Xiong, Tianjing Xu, Yongwei Wu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). Integrating 2PC with Consensus for Fast Replication. ACM SIGCOMM 2026.\n\n2. Erci Xu, Hongliang Tian, Xinyi Yu, Lujia Yin, Xinyuan Luo, Shaowei Song, Qingsong Chen, Shoumeng Yan, Jiwu Shu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). MlsDisk: Trusted Block Storage for TEEs Based on Layered Secure Logging. USENIX FAST 2026.\n\n3. Shi Qiu, Li Wang, Jianqin Yan, Ruofan Xiong, Yingruo Jiang, Xin Yao, Gong Zhang, Jiwu Shu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). RosenBridge: A Framework for Enabling Express I/O Paths Across the Virtualization Boundary. USENIX FAST 2026.\n\n4. Zhihao Zhang, Huiba Li, Lu Tang, Jiwu Shu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). SkySync: Accelerating File Synchronization with Collaborative Delta Generation. USENIX FAST 2026.\n\n5. Zhihao Zhang, Lu Tang, Huiba Li, Yue Yu, Jiwu Shu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). ParaSync: Exploiting Fine-Grained Parallelism for Efficient File Synchronization. USENIX FAST 2026.\n\n6. Xinyi Yu, Yingqiang Zhang, Hao Chen, Zhaoxiang Huang, Xinjun Yang, Feifei Li, Chuan Sun, Jing Geng, Jiong Xie, Ninglong Weng, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). LakeMem: An Elastic Disaggregated-Memory Caching Layer for Analytical Processing Systems. ACM SIGMOD 2026.\n\n7. Zhihao Zhang, Lanzhen Liu, Chen Chen, Huiba Li, Windsor Hsu, Yiming Zhang (Co- primary). PlanB: Efficient Software IPv6 Lookup with Linearized B+-Tree. USENIX NSDI 2026.\n\n8. Xiangyu Liu, Huiba Li, Shun Gai, Rui Du, Youmin Chen, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). zBuffer: Zero-Copy and Metadata-Free Serialization for Fast RPC with Scatter-Gather Reflection. ACM PPoPP 2026.\n\n9. Jianqin Yan, Shi Qiu, Yina Lv, Hao Chen, Zhirong Shen, Xin Yao, Renhai Chen, Jiwu Shu, Gong Zhang, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). Phoenix: A Refactored I/O Stack for GPU Direct Storage without Phony Buffers. ACM SC 2025.\n\n10. Shi Qiu, Weinan Liu, Yifan Hu, Jianqin Yan, Zhirong Shen, Xin Yao, Renhai Chen, Gong Zhang, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). GeminiFS: A Companion File System for GPUs. USENIX FAST 2025.\n\n11. Hongliang Tian, Xinyi Yu, Weijie Liu, Shaowei Song, Zhihao Zhang, Shiyu Wang, Qingsong Chen, Erci Xu, Shoumeng Yan, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). AtomicDisk: A Secure Virtual Disk for TEEs against Eviction Attacks. USENIX FAST 2025.\n\n12. Tianjing Xu, Yongqi Zhong, Yiming Zhang (Co-primary), Ruofan Xiong, Jingjing Zhang, Guangtao Xue, Shengyun Liu. Vegeta: Parallel Smart Contract Execution for Leaderless Blockchain. USENIX NSDI 2025.\n\n13. Yiming Zhang, Li Wang, Shengyun Liu, Shun Gai, Haonan Wang, Kai Chen, Dongsheng Li, Jiwu Shu. Cheetah: Metadata Aggregation for Fast Object Storage without Distributed Ordering. ACM EuroSys 2025.\n\n14. Shi Qiu, Li Wang, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). EXO: Accelerating Storage Paravirtualization with eBPF. ACM SC 2024.\n\n15. Bo Wang, Shengyun Liu, He Dong, Xiangzhe Wang, Wenbo Xu, Jingjing Zhang, Ping Zhong, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding). Bandle: Asynchronous State Machine Replication Made Efficient. ACM EuroSys 2024.\n\n16. Ruiming Lu, Erci Xu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding), Fengyi Zhu, Zhaosheng Zhu, Mengtian Wang, Zongpeng Zhu, Guangtao Xue, Jiwu Shu, Minglu Li, Jiesheng Wu. Perseus: A Fail-Slow Detection Framework for Cloud Storage Systems. USENIX FAST 2023. Best Paper Award!\n\n17. Menghan Jia, Yiming Zhang (Co-primary and corresponding author), Xinbiao Gan, Dongsheng Li, Ruibo Wang, Kai Lu. vGRAPH: Memory-Efficient Multicore Graph Processing for Traversal-Centric Algorithms. SC 2022.\n\n18. Ruiming Lu, Erci Xu, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding), Zhaosheng Zhu, Mengtian Wang, Zongpeng Zhu, Guangtao Xue, Minglu Li, Jiesheng Wu. NVMe SSD Failures in the Field: the Fail-Stop and the Fail-Slow. USENIX ATC 2022.\n\n19. Xinbiao Gan, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding), Ruigeng Zeng, Jie Liu, Ruibo Wang, Tiejun Li, Li Chen, Kai Lu. XTree: Traversal-Based Partitioning for Extreme-Scale Graph Processing on Supercomputers. IEEE ICDE 2022.\n\n20. Lujia Yin, Li Wang, Yiming Zhang (Corresponding), Yuxing Peng. MapperX: Adaptive Metadata Maintenance for Fast Crash Recovery of DM-Cache Based Hybrid Storage Devices. USENIX ATC 2021.\n\n21. Lujia Yin, Yiming Zhang (Co-primary and corresponding author), Zhaoning Zhang, et al. ParaX: Boosting Deep Learning on Many-Core CPUs. VLDB 2021.\n\n22. Li Wang, Yiming Zhang (Co-primary and corresponding author), Jiawei Xu, Guangtao Xue. MapX: Controlled Data Migration in the Expansion of Decentralized Object-Based Storage Systems. USENIX FAST 2020.\n\n资助项目\n\n部分主持项目\n\n1. 国家重点研发课题，分布式异构内存池化操作系统及关键技术，600万，2022.10至2026.04\n\n2. 国家自然科学基金面上项目，62441220，元宇宙数据的高效能安全存储关键技术研究，50万，2025.01至2025.12\n\n3. 国家自然科学基金面上项目，61772541，面向I/O密集型云虚拟机的多级协同虚拟磁盘服务关键技术研究，66万，2018.01至2021.12\n\n4. 国家自然科学基金面上项目，61379055，面向在线数据密集型应用的高效数据存储与复杂查询关键技术研究，75万元，2014.01至2017.12\n\n5. 华为横向项目，TC20251013039，分基于高速互联总线的高性能池化存储系统技术，88万，2025.11至2026.11\n\n6. 华为横向项目，TC20250108014，高性能NPU存储系统技术，198万，2025.01至2026.12\n\n7. 华为横向项目，TC20260205003，面向混合负载的高效 DiT 推理服务系统优化，96万，2026.04至2027.04\n\n8. 阿里横向项目，72057505，面向模型训练的分布式文件系统I/O加速，60万，2026.05至2027.05\n\n9. 腾讯横向项目，T202603014，面向COS的高性能一致性缓存的关键技术研究，50万，2026.03至2027.03\n\n10. 华为横向项目，TC20241212020-2025-03，推理集群流量调度技术，104万，2025.07至2026.07\n\n11. 华为横向项目，TC20240904004，集群推理分布式分级内存池化技术，129万，2024.10至2025.12\n\n12. 华为横向项目，TC20220808044-2024-01，面向大模型训练的故障容错技术，93万，2024.06至2025.06\n\n13. 华为横向项目，TC20220808044-2023-01，高带宽内存故障分析和发现，103万，2023.06至2024.06\n\n14. 华为横向项目，TC20230620042-02，GPU虚拟化和训练数据预处理加速技术，103万，2023.09至2025.03\n\n15. CCF-华为胡杨林基金，CCF2021-admin-270-202105，面向高速NVMe存储器的blkmq层优化和中断聚合研究，50万，2021.11至2022.12\n\n获奖信息\n\n1.Efficient and Trustworthy Virtual Storage Environments, First Prize (Grand Award) of the China Computer Federation Science and Technology Progress Award (Ranked 1st), Oct. 2021\n\n2.Excellent Doctoral Dissertation Award (Top 10 nationwide), China Computer Federation, Dec. 2010\n\n3.Virtual Computing Environments for Internet Computing, Second Prize of the National Science and Technology Progress Award (Ranked 9th), State Council of the People's Republic of China, Dec. 2012\n\n4.New Mechanisms and Methods for Cybersecurity Detection, First Prize of the Hunan Provincial Natural Science Award (Ranked 5th), Hunan Provincial Department of Science and Technology, May 2018\n\n5.Large-Scale High-Speed Network Routing Simulation Environment, Third Prize of the Military Science and Technology Progress Award (Ranked 1st), General Armaments Department of the People's Liberation Army, Nov. 2013\n\n6.Excellent Doctoral Dissertation Award, Hunan Provincial Department of Education, Dec. 2010\n\n7.HP Outstanding Student Special Excellence Award (Top 12 nationwide), Hewlett-Packard, Sep. 2008\n\n8.First Prize for Outstanding Monograph (Ranked 1st), University Presses in Central South China Region, Jun. 2011\n\n学术服务\n\n1.Program Committee Member, ACM EuroSys 2025\n\n2.Program Committee Member, IEEE ICNP 2024, 2025, 2026\n\n3.Committee Member, EuroSys Roger Needham PhD Award, 2022\n\n4.Program Committee Chair, ChinaSys 2021, China Computer Federation Computer Systems Conference\n\n5.Chair, Big Data and Cloud Storage Forum, CCF Computer Systems Conference, 2021\n\n6.Associate Editor, IEEE Transactions on Computers\n\n7.Associate Editor, IEEE Transactions on Services Computing\n\n8.Chair, Forum for CCF Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Awardees, 2016–2017\n\n9.Committee Member, CCF Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award Committee, 2022\n\n10.Chair, JointCloud Workshop, IEEE ICDCS 2017\n\n11.Chair, LSCA Workshop, IJCNN 2016\n\n12.Program Committee Member, IEEE AAAI 2020\n\n13.Program Committee Member, IEEE ICDCS, 2010, 2017, 2024\n\n14.Program Committee Member, IEEE ICWS, 2017–2022	\N
738c576e-2822-4d3d-ad94-e1598bf2e49b	0cf67af3-a7e5-44d0-b5c6-bcb1b5949a10	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhonghao.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhonghao.html	d549ab8acf106acafbd2e7d989b120a9	2026-10-24 05:31:06.097078+00	200	static	utf-8	850d89f72b120e8435711881f7d35b25	# 钟浩-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n钟浩\n\n研究员\n\n邮箱：zhonghao@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：智能软件与系统研究所\n\n个人简介\n\nI received my Ph.D degree from[Peking University](http://english.pku.edu.cn/) in 2009. My Ph.D dissertation was nominated for the distinguished Ph.D dissertation award of [China Computer Federation](http://www.ccf.org.cn/sites/ccf). My PhD advisor is [Prof. Hong Mei](http://sei.pku.edu.cn/~meih/index_en.html), and was co-advised by [Prof. Lu Zhang](http://sei.pku.edu.cn/~zhanglu/) and [Prof. Tao Xie](http://taoxie.cs.illinois.edu/). After graduation, I joined[Institute of Software, Chinese Academy of Sciences](http://english.is.cas.cn/) as an assistant professor, and was promoted as an associated professor in 2011. From 2012 to 2014, I was a visiting scholar with [University of California, Davis](http://ucdavis.edu/), where I worked with [Prof. Zhendong Su](https://people.inf.ethz.ch/suz/). In 2014, I joined Shanghai Jiao Tong University. I am a recipient of [ACM SIGSOFT Distinguished Paper Award](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/award/asedistinguishedpaper.jpg), [the best paper award of ASE](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/award/asebestpaper.jpg), and [the best paper award of APSEC](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/award/apsecbestpaper.jpg).\n\nPlease refer to my website for details: https://drhaozhong.github.io/\n\n论文发表\n\n- Detecting outdated screenshot from GUI document Ye Tang, Aoyang Yan, Hui Liu, Na Meng, and Hao Zhong ACM Transactions on Software Engineering and Methodology, pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/DOSUD2025.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#DOSUD2025)]\n\n- Incremental learning of code authors over time Siyi Gong and Hao Zhong Journal of Systems & Software, pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/gongjss2025.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#gongjss2025)]\n\n- Programming of automation configuration in smart home systems: challenges and opportunities Sheik Murad Hassan Anik, Xinghua Gao, Hao Zhong, Xiaoyin Wang, and Na Meng ACM Transactions on Software Engineering and Methodology, pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/anik2025smart.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#anik2025smart)]\n\n- Understanding mirror bugs in multiple-language projects Ye Tang, Honghao Chen, Zhixing He and Hao Zhong ACM Transactions on Software Engineering and Methodology, pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/tangmirror.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#tang2025mirror)]\n\n- From bug reports to workarounds: The real-world impact of compiler bugs Zhixing He and Hao Zhong In Proc. International Conference on Software Analysis, Evolution, and Reengineering (SANER), pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/compilerstudy.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#he2025bug)]\n\n- Understanding compiler bugs in real development Hao Zhong In Proc. International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE), pages to appear, 2025. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/understandingbug.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#zhong2025bug)]\n\n- An empirical study on cross-language clone bugs Honghao Chen, Ye Tang, and Hao Zhong In Proc. International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE), poster, pp. 280-281, 2024. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/cross-language.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#chen2024crossclone)] [[Poster](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/poster_mirrorbug.pptx)]\n\n- Compiler-directed migrating API callsite of client code Hao Zhong and Na Meng In Proc. International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE), pp. 2796-2807, 2024. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/libcatch.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#zhong2024libcatch)] [[Slide](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/libcatch.pptx)]\n\n- How do programmers fix bugs as workarounds? An empirical study on Apache projects Aoyang Yan, Hao Zhong, Daohan Song, and Li Jia Empirical Software Engineering, 28(4), 96, 2023. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/workaround_emse.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#yan2023empirical)]\n\n- An empirical study on API usages from code search engine and local library Hao Zhong and Xiaoyin Wang Empirical Software Engineering, 28(3), 63, 2023. [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/newapi.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#zhong2023empirical)]\n\n- FUNOff: Offloading applications at function granularity for mobile edge computing Xing Chen, Ming Li, Hao Zhong, Xiaona Chen, Yun Ma and Ching-Hsien Hsu IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing, to appear, 2023 [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/funoff.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/pubbib.html#chen2023tmc)]\n\n- Which exception shall we throw? Hao Zhong In Proc. International Conference on Automated Software Engineering (ASE), no. 116, pp. 1-12, 2022 [[pdf](https://cs.sjtu.edu.cn/~zhonghao/paper/whichexception.pdf)] [[BibTeX](https://cs.sj