61baf9a7-913b-4a49-b9bb-39edad630e90	5ae005fc-5f95-459f-8b53-99ba110bbdd3	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangqian.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangqian.html	960e0099baeb89e73575cb1748d6eafb	2026-10-24 05:39:02.182193+00	200	static	utf-8	b28c2dc6e5254930adbf60812d3c70e4	# 张谦-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n张谦\n\n副研究员\n\n邮箱：qwert3472@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：软件学院5313\n\n所在研究所：交叉前沿研究所\n\n个人简介\n\n上海交通大学计算机学院副研究员、博士生导师。主要研究方向为物联网、普适计算和无线感知。成果发表在Ubicomp/IMWUT、CHI、TMC、Sensys、Percom等国际高水平会议和期刊，获CHI 2025 Honorable Mention Awards、SECON 2019最佳论文runner-up奖及华为Explore X人才资助。\n\n教育背景\n\n上海交通大学 博士 2020\n上海交通大学 硕士 2015\n西北工业大学 本科 2011\n\n工作履历\n\n2025.1至今 上海交通大学 副研究员\n\n2022.11-2024.12 上海交通大学 助理研究员\n\n2020.4-2022.10 上海交通大学 博士后\n\n教授课程\n\nSE3302智能平台设计及实现（本科）\n\nSE3303 数据挖掘与大数据分析（本科）\n\nEI 8702 物联网技术（研究生）\n\n论文发表\n\n- Kaiyi Guo, Tianyu Wu, Yang Gao, Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, EchoTouch: Low-power Face-touching Behavior Recognition Using Active Acoustic Sensing on Glasses, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2025 (CCF-A).\n\n- Kaiyi Guo, Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, EchoExpress: Facial Expression Recognition in the Wild via Acoustic Sensing on Smart Glasses, IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing 2025 (CCF-A).\n\n- Kaiyi Guo, Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, EchoBreath: Continuous Respiratory Behavior Recognition in the Wild via Acoustic Sensing on Smart Glasses, CHI 2025 (CCF-A) (Honorable Mention Awards).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Kaiyi Guo, Yifei Yang, Dong Wang, WearSE: Enabling Streaming Speech Enhancement on Eyewear Using Acoustic Sensing, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2025 (CCF-A).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Ke Liu, Dong Wang, Sensing to hear through memory: Ultrasound speech enhancement without real ultrasound signals, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2024 (CCF-A).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Yubin Lan, Kaiyi Guo, Dong Wang, Lipwatch: Enabling Silent Speech Recognition on Smartwatches using Acoustic Sensing, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2024 (CCF-A).\n\n- Ahsan Jamal Akbar, Zhiyao Sheng, Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, Cross-Domain Gesture Sequence Recognition for Two-Player Exergames using COTS mmWave Rada, ISS 2023 (CCF-B).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Jiazhen Jing, Run Zhao, Dong Wang, WearSign: Pushing the Limit of Sign Language Translation Using Wearables, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2022 (CCF-A).\n\n- Zhiyao Sheng, Huatao Xu, Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, Facilitating radar-based gesture recognition with self-supervised learning, SECON 2022 (CCF-B).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, Run Zhao, Yinggang Yu, SoundLip: Enabling Word and Sentencelevel Lip Interaction for Smart Devices, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2021 (CCF-A).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, Run Zhao, Yinggang Yu, Junjie Shen, Sensing to Hear: Speech Enhancement for Mobile Devices Using Acoustic Signals, IMWUT/Ubicomp 2021 (CCF-A).\n\n- Qian Zhang, Dong Wang, Run Zhao, Yinggang Yu, Jiazhen Jing, Write, Atend and Spell:Streaming End-to-end Free-style Handwriting Recognition Using Smartwatches, IMWUT/Ubicomp2021 (CCF-A).\n\n- Run Zhao, Dong Wang, Qian Zhang, Xueyi Jin, Ke Liu, Smartphone-based handwritten signature verification using acoustic signals, ISS 2021 (CCF-B).\n\n资助项目\n\n国家自然科学基金青年项目（No. 62102245），“基于超声波唇动感知的语音增强方法研究”，2022.1-2024.12\n\n获奖信息\n\nCHI 2025 最佳论文提名\n\nSECON 2019 最佳论文提名\n\n学术服务\n\nReviewer：IMWUT/Ubicomp， SIGGRAPH， CHI	\N
