a125f6da-3d45-4ff2-99c4-fc5b76c1fd5b	7a12f2c1-3937-44bc-a809-b7e80aea67b2	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dingjiaxin.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dingjiaxin.html	107ae0fa10b2ebe2ba9cb0374e07530b	2026-10-24 05:39:35.226372+00	200	static	utf-8	a2295ecea80aaaa6eaf77b2f565217af	# 丁家昕-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n丁家昕\n\n长聘副教授\n\n邮箱：jiaxinding@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n地址：东川路800号电院群楼1号楼435\n\n所在研究所：约翰·霍普克罗夫特计算机科学中心\n\n个人主页：[https://jhc.sjtu.edu.cn/~jiaxinding/](https://jhc.sjtu.edu.cn/~jiaxinding/)\n\n个人简介\n\n丁家昕，现为上海交通大学John Hopcroft中心长聘副教授，博士生导师。2018年博士毕业于纽约州立大学石溪分校，2012年本科毕业于北京大学；2019年在加州大学戴维斯分校进行博士后研究，2019年12月加入上海交通大学。主要研究领域包括数据关联与知识推理、领域世界模型与约束强化学习。每年招收计算机和通信工程方向博士与硕士，欢迎对相关方向有兴趣的同学联系。\n\n教育背景\n\n2012.8～2018.12 纽约州立大学石溪分校 计算机科学与技术 博士研究生\n\n2008.9～2012.7 北京大学 智能科学与技术 大学本科\n\n- ####\n\n工作履历\n\n2026至今 上海交通大学 计算机学院 长聘副教授\n\n2023～2025 上海交通大学 计算机学院 长聘教轨副教授\n\n2020～2022 上海交通大学 计算机学院 助理教授\n\n2019.1～2019.12 加州大学戴维斯分校 博士后\n\n教授课程\n\n《数据科学基础》2022春、2023春、2024春、2025春、2026春\n\n《数据结构》2021春、2022春、2023春、2024秋\n\n《大数据处理》2020秋\n\n论文发表\n\nGao, Shiqing; Ding, Jiaxin#; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Controlling Underestimation Bias in Constrained Reinforcement Learning for Safe Exploration; Proceedings of the Forty-second International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML 2025, Oral)\n\nGao, Shiqing; Zhou, Yihang; Shao, Shuai; Luo, Haoyu; Bing, Yiheng; Ding, Jiaxin#; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Extreme Value Policy Optimization for Safe Reinforcement Learning; Proceedings of the Forty-second International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML 2025)\n\nXin, Cheng*; Xu, Fan*; Ding, Xin; Gao, Jie; Ding, Jiaxin#; TopInG: Topologically Interpretable Graph Learning via Persistent Rationale Filtration; Proceedings of the Forty-second International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML 2025)\n\nJi, Huawei; Deng, Cheng; Xue, Bo; Jin, Zhouyang; Ding, Jiaxin#; Gan, Xiaoying; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Zhou, Chenghu; AceParse: A Comprehensive Dataset with Diverse Structured Texts for Academic Literature Parsing; 2025 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP 2025)\n\nWu, Kailong; Xie, Yule; Ding, Jiaxin#; Ren, Yuxiang; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Zhou, Chenghu; Characterizing the Influence of Topology on Graph Learning Task; International Conference on Database Systems for Advanced Applications (DASFAA 2024)\n\nGao, Shiqing; Ding, Jiaxin#; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Zhou, Chenghu; Exterior penalty policy optimization with penalty metric network under constraints; Proceedings of the Thirty-Third International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI 2024)\n\nHan, Haochen; Yang, Shuaiyu; Ding, Jiaxin#; Fu, Luoyi; Wang, Xinbing; Zhou, Chenghu; Adversarial Reconstruction of Trajectories: Privacy Risks and Attack Models in Trajectory Embedding Proceedings of the 32nd ACM International Conference on Advances in Geographic Information Systems (SIGSPATIAL 2024)\n\n资助项目\n\n国家自然科学基金重大研究计划培育项目，主持\n\n国家自然科学基金青年项目，主持\n\n上海市科委面上项目，主持\n\n上海市青年科技英才扬帆计划，主持\n\n科技部重点研发计划，子课题负责人\n\n学术服务\n\nSIGSPATIAL中国分会执行委员\n\n中国中文信息学会语言与知识计算专委会执行委员\n\nACM MobiHoc 2021出版主席	\N
9731a57a-f8d7-4aac-8e8d-9ed69e928181	72f1439c-3a72-49df-b556-cebc1993e2f3	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huangtao.html	https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/huangtao.html	5aac8de3170059c756438bdfbe417858	2026-10-24 05:39:53.544113+00	200	static	utf-8	9bead20a75ed53e9b9a1b7bf0c14c9b5	# 黄涛-上海交通大学计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）\n\n[使用jAccount登录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/user/jaccount_login.html)\n\n[English](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/en)\n\n师资队伍\n\n- ## [教师名录](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml.html)\n\n- ## [院士学者](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/lyys.html)\n\n- ## [国家级人才](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/gjjrc.html)\n\n- ## [兼职和双聘教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jzhesp.html)\n\n- ## [退休教师](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/txjiaoshi.html)\n\n- ## [人才招聘](https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/rczp.html)\n\n教师名录\n\n黄涛\n\n助理教授\n\n邮箱：t.huang@sjtu.edu.cn\n\n所在研究所：约翰·霍普克罗夫特计算机科学中心\n\n个人主页：[https://taohuang.info](https://taohuang.info)\n\n个人简介\n\n黄涛现为上海交通大学长聘教轨助理教授、博导，主要研究方向包括高效深度学习、多模态大模型、具身智能等，相关研究成果发表至TPAMI、NeurIPS、ICML、ICLR、CVPR、ECCV、AAAI等人工智能、计算机视觉期刊会议中。\n\n教育背景\n\n- 2022.07~2025.02，悉尼大学，计算机科学，博士\n\n- 2016.09~2020.06，华中科技大学，计算机科学与技术，学士\n\n工作履历\n\n- 2025.03 至今，John Hopcroft计算机科学中心，长聘教轨助理教授\n\n- 2020.07~2022.05，商汤科技，算法研究员\n\n教授课程\n\n2026春季学期，CS3317-B，人工智能\n\n2026秋季学期，CS1601，计算导论\n\n论文发表\n\n以第一作者发表论文：\n\n[1] Tao Huang, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Chang Xu. "DIST+: Knowledge Distillation From a Stronger Adaptive Teacher". IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, vol. 47, no. 7, pp. 5571-5585, July 2025, doi: 10.1109/TPAMI.2025.3554235. [TPAMI]\n\n[2] Tao Huang, Yanxiang Ma, Shan You, Chang Xu. "Learning Mask Invariant Mutual Information for Masked Image Modeling". The Thirteenth International Conference on Learning Representations, 2025. [ICLR]\n\n[3] Tao Huang, Xiaohuan Pei, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Chang Xu. "LocalMamba: Visual State Space Model with Windowed Selective Scan". In European Conference on Computer Vision, pp. 12-22. Springer, Cham, 2025. [ECCVW]\n\n[4] Tao Huang, Jiaqi Liu, Shan You, Chang Xu. "Active Generation for Image Classification". In European Conference on Computer Vision, pp. 270-286. Cham: Springer Nature Switzerland, 2024. [ECCV]\n\n[5] Tao Huang, Yuan Zhang, Mingkai Zheng, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, and Chang Xu. "Knowledge diffusion for distillation". In Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems, volume 36, pages 65299–65316. Curran Associates, Inc., 2023. [NeurIPS]\n\n[6] Tao Huang, Yuan Zhang, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Jian Cao, and Chang Xu. "Masked distillation with receptive tokens". In The Eleventh International Conference on Learning Representations, 2023. [ICLR]\n\n[7] Tao Huang, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, and Chang Xu. "Knowledge distillation from a stronger teacher". In Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems, volume 35, pages 33716–33727. Curran Associates, Inc., 2022. [NeurIPS]\n\n[8] Tao Huang, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Changshui Zhang, Xiaogang Wang, and Chang Xu. "Greedynasv2: greedier search with a greedy path filter". In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, pages 11902–11911, 2022. [CVPR]\n\n[9] Tao Huang, Shan You, Bohan Zhang, Yuxuan Du, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, and Chang Xu. Dyrep: bootstrapping training with dynamic re-parameterization. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF conference on computer vision and pattern recognition, pages 588–597, 2022. [CVPR]\n\n[10] Tao Huang, Zekang Li, Hua Lu, Yong Shan, Shusheng Yang, Yang Feng, Fei Wang, Shan You, Chang Xu. "Relational Surrogate Loss Learning". In The Sixteenth International Conference on Learning Representations, 2022. [ICLR]\n\n[11] Fengnian Zhang*, Tao Huang*, Siyu Xu, Zhong Jin, Chang Xu. "Revisiting Parameter Redundancy in Vision-Language-Action Models: Insights from VLM-to-VLA Adaptation". European Conference on Computer Vision. 2026. [ECCV]\n\n[12] Xiaohuan Pei*, Tao Huang*, and Chang Xu. "Efficientvmamba: Atrous selective scan for light weight visual mamba." In Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, vol. 39, no. 6, pp. 6443-6451. 2025. [AAAI]\n\n[13] Xiu Su*, Tao Huang*, Yanxi Li, Shan You, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Changshui Zhang, Chang Xu. "Prioritized architecture sampling with monto-carlo tree search".\n\nIn Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, pp. 10968-10977. 2021. [CVPR]\n\n[14] Shan You*, Tao Huang*, Mingmin Yang*, Fei Wang, Chen Qian, Changshui Zhang. "Greedynas: Towards fast one-shot nas with greedy supernet." In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, pp. 1999-2008. 2020. [CVPR]\n\n完整论文列表：https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=jkcRdBgAAAAJ&hl=en\n\n资助项目\n\n- 国家自然科学基金青年科学基金项目（C类），“高效可控的视觉自回归生成方法研究”\n\n- 上海市海外高层次人才计划\n\n- 上海交通大学Explore X基金项目\n\n学术服务\n\n- Area Chair: NeurIPS, ICLR, AAAI\n\n- Reviewer of Conferences: NeurIPS, ICLR, ICML, CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, AAAI, ACM MM, etc.\n\n- Reviewer of Journals: TPAMI, IJCV, TNNLS, TIP, TMLR, etc.	\N
